<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ISA" style="id" />
  <para style="h">ICAYA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk pa Icaya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Icaya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ica</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk pa</para>
  <para style="mt1">ICAYA</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Buk pa Icaya </char> obedo buk ma lanebi Icaya ocoyo. Lanebi Icaya okwo i kine ka mwaka 750 nio kwede i 700 nono i mwaka ma onongo peya kinywalo Yecu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Buk man kipoko iye i dul adek mapatpat.</para>
  <para style="ip">(1) Cura 1—39 tito kare ma Juda, ma en aye ker me kupiny pa jo pa Lubanga, tye ki lworo ikom Aciria. Lanebi Icaya onongo oneno ni peko pa jo Juda pe obedo jo Aciria ento obedo bal ma jo Juda gitimo, en aye bedo ludingo pe me winyo lok pa Lubanga ki bedo ki gen manok ikom Lubanga. I loke ki tic manen kamaleng, lanebi Icaya olego lutela ki lwak me bedo ki kwo maber dok ni gutii ki ada ento ka gukwero ci can ki bale pa lobogi aye dong odong ma Lubanga bikelo ikomgi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Icaya bene owaco kamaleng ni kare bibino ma kuc bibedo tye iwi lobo ducu dok lakwar Daudi aye bibedo rwot ma kite atir.</para>
  <para style="ip">(2) Cura 40—55 loko pi kare ma jo mapol me Juda onongo gitye i lobo Babilon ma onongo kidiyogi dok gin onongo peke ki gen mo. Lanebi owaco kamaleng ni Lubanga bigonyo jone dok dwokogi cen paco i Jerucalem wek gucak kwo manyen.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wilok madit ma i cura magi en aye ni Lubanga aye Rwot maloyo gin ma time ikwo pa dano, dok yube pi jone kwako cwalo kwenane iwi lobo ducu, wek gunong gum kun a ki bot jo Icrael.</para>
  <para style="ip">Dul coc ikom “Latic pa Rwot” tye ikin dul coc ma ngene tutwal i buk me Cik Macon.</para>
  <para style="ip">(3) Cura 56—66 pole loko pi kare ma dong jo pa Lubanga gudwogo i Jerucalem ma dong gimito lok me cuku cwinygi ni Lubanga bicobo cikene bot jone. Lok ma pire tek en aye lubu gin ma atir, ngolo kop kakare, gwoko ceng Cabit, miyo tyer bot Lubanga ki lok me lega. Dul lok ma ngene tutwal tye i cura 61:1-2, ma Yecu otiyo kwede ikare ma en cako tice.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Miyo ngec ki cike mapatpat <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 1:1-12:6">1:1—12:6</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Miyo pwod ki rok mapatpat <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 13:1-23:18">13:1—23:18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ngolo kop pa Lubanga ikom lobo ducu <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 24:1-27:13">24:1—27:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ajuk pa Rwot ki cike mukene <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 28:1-35:10">28:1—35:10</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Rwot Kejekia me Juda ki jo Aciria <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 36:1-39:8">36:1—39:8</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kwena me cike ki me bedo ki gen <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 40:1-55:13">40:1—55:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ajuk pa Rwot ki cike <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 56:1-66:24">56:1—66:24</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ISA 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 15:1-7">2 Luk 15:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 16:20">16:20</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18:1-20:21">18:1—20:21</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 26:1-23">2 Tek 26:1-23</ref></char>
    </note>Man aye lok ma Lubanga onyutu bot Icaya wod pa Amoj mukemo Juda ki Jerucalem ikare me loc pa Ujia, Yocam, Akaj ki Kejekia ma gubedo luker me Juda.<verse eid="ISA 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lubanga ojuku jone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 1:2" />Lubanga owaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:2">“In polo ki lobo kong wuter itwu wuwiny.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:2">Lutinona ma apitogi ma gudongo mabeconi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:2">dong gujemo woko ikoma.<verse eid="ISA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 1:3" />Twon ngeyo rwode,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:3">kana ngeyo kama rwode miye iye cam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:3">ento Icrael pe ngeya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:3">lwaka pe giniang.<verse eid="ISA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 1:4" />Oii, rok ma lubalo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:4">jo ma bal onurugi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:4">likwayo pa lutim tim maracu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:4">lutino ma kitgi dong obale woko!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:4">Dong gubwoto Rwot woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:4">gicayo Ngat Maleng me Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:4">gupoke kweda gudok woko cen adada.<verse eid="ISA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 1:5" />Pingo pud dok wumito ni kimede ki goyowu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:5">Pingo wumede ameda ki jemo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:5">Wunen bur dong oromo wiwu woko ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:5">cwinywu bene dong odoko goro.<verse eid="ISA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 1:6" />Cake ki ipar tyenwu nio kwede wa iwiwu malo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:6">kamo maber peke kadi ki acel;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:6">ret ki bur dwong iye ata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:6">ma wang ret mogo bene remone pud tye kacwer acwera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:6">pe kibiyo tut ki iwang bur, dok bene pe kitweyo wang ret,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:6">pe bene kibido wang bur ki moo.<verse eid="ISA 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 1:7" />Lobowu odong nono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:7">taunwu madito ducu dong kiwango woko ki mac;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:7">lurok gumayo lobowu woko ma wun bene wuneno,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:7">lobowu odong nono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:7">rom ki lobo ma lurok guyako.<verse eid="ISA 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 1:8" />Guweko Jerucalem odong</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:8">calo bolo ma kiweko i poto olok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:8">dok calo obot ma kiweko i poto okono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:8">calo taun madit ma lumony dong gutyeko rumune woko.<verse eid="ISA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 1:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 19:24">Aca 19:24</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:29">Rom 9:29</ref></char>
    </note>Kono nene Rwot me mony pe oweko dano mogo gudong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:9">kono onongo wabedo calo Codom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:9">kono dong wadoko calo Gomora.<verse eid="ISA 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 1:10" />Wuwiny lok pa Rwot, wun jo Jerucalem ki luloc matye iye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:10">Wuter itwu wuwiny pwony pa Lubangawa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:10">wek pe wubed calo jo Gomora ki Codom!<verse eid="ISA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 1:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 5:21-22">Amo 5:21-22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gitumwu ma wutyero mapol kit menoni kono konye ngo ki bota? Man Rwot aye owaco.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:11">Nyogi romiwu ma wutyero me gitum awangani dong oroma woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:11">kacel ki moo dwolo me limwu makwo ma gucwene;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:11">cwinya pe mito remo twoni, kadi remo nyogi romi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:11">nyo remo nyogi dyegi.<verse eid="ISA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 1:12" />Ka wubino kawora, anga ma olegowu kono ni wukel lwak gityerwu bota?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:12">Anga ma owaco botwu kono ni wunyon dyekala?<verse eid="ISA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 1:13" />Pe wumede ki kela gitum ma konygi peke bota,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:13">yito odok eceta ma ngwece kur odoko gin me kwer mada ki tung bota.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:13">Karama me Por Dwe, ceng Cabit, ki lwongo dano i cokewu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:13">ducu dong opong ki balwu keken.<verse eid="ISA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 1:14" />Karama me Por Dwe mewu ki ninowu madito</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:14">mayam kiciko pirgi, gin ducu cwinya daggi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:14">gudoko ter mapek tutwal bota, aol woko dong ki tingogi.<verse eid="ISA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 1:15" />Ka wutango cingwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:15">abiumu wanga woko pe anenowu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:15">kadi bed wulega tyen mapol ata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:15">pe abiwinyo legawu wa ki acel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:15">pien cingwu obedo remo keken.<verse eid="ISA 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 1:16" />Kong wulwoke woko, wubed maleng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:16">wubol timwu maracu woko cen kamabor</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:16">wek pe dok obed kanen inyima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:16">wuwek dong timo gin marac,<verse eid="ISA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 1:17" />wupwonye me timo gin maber.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:17">Wulub ngolo kop atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:17">wukony jo ma kiunugi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:17">wular lutino ma won gi peke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:17">dok wupid pi mon ma coggi oto.<verse eid="ISA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 1:18" />Wubin kong kombedi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:18">wek walar lok kacel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:18">kadi bed dong balwu kwar marom mene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:18">bidoko matar calo pee;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:18">kadi bed kwar calo pala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:18">bidoko calo yer romo matar.<verse eid="ISA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 1:19" />Kace wuye winyo loka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:19">ci wubicamo gin mabeco ma cek ki i lobo.<verse eid="ISA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 1:20" />Ento ka wukwero kun wujemo woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:20">ci pala lucwan bityekowu woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:20">man Rwot kikome aye ma owaco.<verse eid="ISA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Taun Madit ma opong ki bal keken</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 1:21" />Taun madit mayam kigeno dong odoko malaya adada!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:21">En mayam ngolo kop ma atir tye iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:21">kit ma atir bene onongo tye iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:21">ento kombedi dong opong ki nek keken.<verse eid="ISA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 1:22" />Jerucalem, yam onongo irom ki ryal maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:22">ento kombedi dong itye calo cet ryal;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:22">yam onongo itye calo kongo bwino maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:22">ento kombedi dong ii opong ki pii keken.<verse eid="ISA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 1:23" />Rwodiwu ducu dong gudoko lujemo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:23">gudoko bene lurem lukwo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:23">Dano acel acel ki ikin gi maro lim me wil i mung,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:23">cwinygi tye mere me nongo camucana keken.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:23">Pe giparo pi lutino kic,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:23">pido pa mon ma coggi oto pe o inyimgi.<verse eid="ISA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 1:24" />Meno omiyo Rwot, ma en Rwot me mony,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:24">Rwot ma en Won Twer me Icrael, owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:24">‘Abiculu kwor ikom lukwora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:24">ci dong pe gibimiya abarwic.<verse eid="ISA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 1:25" />Abiloke dok alwenyo ikomgi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:25">abitwako cet ryalwu ducu, abiliyo woko maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:25">abigwaro kit rac mo woko liweng ki ikomwu.<verse eid="ISA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 1:26" />Abidwoko lungolkopwu gibedo kit macalo yam tye con,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:26">ki jo mamiyo tam botwu bene bibedo kit macalo yam tye wi atii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:26">Lacen kibilwongi ni in taun madit ma kite atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:26">taun madit ma gene.’<verse eid="ISA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 1:27" />Kibikoko Cion ki ngolo kop atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:27">jo ma bedo iye ma gingut kibikokogi pi kit ma atir.<verse eid="ISA 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 1:28" />Ento jo ma lujemo ki lubalo kibinekogi woko kacel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:28">ki jo ma obwoto Rwot woko, gibityekogi woko liweng.<verse eid="ISA 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 1:29" />Pien lewic bimakowu pi yadi kworo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:29">mayam wugungu piny ka worogini;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:29">alee bitwodowu pi poti mayam wucito iye kaworo.<verse eid="ISA 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 1:30" />Pien wubidoko macalo yat kworo ma pote oner woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:30">dok bene macalo poto ma pii peke iye.<verse eid="ISA 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 1:31" />Dano matek bidoko calo lum mutwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:31">ma wang ka mac ogudu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:31">ki tice bene bibedo calo mac ma mwoc kire malo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:31">ci gin aryo ducu gibiwang kacel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:31">kun nongo pe dok tye ngat mo ma neko mac ki ikomgi.”<verse eid="ISA 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ISA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot biloyo lobo ducu ki kuc</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MIC 4:1-3">Mik 4:1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 2:1" />Man aye lok ma, Lubanga onyutu bot Icaya wod pa Amoj mukemo Juda ki Jerucalem.<verse eid="ISA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 2:2" />Ikare me anyim</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:2">got kama Ot pa Rwot ocung iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:2">bibedo got mabor makato godi ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:2">bore bikato cere ducu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:2">dok rok ducu bimol cito iye.<verse eid="ISA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 2:3" />Lwak lurok mapol gibibino ci gibiwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:3">“Wubin, wek wacitu iwi got pa Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:3">i Ot pa Lubanga pa Yakobo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:3">wek en opwonywa gin ma en mito ni watii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:3">ka wek walub yo mere.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:3">Pien cik bia ki i Cion,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:3">lok pa Rwot bia ki i Jerucalem.<verse eid="ISA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 2:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 3:10">Joe 3:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>En bingolo kop ikin rok mapol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:4">dok bingolo kop pa lwak rok mapol;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:4">gibiteto pala lucwan gi doko lak kweri dyang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:4">ki tongigi doko pala me ngolo jang olok;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:4">rok mo pe bilweny ki rok wadigi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:4">pe dong gibimede ki pwonyo lweny.<verse eid="ISA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 2:5" />Wun jo me ot pa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:5">wubin wacitu kun ceng pa Rwot ryeny menyowa.<verse eid="ISA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot bingolo kop ikom jo ma wake</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 2:6" />Pien in Rwot iweko lwaki woko ata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:6">ibwoto jo me ot pa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:6">pien lutyet ma gua tung kunyango gupong iye mada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:6">ki lukota macalo jo Piliciti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:6">gitye ka tudu wat ki lurok.<verse eid="ISA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 2:7" />Lobogi opong ki ryal ki jabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:7">lonyogi pe twero tum;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:7">aguragura bene dwong tutwal i lobogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:7">gadigadi lwenygi bene pe twero tum.<verse eid="ISA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 2:8" />Cal jogi dwong i lobogi tutwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:8">giworo tic ma gutiyo ki cinggi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:8">gin ma gutiyo pirgi ken gi ki cinggi.<verse eid="ISA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 2:9" />Ma omiyo dano dong tye ki lewic,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:9">dano acel acel rwome odok piny adada;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:9">pe itim kica botgi pi bal man!<verse eid="ISA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 2:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 6:15">Niy 6:15</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 1:9">2 Tec 1:9</ref></char>
    </note>Dony i boro got,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:10">ci ikane woko i apwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:10">pi twon lworo madit ikom Rwot ki pi ringo deyo me dite.<verse eid="ISA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 2:11" />Kibijuku wake pa dano woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:11">ki buta pa dano bikwe woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:11">Ci Rwot keken aye kibipako inino meno.<verse eid="ISA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 2:12" />Inino meno Rwot me mony bijuku wake ki lyere, pa jo ducu ma gin tye i rwom ma malo, ma giwake.<verse eid="ISA 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 2:13" />En bityeko yadi cedar ducu me Lebanon maboco ki matye malo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:13">ki yadi kworo ducu me Bacan.<verse eid="ISA 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 2:14" />En biyaro wi godi ducu ma gucung likung wa malo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:14">ki lobo ducu ma obedo cerecere,<verse eid="ISA 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 2:15" />ki gedo ducu ma bocoboco,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:15">ki cel me gang ducu ma kigero matek;<verse eid="ISA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 2:16" />ki mel ducu me Tarcic,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:16">wa ki yeya ducu ma gibeco me anena.<verse eid="ISA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 2:17" />Kibijuku wake pa dano woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:17">ci wake pa dano acel acel bikwe woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:17">Kibipako Rwot keken inino meno.<verse eid="ISA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 2:18" />Cal jogi ducu kibijwero woko.<verse eid="ISA 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 2:19" />Dano bidonyo i boro got ki i bur ma kikwinyo i ngom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:19">pi lworo Rwot ki pi ringo deyo me dite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:19">ka en bia malo kun ryango kom jo ma bedo i lobo.<verse eid="ISA 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 2:20" />Inino meno cal jogi me ryal ki me jabu ma dano gutiyo me aworagi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:20">kibibolo woko bot buyu ki bot olik,<verse eid="ISA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 2:21" />ci gibidonyo ii got ma obar,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:21">ki ikin got ma okak atata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:21">pi twon lworo madit ikom Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:21">ki pi ringo deyo me dite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:21">ka en bia malo karyango kom jo ma bedo i lobo.<verse eid="ISA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 2:22" />Pe i ket geni ikom dano ma yweyo tye i umeni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:22">Dano kono konyo ango?<verse eid="ISA 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ISA 3" />
  <para style="s1">Arubaruba i Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 3:1" />Kong inen kombedi, Rwot ma en Rwot me mony,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:1">dong tye ka kwanyo woko ki bot Jerucalem ki jo Juda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:1">gin ducu ki dano ducu mayam kwogi ocung iye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:1">en bikwanyo cam ducu ma kwogi jenge iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:1">ki pii bene ma kwogi ojenge iye.<verse eid="ISA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 3:2" />En tye kakwanyo oteka lwenygi ki monygi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:2">lungolkop ki lunebi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:2">lutyet ki ludito ma otegi,<verse eid="ISA 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 3:3" />lutel wi jo pyere abic</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:3">ki jo me awora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:3">lumiitam ki lutyet maryek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:3">ki luryeko ma gitiyo ki lwit me gwoko kom.<verse eid="ISA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 3:4" />Rwot bimiyo bulu aye bedo rwodigi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:4">lutino matino aye ma biloyogi.<verse eid="ISA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 3:5" />Dano gibibedo ka une keken gi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:5">kun ngat man unu lawote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:5">dano acel acel unu wadigi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:5">awobi binywaro ladit ma otegi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:5">labong ata binywaro dano ma kiworo.<verse eid="ISA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 3:6" />Inino meno dano bimako omine</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:6">ma i ot pa wone, ci biwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:6">“In itye ki bongo me aruka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:6">in aye dong ibibedo ka loyowa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:6">wi obur man bibedo ite loci.”<verse eid="ISA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 3:7" />Inino meno en bilok kun waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:7">“An gira pe abibedo lakony dano;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:7">kwon ki bongo pe i oda;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:7">pe wubiketa me bedo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:7">ngat maloyo lwak.”<verse eid="ISA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 3:8" />Pien jo me Jerucalem dong gitye kacato,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:8">jo me Juda dong gitye kapoto mere woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:8">pien lok ma giloko ki gin ma gitimo kelo akemo pa Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:8">gujemo woko ikome dok gubalo deyone woko.<verse eid="ISA 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 3:9" />Kitgi ma ginen kwede ikin dano aye bibedo caden ikomgi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:9">ginyutu balgi woko kamaleng calo Codom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:9">ma gitimo atyer.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:9">Can iwigi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:9">Pien gin aye ma gukelo can ikomgi ken gi.<verse eid="ISA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 3:10" />Wutit bot jo ma kitgi atir ni gibibedo maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:10">pien gibilimo gum pi adwogi me gin maber ma gutimo.<verse eid="ISA 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 3:11" />Can bipoto ikom jo maracu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:11">Can ma bipoto ikomgi bibedo marac mukato kare;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:11">pien gin ma cinggi otimo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:11">en aye bene ma gibitimo ikomgi.<verse eid="ISA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 3:12" />Lutino gitye ka unu lwaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:12">lwaka kombedi dong gitye ite loc pa mon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:12">Wun lwaka, lutelwu tye ka rwenyowu arwenya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:12">gitye kangakowu woko ki i yo ma myero wuwot iye.<verse eid="ISA 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot bingolo kop ikom jone</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 3:13" />Rwot dong obino woko ka pido,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:13">en ocung kangolo kop ikom lwake.<verse eid="ISA 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 3:14" />Rwot dong oyabo pido woko ikom lwake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:14">ocako pido ki ludongo pa lwake ki rwodigi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:14">En owaco ni, “Wun ki komwu aye ma wucamo poto olok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:14">jami ma wuyako ki bot lucan tye i odiwu.<verse eid="ISA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 3:15" />Wunginyo lwaka woko kono pingo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:15">kun wutimo lucan malit kuman?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:15">Man lok pa Rwot Lubanga me mony kikome.<verse eid="ISA 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok me juk ikom mon me Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 3:16" />Rwot owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:16">“Pien anyira me Cion giwake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:16">giwoto ni cwatacwata ma gutono ngutgi atona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:16">kun gineno dano ki wang me kwele,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:16">ginyedo wot anyeda ki wi tyen gi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:16">kun gara ma ityen gi yenge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:16">ma kok malongo.<verse eid="ISA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 3:17" />Pimeno, Rwot bimiyo wi anyira Cion toke woko doko bur.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:17">Rwot bimiyo komgi me mon nen kamaleng.”<verse eid="ISA 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 3:18" />Inino meno Rwot bikwanyo atego me tyen monwu mabeconi woko ki tiko ma kirubu me tur nyimgi, mola me cal dwe, <verse eid="ISA 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 3:19" />mola ngut maryeny aryenya, atego ngut cing, kitambara me adwala i ngut; <verse eid="ISA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 3:20" />bongigi me atweya iwic, ogul me bad, del me tweyo pyer, cupa moo me wir; lwit ma kitweyo me gwoko kom, <verse eid="ISA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 3:21" />agit cing, agit ma kirwako i um, <verse eid="ISA 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 3:22" />bongigi mabeco ma kiruku inino madito, gomci, bongi me umegi, ki kicaa me cing, <verse eid="ISA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 3:23" />ginaruka mogo ma mareprep, bongi camanini, kitambara ma kidwalo iwic ki kitambara me gengo wang.<verse eid="ISA 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 3:24" />Ma ka moo ma ngwece kur bibedo gin ma okwok;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:24">ma ka del me tweyo pyer bibedo tol;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:24">ma ka yer ma kikedo akeda maber wigi bital woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:24">ma ka ruku bongi mogo me wel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:24">kibitweyo bongo cola aye i pyergi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:24">ma ka nen ma mwonya, gibibedo ki lewic.<verse eid="ISA 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 3:25" />Kibineko cogwu woko ki pala lucwan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:25">co ma gin oteka lwenywu gibito i mony.<verse eid="ISA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 3:26" />Kumu ki koko me can biwinye i dog cel me Cion;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:26">bibedo calo dako ma kiyako jamine woko ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:26">ma obedo piny i ngom munero.<verse eid="ISA 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ISA 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 4:1" />Inino meno mon abiro gibipoto ikom laco acel kun gimake woko liking ma giwace ni, “Wan giwa wabicamo camwa dok bene wabiyenyo ginarukawa ki komwa, ento in myero itim ber iwek walwongi ni in ibedo cogwa; wek okwany lewic woko ki iwiwa ni pe kinyomowa.”<verse eid="ISA 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Deyo pa Jerucalem ikare me anyim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 4:2" />Inino meno ginapita ma Rwot omiyo olot odongo bibedo maber kun bene nongo tye ki deyone; gin ma ocek i lobo bimiyo jo Icrael ma obwot gibiwake kun bene nongo gitye ki deyo. <verse eid="ISA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 4:3" />Jo ma odong i Jerucalem kibilwongogi ni jo maleng, gin aye jo ma Lubanga dong ocoyo nyinggi ni myero gubed kwo i Jerucalem. <verse eid="ISA 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 4:4" />Ikare meno Rwot ki twerone, bingolo kop atir, kun nongo dong otyeko lonyo jone ki lwoko remo me bal ducu ma oo idye Jerucalem. <verse eid="ISA 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:21">Nia 13:21</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 24:16">24:16</ref></char></note>Ci Rwot dong biketo pol i dyeceng, ki yito me mac ma caro piny i dyewor, i kabedo ducu matye iwi got me Cion, ki iwi dano ducu ma gucoke iye. Deyo pa Lubanga biumu Jerucalem. <verse eid="ISA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 4:6" />Deyone meno bibedo me gengo lyeto dyeceng, ki me gengo yamo ki kot.<verse eid="ISA 4:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ISA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Wer ikom poto olok</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 21:33">Mat 21:33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1">Mar 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9">Luk 20:9</ref></char>
    </note>Wek kong awer wer bot ngat ma amaroni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:1">wer me mar ikom poto oloke.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:1">Ngat ma amaroni onongo opuru poto oloke iwi cere</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:1">kama ceko cam tutwal.<verse eid="ISA 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 5:2" />Oboto poto, ka dok ocero bene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:2">ocoko gweng bene woko ducu ki iye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:2">ka dong ocako pito iye olok mabeco ma oyero ayera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:2">Ci oketo lubele me kiyo pinyi idyere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:2">ka dok okwinyo bur pi jolo pige.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:2">En dong ocako bedo ki gen ni binyako nyige mabeco,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:2">ento dok onyako mere nyige calo olok me tim.<verse eid="ISA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 5:3" />Kombedi dong, wun jo ma bedo i Jerucalem, ki wun jo me Juda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:3">wutim ber wungolkop ikin an ki poto oloka.<verse eid="ISA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 5:4" />Gin ango ma odong ma onongo myero atim i poto oloka ma pe atimo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:4">Ikare ma abedo ki gen ni olok binyako nyige mabeco,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:4">pingo dok onyako mere nyige calo olok me tim?<verse eid="ISA 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 5:5" />Wuwek kong dong atit botwu gin ma abitimo ikom poto oloka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:5">Abimuku cel woko ki ingete, wek dong obale woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:5">abicoro lobo me cele areto woko piny, wek lee tim onyon lobo ma iye woko atata.<verse eid="ISA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 5:6" />Abibwoto bake ki doo liyuk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:6">pe dong abingolo jange, kadi wa doyo tere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:6">okutu ki ocok bitwii, ci gidongo iye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:6">abiciko pol ducu wek pe dok gumii kot ocwer iye.<verse eid="ISA 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 5:7" />Pien poto olok pa Rwot me mony, gin aye jo Icrael ki jo Juda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:7">Gin ducu gubedo gin ma en opito me yomo cwinye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:7">ma onongo en tye ki gen ni gin bibedo ki kit ma atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:7">ento kong inen, gitye kaneke woko keken gi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:7">onongo atye ki gen ni gibibedo jo ma kitgi atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:7">ento kong iwiny twon koko me can ma jo ma kiterogi marac gikok kwede!<verse eid="ISA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jami maracu ma dano gitimo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 5:8" />Gibineno can, jo ma giwilo odi gimedo ikom odi madong gitye kwede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:8">ma gimedo wilo poti ikom poti ma gitye kwede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:8">nio wang ma kamo dong pe odong ki jo mukene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:8">kun nongo dong gudong ken gi i lobo.<verse eid="ISA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 5:9" />Rwot me mony okwonge kun awinyo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:9">“Adada, odi mapol igi bidong nono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:9">odi madongo, mabeco bidong labongo ngat mo ma bedo i igi.<verse eid="ISA 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 5:10" />Poto olok eka apar,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:10">bia iye kongo bwino maromo lita aboro keken;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:10">ki kodi guniya adek kulu, bia iye aduku aryo keken.”<verse eid="ISA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 5:11" />Gibineno can jo ma puk odiko con,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:11">kayenyo kongo me amata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:11">ki jo ma rii ite kongo nakanaka wa dyewor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:11">nio wang ma gumer matek.<verse eid="ISA 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 5:12" />Gibedo ki opuk, nanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:12">ajaa ki nyamulere i karamagi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:12">kun kongo bene pe rwenyo ki iye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:12">ento pe giparo pi tic ma Rwot tiyo wa ki acel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:12">kadi wa loko wanggi me neno gin ma en otiyo ki cinge.<verse eid="ISA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 5:13" />Meno aye gin ma omiyo kibitero lwaka i opii pi kwiya pinygi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:13">co mogo ikin gi ma kiworogi kombedi gibito ki kec,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:13">ki lwak mapol orwo pii binekogi matek.<verse eid="ISA 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 5:14" />Pimeno omiyo lyel tye kamwonyo laa tutwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:14">kun ongamo doge malac ma okato kare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:14">ci deyo pa Jerucalem ki lwak jone gidonyo iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:14">lwak ma woo ma cwinygi yom.<verse eid="ISA 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 5:15" />Kibikwanyo dong dit pa dano woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:15">co dong bidoko jo ma rwomgi piny adada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:15">jo ma wake bene dong wakegi bigik.<verse eid="ISA 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 5:16" />Ento Rwot me mony dit dok kidwore pi ngolo kop atir.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:16">Lubanga Maleng nyute ni kite leng pi timo gin matye atir.<verse eid="ISA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 5:17" />Romi gibibedo kacam i Jerucalem macalo gicamo i oletgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:17">dok lim makwo mucwe ki dyegi gibicam iwi obur.<verse eid="ISA 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 5:18" />Gibineno can jo ma ywayo kit marac ikomgi ki tol me goba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:18">ma giywayo bal ki tol calo giywayo gadigadi.<verse eid="ISA 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 5:19" />Gin giwaco ni, “Wek en oru timone oyotoyot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:19">wek oru tice bene oyotoyot wek wanen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:19">wek gin ma Ngat Maleng me Icrael oyubu ni ebitiyo obin cok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:19">obin wek wan bene wange.”<verse eid="ISA 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 5:20" />Gibineno can, jo ma lwongo gin marac ni ber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:20">kun dok giloke gilwongo gin maber ni rac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:20">ma giketo colpiny ma ka dero, ki dero ma ka colpiny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:20">gin makec giloko doko gin malim, ki gin malim giloko doko gin makec!<verse eid="ISA 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 5:21" />Gibineno can, jo maryek iwanggi ken gi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:21">gin jo ma ginene ken gi ni giryek.<verse eid="ISA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 5:22" />Lumat kongo madongo bineno can,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:22">ki jo ma gin ludiro i rubu kongo mamit.<verse eid="ISA 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 5:23" />Gin gimiyo ngat ma obalo loyo kop pi lim ma owilogi kwede i mung,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:23">dok gigengo ngolo kop atir ikom ngat ma pe ki bal mo.<verse eid="ISA 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 5:24" />Pimeno kit macalo leb mac wango kwede reng kal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:24">ki kit ma mac gamo kwede lum ma otwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:24">kitmeno bene gibibedo macalo yat ma otop woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:24">nyo macalo yat ma ka ture otwo ci duny calo apwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:24">pien gukwero winyo cik pa Rwot me mony,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:24">kun gicayo lok ma Ngat Maleng me Icrael oloko.<verse eid="ISA 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 5:25" />Meno aye gin ma omiyo akemo omako Rwot ikom lwake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:25">omiyo en oryeyo cinge ikomgi, me tyekogi ci onekogi woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:25">Godi madongo guyenge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:25">ci dano guto ma komgi orade ata macalo yugi matye idye gudu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:25">Man ducu pe okweyo akemo pa Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:25">en pud tye karyeyo cinge aryeya ikomgi.<verse eid="ISA 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 5:26" />Rwot Lubanga bitingo benderane pi rok matye kamabor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:26">en bilwongogi ki i agiki piny ki lwiyo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:26">Nen gin ca, gitye ka ringo, gibino oyotoyot.<verse eid="ISA 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 5:27" />Dano mo ma ool matye kacato atata peke ikin gi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:27">ngat ma nur ki nino nyo ma onino peke ikin gi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:27">ngat mo peke ma bongo ma i pyere ogony woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:27">tol war bene pe ocod ki i tyen ngat mo.<verse eid="ISA 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 5:28" />Aterogi bit tutwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:28">guciko atumgi ki tol ma dong gutelo woko matek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:28">obong tyen aguraguragi obedo calo pata got,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:28">tyen gadigadigi wire calo yamo lapiru.<verse eid="ISA 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 5:29" />Acikarigi ducu gimor calo dwon labwor ma kok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:29">gikok calo lutino labwor;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:29">gingur ci gimako lee ma gitye kadwarone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:29">giywayogi giterogi gigi labongo ngat mo matwero kwanyone woko ki botgi.<verse eid="ISA 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 5:30" />Inino meno kikome, gibingur ikom Icrael macalo nam ma mor.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:30">Ento kace iloko wangi me neno lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:30">ci ibineno colpiny ki can keken,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:30">kun nongo pol oumu wang ceng woko.<verse eid="ISA 5:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ISA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga olwongo Icaya me bedo lanebi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 15:7">2 Luk 15:7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 26:23">2 Tek 26:23</ref></char>
    </note>I mwaka ma rwot Ujia oto iye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwaka me to pa Ujia kibyeko ni i kine ka mwaka miya abiro ki pyere adek nio kwede i mwaka miya abiro ki pyere adek abicel ma peya kinywalo Yecu. </char></note>, aneno Rwot ma obedo iwi komkere, kun onyede malo, madit tutwal, ma dog bongone opongo i Ot pa Lubanga woko liweng. <verse eid="ISA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 6:2" />Lucerapi gucung malo ka wiye, ma lacerapi acel acel bwome tye abicel; aryo me umu wanggi, aryo me umu tyen gi, ki aryo mukene me tukgi malo. <verse eid="ISA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 6:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:8">Niy 4:8</ref></char></note>Onongo gitye kawer ma ngat acel acel gamo dog lawote ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:3">“Rwot me mony leng, leng dok leng!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:3">Lobo ducu opong ki deyone.”<verse eid="ISA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 6:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 15:8">Niy 15:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Te guti me dogola ocako yenge pi wer ma guweroni, ki yito bene omwono i ot woko limuk. <verse eid="ISA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 6:5" />Ka dong awaco ni, “Aneno can dong ba! Ato woko do! Pien an dano ma lok ma a idoga pe leng, dok bene abedo ikin rok ma lok ma giloko pe leng, ento aneno Rwot ki wanga, ma en aye Rwot me mony.”<verse eid="ISA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 6:6" />Cutcut ngat acel ikin lucerapi otuk obino bota, kun omako lodi mac i cinge, ma en okwanyo ki i keno tyer, kun okaro ki lakar mac. <verse eid="ISA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 6:7" />En ogudu ki doga kun waco ni, “Nen, gin man ogudu del dogi; gin maracu ducu ma itimo dong kikwanyo, ki bali dong kiweko.” <verse eid="ISA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 6:8" />Cutcut awinyo dwon Rwot ma waco ni, “Abioro anga mono? Anga ma bicito pirwa?” Agamo ni, “An ene; ora.” <verse eid="ISA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 6:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:14-15">Mat 13:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:12">Mar 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:10">Luk 8:10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:40">Jon 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 28:26-27">Tic 28:26-27</ref></char></note>Ka dong en owaca ni, “Cit iwac ki rok man ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:9">‘Winyone mere wubiwinyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:9">ento pe wubiniang teloke;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:9">nenone wubineno,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:9">ento pe wubingeyo gin matye katime.’<verse eid="ISA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 6:10" />Mii rok man gudok jo ma oding,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:10">mii itgi bene oding woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:10">wek pe gunen ki wanggi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:10">dok pe bene guwiny ki itgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:10">pe bene guniang iye ki cwinygi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:10">wek omii pe guloke gudwog bota acanggi.”<verse eid="ISA 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 6:11" />Ka dong apenyo ni, “Pi kare marom mene, ai Rwot?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:11">Ci en odoka iye ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:11">“Nio wang ma taun madito magi ducu igi odong nono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:11">labongo dano mo ma bedo i igi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:11">jo mogo ma gibibedo i odi bene gibibedo peke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:11">nio wang ma lobo dong odong nono labongo gin mo kadi ki acel.<verse eid="ISA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 6:12" />Abicwalo dano woko cen kamabor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:12">ci wi obur ma kibwoto bidong madwong ata i lobo.<verse eid="ISA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 6:13" />Kadi bed acel me apar pa dano odong i lobo kenyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:13">ci pud dok kibiwangogi woko aye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:13">calo kworo nyo opok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:13">ma ajute aye dong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:13">ma nongo dong kityeko tongo kom yat woko piny.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:13">Ajute aye bibedo kodi maleng.<verse eid="ISA 6:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ISA 7" />
  <para style="s1">Lok mukwongo ma Icaya otito bot rwot Akaj</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 16:5">2 Luk 16:5</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 28:5-6">2 Tek 28:5-6</ref></char>
    </note>Ikare ma Akaj wod pa Yocam, wod pa Ujia, onongo obedo rwot me Juda, Rejin rwot me Ciria, ki Peka wod pa Remalia rwot me Icrael, gin aryo ducu yam gubino i Jerucalem pi lweny ikom Akaj, ento pe gutwero loyone.<verse eid="ISA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 7:2" />Ikare ma kitito loke bot Akaj rwot me Juda ni jo Epraim dong guribe woko ki jo Ciria, cwiny Akaj ki cwiny lwake omyel tutwal kit macalo yamo yengo kwede yat ka tye kakodo.<verse eid="ISA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 7:3" />Rwot owaco bot Icaya ni, “Cit irwate ki Akaj, in kacel ki wodi Cear-yacub. Cit irwate kwede i agiki me yoo pii ma mol a ki i joro mamalo, i yoo gudu ma cito i poto pa lalwok bongo. <verse eid="ISA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 7:4" />Wac bote wek en obed ma ogwoke, dok obed mot labongo lworo mo, cwinye bene pe opoti pi kiniga malyet ma omako Rejin ki jo Ciria ki wod pa Remalia, pi ajut aryo ma guwang wokoni ma yito tye kaduny ki iigi. <verse eid="ISA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 7:5" />Pien jo Ciria ki jo Epraim ki wod pa Remalia guporo lok marac ma myero kitim ikomi. <verse eid="ISA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 7:6" />Gin gimito lweny ikom Juda, wek gimaa Juda woko obed meggi, wek giket wod pa Tabcel me bedo rwot iye.<verse eid="ISA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 7:7" />Pimeno an Rwot Lubanga awaco ni lokgi meno pe gibicobone i ada. <verse eid="ISA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 7:8" />Pien Damaciko aye taun madit me Ciria, ki Rejin aye rwot me Damaciko. (Ikine me mwaka pyere abicel wiye abic, nongo jo Epraim pe dok gimede me bedo rok.) <verse eid="ISA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 7:9" />Camaria aye taun madit me Epraim, ki wod pa Remalia aye rwot me Camaria. Kace pe wubicung matek i niye, ci adada pe dong wubicung matwal.”<verse eid="ISA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lanyut ikom Immanuel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 7:10" />Rwot dok owaco ki Akaj ni, <verse eid="ISA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 7:11" />“Peny pi lanyut mo ki bot Rwot Lubangani; kadi lanyut matye piny kama tut i lyel nyo kadi matye malo i polo.” <verse eid="ISA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 7:12" />Ento Akaj ogamo kun waco ni. “Pe abipenyo lanyut mo, dok pe abitemo Rwot.” <verse eid="ISA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 7:13" />Icaya dok owaco ni, “Kong wuwiny wun likwayo pa Daudi! Yelo dano ma wuolo komgini pe romowu, ma omiyo dok wutye ka olo kom Lubangani? <verse eid="ISA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 7:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:23">Mat 1:23</ref></char></note>Pimeno, Rwot kikome aye ma bimiyo botwu lanyut. Nen, nyako mo ma peya ongeyo laco biyac, ci binywalo latin laco, kibicako nying latin meno ni Immanuel.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="fk">Immanuel </char> te loke Lubanga tye kwedwa. </note> <verse eid="ISA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 7:15" />Ikare ma latin meno bingeyo kwero gin marac kiyero gin maber, dano bibedo kamato cak lukulu ki moo kic. <verse eid="ISA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 7:16" />Pien ma pud peya latin meno ngeyo kwero gin marac kiyero gin maber, lobo ma in itye iye ki lworo maditi kom lukere aryonu kibiweko dong nono. <verse eid="ISA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 7:17" />Rwot bimiyo kare mo bino ikomi ki ikom lwaki, ki ikom jo me dogola me ot pa kwaru, can marac mayam peya onen cake ma jo Epraim gupoke woko ki jo Juda; en bikelo rwot me Aciria.<verse eid="ISA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 7:18" />Ikare meno, Rwot bilwongo mony pa jo Ejipt ki lwiyo, ci gibibino macalo lwangi ki mony pa jo Aciria gibibino calo kic. <verse eid="ISA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 7:19" />Gin ducu gibibino ci gio woko lirut i lung matut, ki ikin got ma obar, ki iwi okutugu ducu, ki i olet ducu.<verse eid="ISA 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 7:20" />Ikare meno Rwot bikelo dano mo ki loka kulu Euprate, ma en rwot me Aciria. En bitimowu malit mada kun lyelo yer wiwu ki yer komwu woko ducu, dok bilyelo yer tikwu woko bene.<verse eid="ISA 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 7:21" />Ikare meno dano bigwoko roya ki megi romi aryo, <verse eid="ISA 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 7:22" />ci gibimiyo cak madwong tutwal bot dano meno, ma weko dano meno bimato cak lukulu ki moo kic.<verse eid="ISA 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 7:23" />Ikare meno poti ducu mayam kinongo iye tyen olok alip acel, ma poto acel acel kicato i wel me cekel me ryal alip acel, bipong ki okutu ki ocok keken. <verse eid="ISA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 7:24" />Dano bicito kadwar kunu ki atum ki atero, pien okutu ki ocok biromo lobo ducu. <verse eid="ISA 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 7:25" />Kabedo ducu ma obedo cerecere mayam onongo kipuru ki kweri, pe dok wubicito iye pi lworo okutu ki ocok. Kabedo meno bidoko kama dyangi camo iye ken gi; dok romi ki dyegi gibibedo kanyono piny iye atata.”<verse eid="ISA 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ISA 8" />
  <para style="s1">Nying wod pa Icaya tye lanyut bot dano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 8:1" />Rwot dok owaca ni, “Kwany got malac ci ico iye coc ki nukuta ma lwak ducu gingeyo ma giromo kwano ni, ‘Maer-calal-kac-baj.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="fk">Maer-calal-kac-baj </char> tyen loke ni Yak-oyotoyot-rune-kayako. </note> <verse eid="ISA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 8:2" />Nong lucaden aryo ma gigene: ajwaka Uria ki Jakaria wod pa Yeberekia, me bedo lucadena.” <verse eid="ISA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 8:3" />Lacen abutu ki dakona ma lanebi, ci oyac, onywalo latin laco. Ci Rwot owaca ni, “Cak nyinge ni Maer-calal-kac-baj; <verse eid="ISA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 8:4" />pien ma pud peya latin meno ngeyo lwongo ni, ‘Aba,’ nyo ‘Mama,’ rwot me Aciria bigwaro lonyo pa jo Damaciko kacel ki jami ayaka pa jo Camaria woko liweng.”<verse eid="ISA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rwot me Aciria tye kabino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 8:5" />Rwot dok oloko bota aye ni, <verse eid="ISA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 8:6" />“Pien jo man dong gukwero pii me Ciloa ma mol mot ci guloke gigi gubedo ki myelkom inyim Rejin ki inyim wod pa Remalia, <verse eid="ISA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 8:7" />pimeno, Rwot bimiyo pii me kulu Euprate ma mol matek dok bene madwong tutwal bicore ikomgi, ma en aye rwot me Aciria ki deyone ducu. Bipong iwang lalele ducu, kun nongo mol atata liyakyak. <verse eid="ISA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 8:8" />Bimol kato cito i Juda, ma nongo mol atata liyakyak, kato cito anyim, bipong nio wa malo ingut dano.” Pien Lubanga tye kwedwa. En biyaro bwome me gwoko lobo man. <verse eid="ISA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 8:9" />Wugure kacel wun rok ducu, cwinywu myero opoti; wuter itwu, wun lobo ducu ma wutye kamabor, wuyube bene ma cwinywu poto, wuyube pi lweny ma cwinywu poto. <verse eid="ISA 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 8:10" />Wupor lok kacel! Ento gin mo peke ma bia ki iye. Wulok lok, ento gin ma wumito pe bicobe, pien Lubanga tye kwedwa.<verse eid="ISA 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot ociko lanebi Icaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 8:11" />Rwot ocika kun loko bota ki twerone madit kit man ni, pe wulub kit pa jo me rok man, kun owaca ni, <verse eid="ISA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 8:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:14-15">1 Pet 3:14-15</ref></char></note> “Pe wuribe kwedgi ka piro lok i mung dok pe wulwor gin ma gilworo, dok lworo mo ma onyo koyo ikomwu bene obed peke. <verse eid="ISA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 8:13" />Ento myero wunge ni Rwot me mony aye ngat maleng, en aye ngat ma myero wubed ka lworone, dok en aye ma myero omiwu lworo ma onyo koyo ikomwu. <verse eid="ISA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 8:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:8">1 Pet 2:8</ref></char></note> Pien abedo ngat maleng, oweko abedo calo got mamiyo dano yoke ka giwoto, abedo calo ariya ki tung botgi, makatone ki tung dogola pa luker aryonu ducu, Juda ki Icrael, dok bibedo owic ki kunu me ciko jo ma gibedo i Jerucalem. <verse eid="ISA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 8:15" />Jo mapol gibiyoke iye; gibipoto gitur ginginye woko; ci kibicikogi ki kunu ci gimoko i owic.”<verse eid="ISA 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiciko dano ikom lok me koro tipu pa jo ma oto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 8:16" />Jo ma winyo lok ma apwonyo myero gugwok maber wek pe orweny woko. <verse eid="ISA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 8:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:13">Ibru 2:13</ref></char></note>Rwot okane woko ki bot jone, ento an abikure kun atye ki gen ikome. <verse eid="ISA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 8:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:13">Ibru 2:13</ref></char></note>Nen an kacel ki lutino ma Rwot dong omiya, wabedo lanyut ki lanen bot jo Icrael ma oa ki bot Rwot me mony, ma komkere tye iwi got Cion. <verse eid="ISA 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 8:19" />Ento dano biwaco botwu ni kong wucit wupeny lutyet ki ajwaki ma giloko weewee, calo ngat ma dumu aduma. Gin biwaco ni, “Ber ka rok moni gupenyo Lubangagi maka penyo tipu pa jo ma oto pi jo ma kwo.” <verse eid="ISA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 8:20" />Wun myero wudok iye botgi ni, “Kong wuwiny gin ma Rwot pwonyo ki wun! Pe wuwiny lok ma lutyet ki ajwaki giloko pien gitye i piny macol, piny peya oru botgi. <verse eid="ISA 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 8:21" />Dano bingolo gikato ki idye lobo ma nongo gitye ki peko madwong tutwal, ma kun nongo kec nekogi matek. Gibitoke ki kiniga ma kun nongo kec tye kanekogi, ci gicako ceno rwotgi ki Lubangagi woko. Gibitingo wanggi gineno malo i polo, <verse eid="ISA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 8:22" />dok gibikulu wigi kun gineno piny i lobo, ento pe gibinongo gin mo, gibineno can ki colpiny keken, ki mutu ma ocido licuc me arem madwong, ci kibicwalogi i colpiny ma ocido licuc. Yo mo bibedo peke me bwot ki i arem meno madwong.”<verse eid="ISA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ISA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Nywalo laker ma bikelo kuc ki loc maber</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:15">Mat 4:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Dano yam gicayo lobo Jabulon ki lobo Naputali, ento en bimiyo piny ma tung Mediterranean, nio loka Jordan, oo kwede wa Galilaya kama lurok bedo iye, bibedo kideyo.<verse eid="ISA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 9:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:16">Mat 4:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:79">Luk 1:79</ref></char>
    </note>Jo mayam giwoto i piny macol</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:2">dong guneno dero ceng madit;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:2">ki jo mayam bedo i lobo me mutu me piny macol licuc,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:2">ceng dong oryeny omenyogi.<verse eid="ISA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 9:3" />In dong imiyo jo me rokwa onya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:3">imedo bene yomcwiny botgi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:3">gibedo ki yomcwiny inyimi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:3">kit ma dano bedo kwede ikare me kac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:3">kit ma dano bedo kwede ki yomcwiny ka gipoko jami ma guyako.<verse eid="ISA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 9:4" />Pien okolgi mapek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:4">ki odoo ma goyo gwokgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:4">ki odoo mayam kiburugi kwede tektek me tiyo tic,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:4">in dong iturugi woko ducu macalo inino pa jo Midian.<verse eid="ISA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 9:5" />Pien war pa oteka lweny ducu ma ginyono ki piny idye lweny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:5">ki bongi ducu ma kinywano woko ki remo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:5">kibimokogi woko ki mac maka yen.<verse eid="ISA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 9:6" />Pien dong kinywalo botwa latin, kimiyo botwa latin laco;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:6">kibimiyo en tingo twero me loc iwi gwoke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:6">nyinge kibicako ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:6">“Lamitam ma kiuru, Lubanga Won Twer,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:6">Won ma bedo nakanaka, Laloc makelo kuc.”<verse eid="ISA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 9:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 1:32-33">Luk 1:32-33</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Twero me loce bimede ameda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">kere kare ducu bibedo ki kuc, dok ka gike bibedo peke.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">En bibedo iwi komker pa Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">biweko kere cung matek dok bigwokone wek pe opoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">ki ngolo kop ma atir ki bedo ki kit ma atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">cake kombedi ci bedo dong matwal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">Arima pa Rwot me mony bimiyo man cobe.<verse eid="ISA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot bimiyo pwod ki jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 9:8" />Rwot ocwalo lok ikom Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:8">ci lok meno bipoto ikom Icrael.<verse eid="ISA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 9:9" />Lwak ducu bingeyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:9">Epraim ki jo ma bedo i Camaria,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:9">ma gin jo ma luwake ma gicayo dano ki i cwinygi kun giwaco ni,<verse eid="ISA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 9:10" />“Matapwali dong opoto woko piny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:10">dong wabigero gedo ki got ma kipayo apaya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:10">olam dong kitongo woko, ento wan wabileyo kakargi ki yat cedar.”<verse eid="ISA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 9:11" />Rwot tye kakelo lumerok ikomgi, dok tye katugu lukworgi. <verse eid="ISA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 9:12" />Jo Ciria tung kunyango ki jo Piliciti tung kupotoceng gungamo doggi, gitye kamwodo jo Icrael woko. Man ducu pe okweyo kiniga pa Rwot, en pud tye kapwodogi apwoda. <verse eid="ISA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 9:13" />Ento dano pe guloke gudwogo cen bot ngat ma opwodogi, pe bene guyenyo Rwot me mony. <verse eid="ISA 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 9:14" />Pimeno omiyo Rwot bipwodo lutela me Icrael woko kacel ki jone, dok bingolo bene wi Icrael woko kacel ki yibe inino acel. <verse eid="ISA 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 9:15" />Ludito kacel ki jo ma kiworogi gubedo wi Icrael, ki lunebi ma pwonyo lok me goba en aye yib Icrael. <verse eid="ISA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 9:16" />Jo ma telo rok man gurwenyo lwak me rok man woko, oweko jo ma kitelogi tamgi obale woko. <verse eid="ISA 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 9:17" />Meno omiyo Rwot pe obedo ki yomcwiny ikom awobegi, kica bene pe omake ikom lutino ma won gi peke, ki mon ma coggi oto; pien ngat acel acel ikin gi pe woro Lubanga, dok gin ducu gudoko lutim tim maracu, lok ducu ma giloko obedo lok me mingo keken. Man ducu pe okweyo kiniga pa Rwot, en pud tye kamede ameda ki pwodogi. <verse eid="ISA 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 9:18" />Pien tim maracu wang woko calo mac, wang calo okutu ki ocok ma wang imac; gamo agaba ma i bunga, kun gin ducu gidoko yito ma duny cito malo. <verse eid="ISA 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 9:19" />Pien akemo pa Rwot me mony omiyo lobo tye kawang ki mac, jo ma gibedo iye ducu dong gudoko calo yen ma wang i mac; pe tye ngat mo iye ma timo kica ki omine. <verse eid="ISA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 9:20" />Gimayo ki tung lacuc, ento nongo kec pud tye kanekogi, gicamo ki tung lacam, ento nongo pud pe romogi; dano acel acel camo ringo kom lawote. <verse eid="ISA 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 9:21" />Manace camo Epraim, ki Epraim bene camo Manace, gin aryo ducu guribe kacel guero lweny ikom Juda. Man ducu pe okweyo kiniga pa Rwot en pud tye kamede ameda ki pwodogi.<verse eid="ISA 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ISA 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 10:1" />Wun jo ma wuketo cik ma pe atir wubineno can, wun lucoc ma wucoyo lok me unu dano; <verse eid="ISA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 10:2" />ma wugengo jo ma piny obwoyogi woko me nongo ngolo kop atir, ma wumayo jami pa lucan ma gibedo ikin lwaka; wuyako jami pa mon ma coggi oto, ki jami pa lutino kic bene wumayo woko. <verse eid="ISA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 10:3" />Wubitimo gin ango inino ma kibiketo iye can ikomwu, idye yamo kot ma bia ki kamabor? Wubiringo wucito bot anga wek okonywu? Lonyowu kono wubiweko kwene? <verse eid="ISA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 10:4" />Pe wubibwot kadi ki acel, ento wubiwot wudonyo ikin mabuc aye, onyo wubito atoya aye ikin jo ma kibinekogi i lweny. Man ducu pe bikweyo kiniga pa Rwot, en pud bimede ameda ki pwodogi.<verse eid="ISA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot otiyo rwot me Aciria me pwodo jone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 10:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:24-27">Ica 14:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 1:1-3:19">Nak 1:1—3:19</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:13-15">Jep 2:13-15</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot owaco ni, “Jo Aciria gubedo odoo me nyutu kinigana, ki odoo me nyutu akemona mager. <verse eid="ISA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 10:6" />Abicwalo Aciria ka lweny ikom rok ma gukwero wora woko, abicikogi gicito ikom jo ma akemo omaka ikomgi, pi yako jamigi ki coko jamigi ma guyako ki nyonogi woko piny idye gudu calo coto. <verse eid="ISA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 10:7" />Ento rwot me Aciria onongo pe oyube me timo kumeno, dok bene onongo pe otamo tam macalo meno i cwinye; ento tame onongo tye pi nek ki pi jwero jo me rok mapol woko liweng.” <verse eid="ISA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 10:8" />Rwot me Aciria owaco ni, “Ludito wi monya ducu gin luker! <verse eid="ISA 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 10:9" />Dong atyeko loyo taun madito me Kalno ki Karkemic, Kamat ki Arpad, Camaria ki Damaciko. <verse eid="ISA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 10:10" />Kit macalo cinga dong ogudu kwede ker ducu ma giworo cal jogi, ma cal jogi ma gupayo onongo kato pa jo Jerucalem ki pa jo Camaria woko, <verse eid="ISA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 10:11" />itamo ni an pe abitimo bene ikom Jerucalem ki cal jogine, kit mayam atimo ikom Camaria ki cal jogine?”<verse eid="ISA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 10:12" />Ka Rwot dong otyeko tice ducu ki iwi Got Cion, ki ikom Jerucalem, ci biketo can ikom rwot me Aciria pi wakene ki nyatene ki pi kete kekene ni etek. <verse eid="ISA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 10:13" />Pien rwot me Aciria owaco ni, “Atimo man pi tek cinga, ki pi ryekona, pien atye ki ngec ma oromo. Atyeko dong kobo wang coo me lobo pa lurok woko, ayako bene lwak lonyogi woko ducu, areto jo ma gubedo iwi komker macalo twon ma coro jami. <verse eid="ISA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 10:14" />Onongo cinga coko lonyo pa rok mapol, ma cokone obedo yot calo kwanyo ot winyo; kit ma dano gicoko kwede tong winyo ma min gi dong oweko woko, an bene dong acoko lonyo me rok ducu woko kitmeno; pe tye ngat mo ma otingo cinge, dano mo bene obedo peke ma ongamo doge kacoka.”<verse eid="ISA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 10:15" />Ento Rwot owaco ni, “Itamo ni latong twero wake ikom ngat ma tiyo kwede? Nyo cumeno twero pake kene inyim ngat ma tiyo kwede? Odoo pe twero tingo dano, dano aye tingo odoo, tal bene pe twero tingo dano malo, ento dano aye ma tinge malo.” <verse eid="ISA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 10:16" />Pimeno, Rwot ma en Rwot me mony bicwalo two ma jonyo kom dano woko ikom jo Aciria ma gin lulweny, dok bicwinyo mac ite deyogi ci wang woko, dok bilyel calo mac. <verse eid="ISA 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 10:17" />Lubanga ma en dero pa jo Icrael bidoko mac, Lubanga maleng pa jo Icrael bidoko calo leb mac; biwango okutu ki ocok tyekogi woko inino acel. <verse eid="ISA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 10:18" />Deyo me bungane ki lobo ma ceko cam matek, Rwot bityeko woko ducu; kit macalo two matek jonyo kom latwo woko lingok. <verse eid="ISA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 10:19" />Yadi ma bidong i potone bibedo manok tutwal ma latin bene twero kwano welgi.<verse eid="ISA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael manok ma gudonge bidwogo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 10:20" />Inino meno jo Icrael ma gudonge, ki jo me ot pa Yakobo ma dong gubwot, pe dok gibijenge ikom ngat ma opwodogi, ento dong gibijenge ikom Rwot, ma en Ngat Maleng me Icrael. <verse eid="ISA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 10:21" />Jo ma gudong gibidwogo cen bot Lubanga Won Twer, ma gin aye jo me ot pa Yakobo ma gudonge. <verse eid="ISA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 10:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:27">Rom 9:27</ref></char></note>Kadi lwakwu jo Icrael gubed macalo kweyo me dog nam, jo manok keken ki ikin gi ma odong aye gibidwogo cen. Lubanga dong omoko tame me tyekogi woko, pien en gire kite atir. <verse eid="ISA 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 10:23" />Pien Rwot, ma en Rwot me mony, bityekogi woko ducu ki lobogi kit ma en dong omoko.<verse eid="ISA 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot bipwodo jo Aciria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 10:24" />Meno aye gin ma omiyo Rwot, ma en Rwot me mony owaco ni, “Wun lwaka ma wubedo i Cion, pe wulwor jo Aciria kace gigoyowu ki odoo, ma gitingo odoogi i komwu kit macalo jo Ejipt yam gutimo. <verse eid="ISA 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 10:25" />Pien dong odong kare manoknok mo ma akemona bigik woko, ci kinigana biloke ikomgi, ci atyekogi woko. <verse eid="ISA 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 10:26" />Rwot me mony bityengo odoo ikomgi, kit macalo yam otyengo kwede jo Midian inget got Oreb; en biriyo odoone iwi nam, kit macalo yam otimo ki i Ejipt. <verse eid="ISA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 10:27" />Inino meno abigonyowu woko ki ite loc pa Aciria ki abituru okole woko ki ingutwu.”<verse eid="ISA 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo Aciria guoto mony</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 10:28" />Lukwor dong gua woko ki i Rimon, dong guo i Ayat kun giwok ki i Migron, gukano tergi i Mikmac. <verse eid="ISA 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 10:29" />Gungolo ki ikin godi kama ding, ci gucito gubutu i Geba. Jo Rama komgi myel, jo Gibea pa Caulo dong guringo woko. <verse eid="ISA 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 10:30" />Wudong oduru matek, wun jo Gallim! Wuwiny, wun jo Laica! Wugam doggi ba, wun jo Anatot! <verse eid="ISA 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 10:31" />Jo Madmena tye karingo woko, ki jo ma bedo i Gebim guringo pi laro kwogi. <verse eid="ISA 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 10:32" />Lumerok onongo dong gitye i Nob inino meno, onongo dong gitye ma giyengo tonggi ayenga ikom got Cion, ma en aye got me Jerucalem. <verse eid="ISA 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 10:33" />Nen, Rwot ma en Rwot me mony, bimiyo gipoto piny lirum calo jang yat ma kitongo; jo madongone kibiretogi woko piny, ngat mo peke ma bidong ma nongo ocung malo. <verse eid="ISA 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 10:34" />Rwot bitongo mony pa jo Aciria calo ngat ma tongo yen kama ocule ducu ma i bunga ki latong, kadi yadi ma pirgi tego matye i Lebanon, gin ducu kibiretogi woko piny.<verse eid="ISA 10:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ISA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ker me kuc</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 5:5">Niy 5:5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:16">22:16</ref></char>
    </note>Yat manyen bilot kun tuc ki ikom ajut pa Yece, jange bituc ki ilwite ci dongo.<verse eid="ISA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 11:2" />Cwiny pa Rwot bibedo ikome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:2">en cwiny me ryeko ki me niang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:2">en cwiny me poro lok ki me bedo ki teko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:2">en cwiny me ngec ki me lworo Rwot.<verse eid="ISA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 11:3" />Cwinye bibedo yom ka lworo Rwot.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:3">En pe bingolo kop pi gin ma en neno anena ki wange,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:3">nyo kadi ki ngolo kop pi lok ma en winyo awinya ki ite;<verse eid="ISA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 11:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TH 2:8">2 Tec 2:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>ento en bingolo kop pa lucan atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:4">dok bingolo kop atir pi jo mamwol me lobo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:4">En bipwodo jo maracu malube ki gin ma en bingolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:4">en bineko jo maracu woko ki aluu me yweyo me doge.<verse eid="ISA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 11:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:14">Epe 6:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kit ma atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:5">ki kite me genene aye bibedo del me tweyo pyere.<verse eid="ISA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 11:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:25">Ica 65:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Orudi bibedo kacel ki latin romo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:6">kwac ki latin dyel bene gibibutu piny kacel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:6">roya ki labwor gibidongo kacel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:6">latin matidi aye ma bitelogi.<verse eid="ISA 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 11:7" />Dyang ki nguu mager gibicam kacel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:7">lutinogi bene gibibutu piny kacel ki kuc.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:7">Labwor bicamo lum calo dyang.<verse eid="ISA 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 11:8" />Kadi latin ma pud dot twol pe bitongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:8">ka otuku kama twol mager tye iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:8">birwako cinge wa i ot twol ororo.<verse eid="ISA 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 11:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAB 2:14">Kab 2:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Tim mo marac me nek nyo me keto ret ikom dano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:9">pe binen iwi gota maleng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:9">pien lobo ducu bipong ki ngec pa Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:9">macalo pii ma pong i nam.<verse eid="ISA 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo ma kiterogi i opii gibidwogo cen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 11:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 15:12">Rom 15:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Inino meno lakwar Yece bicung calo bendera ma rok mapol twero nenone; lurok ducu gibipenyo tam ki bote, kama en bedo iye bibedo kabedo me deyo.<verse eid="ISA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 11:11" />Inino meno Rwot dok bitic ki tekone me kwanyo jone ma gudong i Aciria, Ejipt, ki i Etiopia, i Elam, Cinar, Kamat, ki i dog nam. <verse eid="ISA 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 11:12" />En bitingo benderane malo me nyutu bot rok ni en dong etye kacoko jone jo Icrael mayam kikeyogi woko atata; en bicoko jo Juda ma onongo yam guket woko ata, ci bicokogi ki itwok lobo angwen ducu. <verse eid="ISA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 11:13" />Nyeko pa Epraim ikom Juda bigik woko, ki jo Juda pe bibedo ki gero ikom Epraim; Epraim pe bibedo ki nyeko ikom Juda, ki jo Juda bene pe bibedo ki gero ikom Epraim. <verse eid="ISA 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 11:14" />Gibimwome giringo piny ikor got pa jo Piliciti ki tung kupotoceng, gibiribe kacel giyako jo matye tung kunyango. Gibilweny ikom jo Edom ki Moab, jo Ammon bibedo ite locgi. <verse eid="ISA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 11:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:12">Niy 16:12</ref></char></note>Rwot bimiyo pii ma i jang nam me Ejipt two woko liweng, biyengo cinge iwi kulu Euprate, bigoyo miyo poke woko doko kulu abiro matinotino, ma ngat mo twero ngolo ki iye kun pii mo peke ma dyako ware. <verse eid="ISA 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 11:16" />Yoo gudu ma a i Aciria dong bibedo tye, pi jone ma gudong, kit macalo yam otime kwede pi jo Icrael ikare ma gia ki i lobo Ejipt.<verse eid="ISA 11:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ISA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Wer me pwoyo Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 12:1" />Inino meno dano biwero ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:1">“Abipwoyi, ai Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:1">pien yam cwinyi owang ikoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:1">kinigani dong okwe woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:1">ka dong ikweyo cwinya.<verse eid="ISA 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 12:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 15:2">Nia 15:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:14">Jab 118:14</ref></char>
    </note>Adada, Lubanga aye Lalara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:2">abigeno en, pe dok abibedo ki lworo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:2">pien Rwot Lubanga aye teka ki kerona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:2">abipake ki wer, pien en Lalara.<verse eid="ISA 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 12:3" />Macalo pii maber miyo yomcwiny ki ngat ma orwo neko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:3">jo pa Lubanga bedo ki yomcwiny ka en olarogi.”<verse eid="ISA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 12:4" />Inino meno wubiwero wer ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:4">“Wumii pwoc bot Rwot!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:4">Wulwong nyinge wek en olarwu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:4">Wumii lurok gunge gin ma Rwot dong otiyo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:4">Wutit botgi kit ma en dit kwede!<verse eid="ISA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 12:5" />Wuwer wer me pako Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:5">pien dong otiyo tice ki deyo madit tutwal;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:5">wumii lok man ongene iwi lobo ducu.<verse eid="ISA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 12:6" />Wugo kijira, wuwer bene ki yomcwiny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:6">wun jo ma wubedo i Cion,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:6">pien Ngat Maleng me Icrael dit ikinwu.”<verse eid="ISA 12:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ISA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga bipwodo Babilon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 13:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1—14:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 47:1-15">Ica 47:1-15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:1-46">Jer 50:1-46</ref></char>
    </note>Man lok ma pire tek ma Lubanga owaco bot Icaya wod pa Amoj ikom Babilon. <verse eid="ISA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 13:2" />Wuting bendera malo ki iwi got, wulwongi ki dwon malongo, wugwelgi wek gudony, i dog cel pa ludito me awora. <verse eid="ISA 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 13:3" />An Rwot ki koma dong aciko lwaka ma dong awiro, dong alwongo oteka lwenya, wek kinigana ocobe kakare. <verse eid="ISA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 13:4" />Kong wuwiny woo matye malo iwi godi calo woo pa lwak dano ma gucoke lipim! Kong wuwiny kit ma jo me ker ducu, ki jo me rok gitye kakok kun gicoke kacel! Rwot me mony tye kaywayo monye pi lweny. <verse eid="ISA 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 13:5" />Gia ki i lobo matye kamabor tutwal, gibino kun gia ki i agiki me te polo; Rwot tye ki akemo, obibino ki jami lwenye me tyeko lobo woko ducu. <verse eid="ISA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 13:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 1:15">Joe 1:15</ref></char></note>Wukok, pien nino pa Rwot dong tye cok; bibino calo topiny ma oa ki bot Won Twer Ducu! <verse eid="ISA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 13:7" />Meno bimiyo cing jo mapol doko goro, dok dano acel acel cwinye bitur woko lirut, <verse eid="ISA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 13:8" />cwinygi ducu bipong ki lworo. Arem madit me lworo ki me kumu me can bimakogi matek; gibitwenye calo dako matye ki arem me nywal. Gibinene keken gi kun komgi myel; wanggi biboke woko calo mac. <verse eid="ISA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 13:9" />Wunen, nino pa Rwot tye kabino. Nino mager, dok akemo ki kiniga ma mager dong omake, ma bimiyo lobo dong obur, tyeko lubalo woko ducu ki iye. <verse eid="ISA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 13:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 32:7">Eje 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:29">Mat 24:29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-25">Mar 13:24-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25">Luk 21:25</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12-13">Niy 6:12-13</ref></char></note>Pien lakalatwe me polo ki dulgi pe gibiryeny; ceng bicido woko macol licuc ma pud nongo tuc atuca ki tung kunyango, dwe bene pe biryeny. <verse eid="ISA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 13:11" />Abiketo can ikom lobo pi time marac, ki ikom jo maracu pi balgi; abigiko wake pa jo ma ginyate, abimiyo jo ma lyere ma pe gin lukica kwe woko. <verse eid="ISA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 13:12" />Abimiyo dano bibedo nok tutwal makato jabu ma kiliyo mabere; wel dano bene bibedo nok tutwal makato jabu me Opir woko. <verse eid="ISA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 13:13" />Pimeno abimiyo polo yenge, lobo bene biyenge ki i kabedone pi akemo pa Rwot me mony, inino me kinigane mager tutwali. <verse eid="ISA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 13:14" />Macalo ruda ma kitye kadwaro, nyo romi ma ngat mo peke ma cokogi kacel, ci dano acel acel bidok bot lutugi, ngat acel acel biringo dok i lobo tugi kikome. <verse eid="ISA 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 13:15" />Ngat ma kibinongo, kibicobo iye kitucu woko pil, ngat ma kibimako, kibineko woko ki pala lucwan. <verse eid="ISA 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 13:16" />Kibinyoto lutino lukeregi woko ma nongo gin bene gineno ki wanggi; kibiyako odigi woko bene, dok kibimako mon gi kibutu kwedgi tektek. <verse eid="ISA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 13:17" />Nen, atye kapiyo jo Medi woko me bino ka lweny ikom Babilon; gin jo ma pe paro pi lim, dok bene pe gibedo ki yomcwiny pi lonyo jabu. <verse eid="ISA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 13:18" />Kibicelo awobe ki aterogi ginekogi woko; kica pe bimakogi ikom lutino awobe; wanggi bene pe bibedo ki kica ikom lutino lukere. <verse eid="ISA 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 13:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Aca 19:24</ref></char></note>Dong Babilon ma deyone dit kato deyo pa luker mukene ducu, en taun madit maber ma jo Kaldaya giwake kwede tutwali, bibedo calo Codom ki Gomora mayam Lubanga oretogi woko. <verse eid="ISA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 13:20" />Dano pe dok bibedo iye, dano mo me Arab pe biguru kemane kunu, lukwat bene pe gibimiyo romigi butu piny kunu. <verse eid="ISA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 13:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:14">Ica 34:14</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:14">Jep 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:2">Niy 18:2</ref></char></note>Ento lee me tim aye bibutu kunu, gin makwo ma kok bipong woko i odigi; udu bene bibedo kunu, kun jogi nongo myelo amyela macalo nyogi oyima. <verse eid="ISA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 13:22" />Lalur bikok i odigi ma ocudu malo likung, ki too bene bikok i odigi mabeco me ker; Babilon dong pe birii, karene me gik dong cok tutwal.<verse eid="ISA 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ISA 14" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot bidwoko jo Icrael i lobogi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 14:1" />Rwot bitimo kica ki Yakobo, biyero jo Icrael doki, ci dwokogi i lobogi kikome, rok mukene biribe kwedgi, ci dong gimoko matwal ikom ot pa Yakobo. <verse eid="ISA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 14:2" />Rok mapol bilwoko jo Icrael terogi i kabedogi, ka dong jo Icrael lokogi woko gidoko opiigi ki angecagi i lobo pa Rwot; gibimako jo mayam omakogi giloko gidoko opiigi, dok gibiloyo jo mayam ounugi.<verse eid="ISA 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot me Babilon i lobo pa jo ma oto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 14:3" />Kare ma Rwot bimiyowu iye yweyo ikom can mewu, ki ikom myelcwiny ma wubedo kwede ki tic mapek ma wubedo katiyone, <verse eid="ISA 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 14:4" />wubicako nywaro rwot me Babilon ki wer kuman ni, “Kong inen kit ma ngat mayam unu danoni dong kwone otum kwede , kit ma kolo mager pa won pala dong okwe kwede mot! <verse eid="ISA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 14:5" />Rwot dong oturu teko pa jo maracu woko, kacel ki twero me ker pa luloc, <verse eid="ISA 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 14:6" />jo ma gubedo ka goyo lurok kun gitye ki akemo madit adada, ma pe gijuku cinggi ikomgi; jo ma gubedo kaloyo lobo ki kiniga, ma pe guweko keto ayela ikomgi. <verse eid="ISA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 14:7" />Lobo dong oywe, tye ma okwe mot, jo ma bedo iye dong gimoro wer keken. <verse eid="ISA 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 14:8" />Yadi ciprec cwinygi yom piri, ki yadi cedar me Lebanon giwaco ni, ‘Cake ma dong kituru keri woko, ngat mo ma bino ka tongowa dong peke.’ <verse eid="ISA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 14:9" />Lyel tye ka yube me jolo rwot me Babilon, me rwate kwede kabino, tye kacoyo tipu pa jo ma oto me bino ka mote, jo ducu mayam gubedo lutel iwi lobo; luker ducu mayam guloyo rok omiyogi ducu gua woko ki iwi komkergi. <verse eid="ISA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 14:10" />Gin ducu gibilok, kun giwaco boti ni, ‘In bene dong idoko goro calo wan! Dong idoko calo wan! <verse eid="ISA 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 14:11" />Deyoni dong kiketo woko piny i lyel, kacel ki koko nangani; kwidi dong gudoko kitanda ma ibutu iwiye, ki kwidi ma camo kom danoni dong gudoko giumi.’<verse eid="ISA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 14:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 8:10">Niy 8:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 9:1">9:1</ref></char>
    </note>In rwot me Babilon, in lakalatwe me rupiny! Kit ma imwome ki i polo i poto kwede piny! Kit ma kiboli kwede woko piny, in ma ireto rok mapatpati! <verse eid="ISA 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 14:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:23">Mat 11:23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:15">Luk 10:15</ref></char></note>Iwaco ki i cwinyi ni, ‘Abiito acito malo i polo; abicibo komkera malo iwi lakalatwe pa Lubanga; abibedo iwi got me coke kamabor tung kumalo. <verse eid="ISA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 14:14" />Abiito malo tutwal iwi pol, dong abikete kena me bedo macalo Ngat Mamalo Twal.’ <verse eid="ISA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 14:15" />Ento in dong kikeli kiketi woko piny i lyel, ite bur kama tut adada. <verse eid="ISA 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 14:16" />Jo ma oto ma bineni gibiciko wanggi ikomi kun gipenye ni, ‘Man pe en ngat ma nene omiyo kom lobo ducu myel tutwali, ma bene omiyo ker mapol oyenge?’ <verse eid="ISA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 14:17" />Pe en aye mayam omiyo lobo odoko calo tim aroo, ma obedo ka reto gangi ma iye woko liweng, ma pe oye ni lumabuce gudok cen paco?<verse eid="ISA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 14:18" />Luker me rok gibutu gigi piny i lyelgi ki deyo, ngat acel acel butu i lyele ma kiyike iye; <verse eid="ISA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 14:19" />ento in dong kiboli woko cen kamabor mada ki lyeli, calo jang yat ma konye peke, kiumu komi ki kom dano ma kineko, jo ma kicobogi ki pala lucwan, jo ma donyo piny i gweng matye ite bur matut piny, macalo kom dano ma oto ma kinyono piny. <verse eid="ISA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 14:20" />In pe ibiribe kwedgi ka kiyiki, pien in dong ibalo loboni woko, dok ineko lutuwu woko. Likwayo pa lutim maracu pe myero dong kicak nyinggi matwal! <verse eid="ISA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 14:21" />Wuyub ka neko lutinone pi bal alii pa kwarogi, wek pe dok gua gulo lobo, guger taun madito obed mapol ata iwi lobo.”<verse eid="ISA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lubanga bityeko jo Babilon woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 14:22" />Rwot me mony owaco ni, “Abia ka lweny ikom jo Babilon, abimiyo nying dano rwenyo woko ki i Babilon, dano mo pe bidong iye, kadi lutino matino nyo likwayo. <verse eid="ISA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 14:23" />Abimiyo okodo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:23 </char><char style="fk">Okodo </char> cal ki coo ento en dok tidi. </note> leyo lobogi, dok bene kama pii pong gure iye bibedo pol ata; abiyweyo Babilon woko maleng ki oywec matyeko dano woko liweng, an Rwot me mony dong awaco.”<verse eid="ISA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lubanga bityeko jo Aciria woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 14:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:5-34">Ica 10:5-34</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 1:1-3:19">Nak 1:1—3:19</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:13-15">Jep 2:13-15</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot me mony dong okwongo kwong ni, “Kit ma dong atyeko yubune kwede con, bitime bene kitmeno, kit macalo atamo kwede bitime bene dong kumeno. <verse eid="ISA 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 14:25" />Abityeko jo Aciria woko ki i lobona, abinyonogi woko piny iwi got ma mera; ayokone biluny woko bene ki ingut jona, ki terne bene ki bilunyu woko ki iwi gwokgi. <verse eid="ISA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 14:26" />Man aye dong gin ma ayubu ma okemo lobo ducu; dok man cinga ma dong atyeko ryeyone me pwodo rok ducu.” <verse eid="ISA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 14:27" />Rwot me mony dong otyeko yubu yube woko, anga mono ma dok bibalone? Dok bene oryeyo cinge woko, anga kono ma dok bidolone?<verse eid="ISA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lubanga bityeko jo Piliciti woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 14:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 16:20">2 Luk 16:20</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 28:27">2 Tek 28:27</ref></char>
    </note>Lok man yam obino oa ki bot Lubanga i mwaka ma rwot Akaj oto iye, kun waco ni,<verse eid="ISA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 14:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 47:1-7">Jer 47:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:15-17">Eje 25:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Joe 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:6-8">Amo 1:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:4-7">Jep 2:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:5-7">Jek 9:5-7</ref></char>
    </note>“Wun jo Piliciti ducu, cwinywu pe obed yom ni pien odoo mayam gibedo kagoyowu kwedeni dong otur woko, pien ororo bia ki ikin likwayo twol, tonge bitoko doko twol ma tuk cito malo. <verse eid="ISA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 14:30" />Rwot bikwayo jo ma lucan ki ikin lwake, bimiyo jo ma piny obwoyogi butu piny ki kuc; ento in, abimiyo kec neko likwayi woko, joni mogo ma gudonge bene abinekogi woko.<verse eid="ISA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 14:31" />Dong oduru, in dog cel, in taun madit bene ikok ba; wun jo Piliciti ducu, wumii lworo ocak onyo koyo ikomwu! Pien lukwor tye kabino ki tung kumalo, pe tye dano mo ma ikin gi ma opoke kene.<verse eid="ISA 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 14:32" />Wubiwaco gin ango, bot lukwena pa rok meno? Wubiwaco ni, ‘Rwot omiyo Cion ocung matek, jone ma kiunu dong gunongo kalare kunu.’”<verse eid="ISA 14:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ISA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga bityeko Moab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 15:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 25:10-12">Ica 25:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 48:1-47">Jer 48:1-47</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:8-11">Eje 25:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 2:1-3">Amo 2:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:8-11">Jep 2:8-11</ref></char>
    </note>Man aye lok ma pire tek ma kitito ikom Moab. Taun madito me Ar ki Kir dong kijwerogi woko i dyewor acel keken, omiyo Moab dong ogik woko.<verse eid="ISA 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 15:2" />Jo Dibon dong gucito malo i abilagi kakoko kunu; jo Moab tye kakok pi Nebo ki pi Medeba. Wi dano ducu dong kilyelo woko pi kumu, yer tikgu ducu bene dong kilyelo woko. <verse eid="ISA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 15:3" />Dano giruku bongo cola idye gudu; ki iwi odigi kadi wa idye taun madito dano ducu kok ma pig wangi mol amola i korgi. <verse eid="ISA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 15:4" />Jo Kecbon kacel ki jo Eleale bene gitye kakoko, dwongi winye kamabor wa i Jakaj. Pimeno lulweny me Moab gudoko lwor mada; cwinygi dong ongabe angaba ma kerugi dong otum woko. <verse eid="ISA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 15:5" />Cwinya ton tutwal pi Moab; jo ducu mayam gibedo iye, dong guringo woko i Joar, guringo bene wa i Eglat-celiciya. Guito cere me Lukit, gucito malo kun gikok ki pig wanggi; ki i yoo ma cito piny i Koronaim gikok ka gineno kit macalo lobo dong kibalo kwede. <verse eid="ISA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 15:6" />Pii ma i Nimrim dong otwo woko liweng; lum oner woko pe dong twero lot, gin mo ma twi bene dong peke matwal. <verse eid="ISA 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 15:7" />Pimeno jami mabup mayam onongo kinongo, kacel ki jami mayam kikano, gin ducu dong kiyakogi gitero woko loka ora Kulu Caka. <verse eid="ISA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 15:8" />Koko madwong tutwal tye kawinye, ma oromo i lobo Moab woko ducu; koko tye kawinye wa i Elam, dok bene dong owinye wa i Beer-elim. <verse eid="ISA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 15:9" />Pii me Dibon dong odoko remo keken; kadi bed kumeno pud dok abimedo can mukene ikom Dibon, abikelo labwor kikome dong ikom jo Moab ma gubwot ma guringo woko, wa ikom jo ma gudong i lobo meno.<verse eid="ISA 15:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ISA 16" />
  <para style="s1">Piny obwoyo Moab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 16:1" />Gucwalo lutino romi me pwoc bot laloc me Jerucalem, gucwalo ki i Cela, obino owok ki i tim aroo, ci guterogi iwi got Cion. <verse eid="ISA 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 16:2" />Mon me Moab kitenyogi woko ata iwang wat me kulu Arnon ci gibibedo kawire atata calo lutino winyo ma kikeyogi woko atata ki i odigi. <verse eid="ISA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 16:3" />Gin giwaco bot jo Juda ni, “Wutit ki wan gin ma myero watim. Wugwokwa wunu calo tipu yat; macwalo tipune icwiny dyeceng amac wek waywe iye. Wan oring ayela wugwokwa wunu kama pe kiromo nongowa. <verse eid="ISA 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 16:4" />Wuwek jo Moab ma kiryemogi wokoni gubed ikinwu; dong wubed macalo kalaregi ki i cing jo ma dong otimogi maliti.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 16:4">Ikare ma nongo jo mayam unugi dong gipeke, ki nek ki unu dano bene nongo dong ogik woko, ki ngat ma nyonogi diyogi piny bene dong orwenyo woko ki i lobo, <verse eid="ISA 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 16:5" />ci ikare meno aye lakwar Daudi kibicibo iwi komker me mar ma pe loke, en dano ma gene, ngat ma ngolo kop, dok ma mito ni kingol kop kakare, ngat ma kome mit katiyo gin matye atir. <verse eid="ISA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 16:6" />Jo Juda owaco ni, “Wan wawinyo pi wake pa Moab, kit ma onongo giwake kwede; wakegi, lyeregi ki ngalagi, wa nyateginu ducu obedo goba keken.” <verse eid="ISA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 16:7" />Pimeno wek jo Moab gukoki, dano ducu myero gukok pi lobo Moab, Myero gukok matek pi pok olok mutwo me Kir-karecet mayam gubedo kacamoneni. <verse eid="ISA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 16:8" />Poti ma i Kecbon ducu dong gubale woko, ki olok me Cibma; olok mayam kongo bwinone mero rwodi me rok dong kiretogi woko piny. Jange onongo yam ojany oo wa i Jajer, olak oo wa i tim; jange matocone yam ojany matek, okade ongolo dye nam woko arii. <verse eid="ISA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 16:9" />Meno aye gin ma omiyo atye ka kok pi olok me Cibma, kit macalo akok kwede pi taun madit me Jajer; pig wanga cwer pi, Kecbon ki Eleale; pien kac dong peke mamiyo dano bedo ki yomcwiny. <verse eid="ISA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 16:10" />Yomic ki yomcwiny madwong dong kikwanyo woko ki i poti mayam olok nyak iye matek ca, dok bene pe dong kiwero wer i poti olok, woo mo bene pe dok winye iye, nyono olok i bur me biyo kongo bwino bene dong ogik woko; ki woo mayam dano giwoo kwede ka gipwono oloki dong peke. <verse eid="ISA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 16:11" />Meno omiyo cwinya tuge tutwal me loko lok ikom Moab calo nanga ma kok, cwinya tuge bene me loko lok ikom Kir-kerec.<verse eid="ISA 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 16:12" />Jo me Moab mine ken gi me cito i abilagi matye malo iwi godi kaworo lubangagi ento pe bikonyogi wa ki acel.<verse eid="ISA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 16:13" />Man aye lok mayam Rwot oloko con ikom Moab. <verse eid="ISA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 16:14" />Ento kombedi Rwot owaco ni, “I mwaka me adeke ma obedo kit ma calo lapakaca kwano ki mwaka me ticeni, deyo pa Moab bidoko ginacaya kadi bed en tye ki lwak jo mapol ata. Jo mo ma bibwot gibibedo nok tutwal, dok bene nongo dong gin jo ma goro keken.”<verse eid="ISA 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ISA 17" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga bipwodo Ciria ki Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 17:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 49:23-27">Jer 49:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:3-5">Amo 1:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:1">Jek 9:1</ref></char>
    </note>Man aye lok ma pire tek ma Rwot otito bot Icaya ma kemo Damaciko. En owaco ni, “Nen, Damaciko dong pe bimede ki bedo taun madit, ento bidoko obur matwal. <verse eid="ISA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 17:2" />Taune ducu kibiweko doko tim matwal; bibedo kacam pa romi ki dyangi keken, ma gibibutu piny kunu ma ngat mo bibedo peke mamiyo lworo makogi. <verse eid="ISA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 17:3" />Cel matek birwenyo woko ki i Epraim, ker bene birwenyo woko ki Damaciko; ento jo ma gudong gibibedo macalo deyo pa jo Icrael. Man lok pa Rwot me mony kikome.”<verse eid="ISA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 17:4" />Inino meno deyo pa Yakobo bijwik woko, can bileyo ka lonyone. <verse eid="ISA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 17:5" />Icrael bibedo macalo poto ma kikayo bel ki iye, ma iye odong nono calo nota Repaim ma kibeko wit bel ducu ki iye. <verse eid="ISA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 17:6" />Jo ma manoknok aye bidong, kit macalo kipwono kwede nyig jeituni, ma nongo dong aryo nyo adek keken iwi jange mamalo; ki angwen nyo abic keken aye dong i jang ma piny. Man lok pa Rwot Lubanga me Icrael kikome.<verse eid="ISA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 17:7" />Ka nino meno oromo, dano gibiloke neno Lacwecgi pi kony, gibiciko wanggi kun gineno Lubanga Maleng pa jo Icrael. <verse eid="ISA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 17:8" />Dong pe gibiketo gen gi ikom keno tyer mayam gutiyo ki cinggi, pe gibigeno gin ma gin ki komgi yam gutiyo, kadi yadi ma kipito kama kiworo iye jok ma dako ma kilwongo ni Acera nyo keno tyer me wango odok eceta.<verse eid="ISA 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 17:9" />Inino meno taun gi madito matego bibedo calo taun madito pa jo Kiv ki pa jo Amor mayam gua woko ki iye pi lworo jo Icrael. <verse eid="ISA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 17:10" />Pien wun jo Icrael wiwu dong owil woko ikom Lubanga ma olarowu dok ma gwokowu macalo got matek kama wuringo wularo iye. Pimeno kadi bed wupit gin mogo ma yomo cwiny, dok bene kadi bed wupit yadi mogo ma gin yadi pa lubanga pa lurok, <verse eid="ISA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 17:11" />kadi wumii gutwi inino meno ma wupitogi iyeni, dok kadi wumiyo gituru woko i odiko ma kipitogi iye, ento pe wubikayo iye gin mo, wubibedo ki can ki arem ma pe gik keken.<verse eid="ISA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiloyo lumerok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 17:12" />Kong wuwiny kit ma lwak me rok mapol dwongi mor kwede calo kot ma mor; gimwoc ki woo kit macalo pii nam twage kwede. Kong wuwiny woo pa lwak me rok mapol; giwoo calo mor pa pii biamwonyi matek matye ka twage. <verse eid="ISA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 17:13" />Lurok tye kabino ki woo calo twage pa pii madit tutwal, ento Lubanga bijukugi, miyo giringo woko kamabor; kibiryemogi woko calo cung kal ma yamo tingo tero iwi got malo, dok macalo apwa ma wire ikare ma yamo kot tye kakodo matek adada. <verse eid="ISA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 17:14" />Ki otyeno lurok gimiyo lworo madit mada, ento ma nongo piny peya oru gibibedo peke! Meno aye can ma bipoto ikom jo ma giyako jamiwa ki i lobowa, meno aye dul ma kipoko botgi gin jo ma yakowa.<verse eid="ISA 17:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ISA 18" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga bipwodo Etiopia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 18:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEP 2:12">Jep 2:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>In lobo matye loka kulu Etiopia, kama bwom ngur winye iye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lobo ma bwom latugutugu ngur winye iye. </char></note> calo yamo lapiru. <verse eid="ISA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 18:2" />Ma ioro lukwenani ma cung pi loboni giwok ki i kulu Nail, kun giwoto ki yeya ma kitiyo ki togo ma kwang iwi pii! Wudok cen, wun lukwena madwir, wudok bot rok ma jone gudongo maboco dok ma komgi pwot, bot rok ma jone kilworogi i kabedo ducu, rok matek, ma jone aye loyo i lweny, ma kulu mapol opoko lobogi woko idyere.<verse eid="ISA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 18:3" />Wuwiny, wun jo ducu ma wubedo iwi lobo, wun jo ma wubedo i lobo, kace kitingo bendera malo iwi got, myero wunen! Ka kikutu buriji, myero wuwiny! <verse eid="ISA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 18:4" />Pien Rwot owaca ni, “Abineno lalingling ki i kabedona, calo lyeto me ceng maryeny dyeceng, calo pol mamiyo toyo luk ikare me kac. <verse eid="ISA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 18:5" />Pien ma pud peya kare me pwono olok oromo, ma ture dong ocako o woko, kun ture dong oluru odoko nyig olok ma dong ocako cek, ci merok bityeko jo Etiopia woko calo pala ma ngolo jang olok. <verse eid="ISA 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 18:6" />Kibiweko kom jo ducu ma kinekogi ata bot acut matye iwi got malo, ki bot lee me tim. Acut bicamogi woko i oro, ki lee me tim bicamogi woko i cwir.”<verse eid="ISA 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 18:7" />Ikare meno rok ma jone odongo maboco ma komgi pwot, gibikelo mot bot Rwot me mony. Gin rok ma jone kilworogi i kabedo ducu, rok matek, ma jone aye loyo i lweny, ma kulu mapol opoko lobogi woko idyere. Gibikelo motgi iwi got Cion, kama kiworo iye Rwot me mony.<verse eid="ISA 18:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ISA 19" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga bipwodo Ejipt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 19:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 46:2-26">Jer 46:2-26</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 29:1-21">Eje 29:1-21</ref></char>
    </note>Man aye lok ma pire tek ma kitito ikom Ejipt.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 19:1">Nen, Rwot tye kawot madwir tutwal i pol, kun woto bino kwede i Ejipt. Cal jogi me Ejipt komgi bimyel inyime, cwiny jo Ejipt bibedo karyange aryanga.<verse eid="ISA 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 19:2" />Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Abitugu jo Ejipt me lweny ikom wadigi keken gi, dano acel acel bilweny gin ki omine, ngat acel acel bene bilwenyo gin ki lawote, taun madit acel bilweny ikom taun madit mukene, ki ker bene bilweny ikom ker wadigi. <verse eid="ISA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 19:3" />Cwiny jo Ejipt dong bibale woko matwal, tamgi mayam gumoko ducu bitur woko, gibicito ka penyo tam ki bot cal jogi apaya ki bot lutyet, ki bot lukor tipu ki ajwaki. <verse eid="ISA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 19:4" />Dok abimiyo jo Ejipt i cing rwot ma loce gwa atika, rwot mager tutwal aye ma biloyogi. Man lok ma an Rwot Matwero ducu aye awaco.”<verse eid="ISA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 19:5" />Pii me kulu Nail bene bidwon woko, pii ma icwiny kulu kikome bitwo woko. <verse eid="ISA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 19:6" />Yoo pii ma kikwinyo akwinya bidoko ngwe, jang kulu Nail me Ejipt bidwon ci two woko ducu, lagada kacel ki togo ducu matye iye gibitop woko. <verse eid="ISA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 19:7" />Lobo matye inget kulu Nail ducu bital woko doko bar, i dog kulu Nail kikome, ginapita ducu ma kicoyogi inget Nail bitwo woko, ci yamo bikologi wacen ma pe dok binen. <verse eid="ISA 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 19:8" />Lumakrec gibikumu dok gibikok, jo ducu ma yutu rec ki goli i kulu Nail; jo ducu ma giciko obwogi idye pii gin ducu cwinygi bibale woko. <verse eid="ISA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 19:9" />Jo ma cwero tol tworo ki jo ma cweyo bongo matar cwinygi bia woko ki ikom ticgi. <verse eid="ISA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 19:10" />Jo ma kigenogi tutwal ki i lobo meno, kibinginyogi woko, dok jo ducu ma camo mucara cwinygi bibale woko.<verse eid="ISA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 19:11" />Luloc me Joan giming mada; luryeko ducu mamiyo tam bot Parao, gin ducu gimiye tam me mingo keken. Itwero waco bot Parao ningning ni, “Kwariwa ducu yam gubedo jo maryek?” Dok ni, “Kwariwa ducu yam gubedo luker?” <verse eid="ISA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 19:12" />Joni ma ryeki dong gitye kwene? Kong gutiti lok wek inge gin ma Rwot me mony oyube me timo ikom Ejipt. <verse eid="ISA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 19:13" />Rwodi me Joan dong guloke gudoko luming, ki me Mempic kibwologi woko; jo ma gubedo lutel wigi i kakagi ducu aye ma omiyo jo Ejipt ongak. <verse eid="ISA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 19:14" />Rwot dong oketo cwiny me adwala i igi; omiyo jo Ejipt dong gicato acata i gin ducu ma gitiyo, kit macalo lamero cato kwede ingoke. <verse eid="ISA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 19:15" />Dano mo pe bidong i Ejipt pe tye gin mo ma dano mo bitiyo, kadi latel wic nyo kadi dano mo ata, pe bibedo ki kony kadi lalonyo nyo lacan.<verse eid="ISA 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 19:16" />Ikare meno jo Ejipt bibedo calo mon, kun komgi myel amyela kilworo pi cing Rwot me mony ma en biyengo ikomgi me pwodogi. <verse eid="ISA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 19:17" />Lobo Juda bimiyo lworo bot jo Ejipt; jo ducu ma gibiwinyo nyinge gibibedo ki lworo pi lok ma Rwot me mony dong otyeko yubu con me timo ikomgi.<verse eid="ISA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 19:18" />Ikare meno leb jo Kanaan kibilokone i taun madito abic matye i lobo Ejipt, dok bene gibikwongo kwong i nying Rwot me mony. Dong taun madit acel ki ikin gi kibilwongo ni, “Taun madit me Ceng.”<verse eid="ISA 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 19:19" />Ikare meno keno tyer pa Rwot bibedo idye lobo Ejipt, ki got ma kicibo ocung atir pi po pi Rwot bicung iwang lobone kikome. <verse eid="ISA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 19:20" />Got man bibedo macalo lanen ma nyutu ni Rwot me mony tye i Ejipt. Kace jo ma kunu bikok bot Rwot pi jo ma unugi, ci en bicwalo botgi ngat ma bilarogi, ngat ma bilok kun cung pirgi ka dok bilarogi. <verse eid="ISA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 19:21" />Rwot binyute kene bot jo Ejipt. Ikare meno jo Ejipt bingeyo Rwot, gibiwore kun gityero bote mot ki gitum awanga, dok bene gibikwongo kwongi inyim Rwot ci gibicobo cikegi. <verse eid="ISA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 19:22" />Rwot bipwodo jo Ejipt kun goyogi ka dok cangogi woko. Gibidwogo cen bot Rwot, ci en biwinyo legagi dok bene bicangogi.<verse eid="ISA 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 19:23" />Ikare meno yoo gudu bia ki i Ejipt cito wa i Aciria. Jo Aciria bicito i Ejipt, jo Ejipt bene bicito i Aciria, dong jo Ejipt kacel ki jo Aciria, gin ducu biworo Lubanga kacel.<verse eid="ISA 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 19:24" />Ikare meno jo Icrael bibedo me adek me bedo kacel ki jo Ejipt ki jo Aciria, ci gibimiyo lobo ducu bedo ki gum. <verse eid="ISA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 19:25" />Rwot me mony bimiyo botgi gum, kun waco ni, “Gum obed ikom jona jo Ejipt, ki ikom jo Aciria, ma gin aye jo ma an acweyogi ki cinga, ki ikom jo Icrael ma gin dong gudoko jona kikome.”<verse eid="ISA 19:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ISA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Lanyut me wot munero pa Lanebi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 20:1" />Ite twero pa Cargon rwot me Aciria, lawimony madit me Aciria olwenyo ikom taun madit me Acidod, ci omayo woko. <verse eid="ISA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 20:2" />Ikare meno kikome aye Rwot omiyo lok bot Icaya wod pa Amoj ni, “Cit igony bongo cola woko ki i pyeri, ka igony war woko bene ki i tyeni.” Ci Icaya ocito otimo kitmeno, odong munero ma wa war bene peke i tyene. <verse eid="ISA 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 20:3" />Ikare ma kimayo Acidod, Rwot owaco ni, “Kit macalo latica Icaya owoto munero, kun tyene bene tye nono, pi mwaka adek kulu pi nyutu gin ma bitime ikom jo Ejipt ki jo Etiopia, <verse eid="ISA 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 20:4" />kitmeno bene rwot me Aciria bitero jo Ejipt woko i opii, ki jo Etiopia bene. Kibitero jo matino ki jo madito kun giwoto munero, ma tyen gi bene tye nono, ki dudgi bene tye nono, ci man bikelo lewic ikom Ejipt. <verse eid="ISA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 20:5" />Man bibalo cwinygi woko, ki lewic bene bimakogi pi Etiopia mayam onongo gigeno, ki pi Ejipt ma onongo yam ginyate kwedeni. <verse eid="ISA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 20:6" />Inino meno jo ma bedo i dog nam gibiwaco ni, ‘Kong dong wunen gin ma otime ikom jo mayam wageno, mayam waringo walaro botgi wek gukonywa, wek bene gularwa ki i cing rwot me Aciria. Ci man dong wabibwot ningning?’”<verse eid="ISA 20:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ISA 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ginanyuta matito pi poto pa Babilon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 21:1" />Man lok ma pire tek ma kitito ikom Babilon, ma en aye lobo matye i dog nam. Kit macalo yamo lapiru kodo mager kwede i Negeb, kitmeno bene can bibino kun a ki i tung kupiny, ki i lobo ma dano lworo tutwal. <verse eid="ISA 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 21:2" />Lubanga onyutu bota lok mapek mada; layak gire yako jami pa dano ayaka, ngat ma balo lobo bene neko dano woko liweng ki i lobo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 21:2">In Elam, cit malo i lweny, ki in Media, dong irum taun maditi woko! Kit can ducu ma Babilon okelo abityeko woko, abimiyo gik woko licwic. <verse eid="ISA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 21:3" />Lanyut meno omiyo arem madwong oketo pyera woko, omiyo koma ducu rem mwode atata calo dako ma rem ki nywal; odiya woko piny ma dong pe miyo aromo winyo kit gin mo; poyo koma apoya, ma pe dong aromo neno gin mo. <verse eid="ISA 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 21:4" />Tam dong oloya woko, lworo madit adada dong obalo wiya woko; ka abedo kaparo pi otyeno ma piny tye ribiribi; ento meno ducu kela myelkom keken. <verse eid="ISA 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 21:5" />I ginanyuta aneno ni dong kiyubu meja woko, mukeka bene dong kipeto woko, gitye dong kacam kun gimato mat bene. Ci lawimony odange ni, “Wun rwodi wua malo, wuwir kom kwotwu ki moo!” <verse eid="ISA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 21:6" />Pien Rwot owaco bota kuman ni, “Cit ikel lakurpiny, myero otit gin ma en tye kanenone. <verse eid="ISA 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 21:7" />Ka en bineno wegi aguragura ma giringo aryo aryo, jo ma iwi kana ki jo ma iwi kinaga, myero en ocik ite matek, dok onengi maber tutwal.” <verse eid="ISA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 21:8" />Ci lakurpiny odange ni, “Ai Rwot, acung iwi lubele malo dyeceng jwi, acung i kabedona bene dyewor benebene.<verse eid="ISA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 21:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 14:8">Niy 14:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:2">18:2</ref></char>
    </note>Nen wegi aguragura gitye karingo ki aryo aryo.” Cutcut gugamo doge ni, “Babilon dong opoto, opoto gire woko; cal jogi apaya ducu ma dano giworo kinginyogi woko piny.”<verse eid="ISA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 21:10" />Wun jona, ma kidinowu woko ka kipyetowu woko calo ngano, gin maber ma awinyo ki bot Rwot me mony, ma en Lubanga me Icrael en aye atito botwu.<verse eid="ISA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma kitito ikom Edom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 21:11" />Man lok ma pire tek ma kitito ikom Edom. Ngat mo tye kalwonga ki i Ceir, kun penya ni, “Lakurpiny, dyewor obedo ningning? Lakurpiny, dyewor obedo ningning?” <verse eid="ISA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 21:12" />Lakurpiny ogamo ni, “Piny dong oru woko, dyewor dok bidwogo. Kace wumito penya pire, ci wutwero dwogo dok ka penya; wutwero dwogo cen kany gire pi tyen me aryo.”<verse eid="ISA 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lok ma gitito ikom lobo pa jo Arab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 21:13" />Man lok ma pire tek ma kitito ikom lobo pa jo Arab. Wun jo Dedan ma wutye kamol ki kinagawuni, wubibutu idye okutu itim aroo matye i lobo pa jo Arab. <verse eid="ISA 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 21:14" />Wumii pii amata bot jo ma orwo pii nekogi, wumii bene cam bot wuring ayela, wun jo ma wubedo i lobo Tema. <verse eid="ISA 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 21:15" />Pien guringo pala lucwan, pala dong kiwoto woko ki i akura, ki atum ma kiketo iye atero ma dong kitelo woko, ki can mogo ma lweny kelo.<verse eid="ISA 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 21:16" />Pien man aye lok ma Rwot owaca ni, “Dong odong mwaka acel keken, calo kit ma lapakaca kwano ki mwaka me tice, ci deyo me Kedar ducu bidoko ginacaya. <verse eid="ISA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 21:17" />Jo me Kedar ma gin oteka ma gibidong ki ikin jo ma celo atero, welgi bibedo nok; pien an Rwot Lubanga pa jo Icrael dong aloko man.”<verse eid="ISA 21:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ISA 22" />
  <para style="s1">Kwena ma mako Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 22:1" />Man lok ma pire tek ma kitito ikom nota me ginanyuta ma Lubanga onyutu bot Icaya. Gin ango matye katime ma oweko wun ducu wutye iwi odiwu kakwero karama? <verse eid="ISA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 22:2" />Pingo dano ducu ma i taun madit gitye ka dange ki woo me yomcwiny? Jowu ma guto i lweny ca, pe kinekogi ki pala lucwan, pe bene kinekogi i lweny kadi ki acel. <verse eid="ISA 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 22:3" />Lulocwu ducu onongo dong guringo woko kacel, kinguku makogi woko ma peya gulwenyo. Jo ducu ma kinongogi kimakogi woko, kadi bed jo mogo ikin gi guringo kamabor tutwal. <verse eid="ISA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 22:4" />Ma omiyo awaco ni, “Wulok wangwu cen, pe wunena, wuwek akok matek pi cwercwiny ma atye kwede. Ngat mo pe oyele ka kweyo cwinya, pien jona ma kinekogi pol tutwal.”<verse eid="ISA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 22:5" />Pien Rwot Lubanga me mony tye ki ninone, ma ninone obedo nino me woo, ki me nyono dano woko piny, ki nino me bango dano ducu i lung me ginanyuta, ma en aye bene nino me muku cel me gang woko dok dano bikok ki iye atata ki ikin godi. <verse eid="ISA 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 22:6" />Mony ma oa ki i Elam gubino ma gingweco iwi aguragura kun gungabo juru aterogi dong angaba, ki mony ma oa ki i Kir dong gitye ma gutere woko ki kwotgi. <verse eid="ISA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 22:7" />Nota ma miu ma ceko cam me Judaya gupong ki gadigadi lweny keken, dok wegi aguragura gitye gucung woko i dog cel me Jerucalem. <verse eid="ISA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 22:8" />Gin mayam jo Juda gigengo ki komgi dong orwenyo woko.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 22:8">Inino meno wucito wukelo jami lweny matye i Ot me Bunga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:8 </char><char style="fk">Ot me Bunga </char> obedo ot madit me gure i taun madit me Jerucalem, ma kigedo ki yen ma kikelo ki Lebanon, oweko kilwongo ni Ot me Bunga Lebanon. </note> <verse eid="ISA 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 22:9" />Wuneno kit ma kimuku kwede cel me gangkal pa Daudi, dok wunongo kit me jolo pii piny i ngom i joro. <verse eid="ISA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 22:10" />Wukwano odi ducu ki i Jerucalem, ka wureto odi mogo woko piny wek wunong gweng me gero cel matek. <verse eid="ISA 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 22:11" />Wukwinyo bene joro me pii ikin cel aryo me jolo pii me joro macon. Ento yam pe wutamo pi Lubanga ma oyubu loki wacon, dok ma oweko otime kit menoni.<verse eid="ISA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 22:12" />Inino meno Rwot Lubanga me mony onongo owaciwu ni wukok dok wukum, ni wulyel yer wiwu ki ni wuruk bene bongo cola. <verse eid="ISA 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 22:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:32">1 Kor 15:32</ref></char></note> Ento wun doki wubedo kanyero ki yomcwiny, wuneko twoni dyangi ki romi ma pe wace, wucamo ringo dok wumato kongo bwino. Wuwaco ni, “Wek wacamu cam, dok wamatu mat bene, pien diki wabito woko.” <verse eid="ISA 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 22:14" />Rwot me mony onyute kene bota kun waco ni, “Adada, pe kibitimo kica botgi pi bal man, nio wang ma guto. Man lok ma an Rwot Lubanga me mony aye awaco.”<verse eid="ISA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma kiciko ki Cebna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 22:15" />Rwot Lubanga me mony owaco ni, “Bin icit bot Cebna ma lakan jami, ma en aye lalo jami ma i ot pa rwot, cit ipenye ni, <verse eid="ISA 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 22:16" />‘Tic ango ma itiyo kany? Dok angagi ma obedo wadini kany ma omiyo itye ka golo bur lyeli kekeni kun itongo lyeli iwi got malo? <verse eid="ISA 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 22:17" />Nen, Rwot bikwanyi ki tek ci boli woko cen, kadi bed onongo nene ibedo dano mo matek tutwal. En bimaki woko matek liking, <verse eid="ISA 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 22:18" />ci lungi woko adunu calo odilo ka boli woko cen i lobo mo malac mada. Ibito kunu inget gadigadini ma onongo inyate kwede tutwali. In giri ma ikelo lewic i ot pa laditi. <verse eid="ISA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 22:19" />Abikwanyi woko ki i dog tici, ci adwoki woko cen i rwom mapiny.’<verse eid="ISA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 22:20" />Inino meno ka man dong otime, abilwongo latica Eliakim wod pa Ilkia, <verse eid="ISA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 22:21" />ci abimiyo en aye ruku bongini me tic, ki del me tweyo pyer, ki kitambara me tweyo wic; tweroni ducu abidwoko i cinge. En bibedo calo wego bot jo Jerucalem ki jo Juda. <verse eid="ISA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 22:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:7">Niy 3:7</ref></char></note>Abimiyo twero ducu me ot pa Daudi bedo i wiye. Abimiye layab me loro dogola, ma ka en oloro, ci ngat mo pe dok twero yabone; dok ka oyabo, ngat mo pe twero lorone. <verse eid="ISA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 22:23" />Abimiyo en bedo tek calo teke ma kiguro matek, jo me ot pa wone ducu binongo deyo pire.<verse eid="ISA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 22:24" />Jo me ot pa wone ki wadine ducu bibedo ter mapek tutwal i wiye. Gin ducu gibingabe ikome calo kikopo ki cupa ma kingabo malo. <verse eid="ISA 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 22:25" />Ka man bitime inino meno, ci teke mayam kiguro mateki biyogge woko doko yogoyogo poto woko piny. Meno aye bibedo agiki pa jami ducu mayam gungabe ikome.” Man lok ma Rwot dong otyeko waco.<verse eid="ISA 22:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ISA 23" />
  <para style="s1">Lok ma kitito ikom Turo ki Cidon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 23:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:19">Eje 26:1—28:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Joe 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9-10">Amo 1:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:1-4">Jek 9:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:21-22">Mat 11:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:13-14">Luk 10:13-14</ref></char>
    </note>Man lok ma pire tek ma kitito ikom Turo. Wukok ba, wun lukwang mel ma wutye idye nam, pien Turo dong kibalo woko, odi ki wang wat dong kibalo woko. Lukwang mel gungeyo loke ikare ma gidwogo ki i Caiprac. <verse eid="ISA 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 23:2" />Wukum, wun jo ma wubedo i dog nam, wun lucatwil me Cidon. Lukwenawu yam gungolo nam, gukwang iwi pii madwong adada <verse eid="ISA 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 23:3" />kawilo kal me Cikor, ma dongo i dog kulu me Nail. In onongo yam ibedo lacatwil ma cato wil i rok mapol. <verse eid="ISA 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 23:4" />Lewic myero omaki, in Cidon, pien nam dong oloko, ki cel gogo matek me dog nam bene owaco ni, “Arem me nywal pe ocana gire, pe bene anywal, pe bene apito lutino mo ma gudongo, lutino awobe nyo kadi wa lutino anyira.”<verse eid="ISA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 23:5" />Ka lok man biwinye i Ejipt, ci cwiny dano bicwer matek tutwal pi winyo lok ikom Turo.<verse eid="ISA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 23:6" />Wukat wucit wa i Tarcic, wucit wukoki, wun jo ma wubedo i dog nam! <verse eid="ISA 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 23:7" />Man taun madit mayam dano tye iye ki yomcwiny madwong, taun madit mayam ocake con tutwal, en aye taun madit mayam ocwalo lukwenane gungolo nam, me cito kabedo i lobo mogo mukene. <verse eid="ISA 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 23:8" />Anga ma oyubu lok man ikom Turo, taun madit ma won lalukana me loc, ma lucatwile yam gubedo lutino ker, ma gin jo ma kiworogi adada i lobo? <verse eid="ISA 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 23:9" />Rwot me mony aye ma onongo oyubu, pi giko wakegi me deyo woko ducu, dok me kelo lewic ikom jo me lobo ducu mayam giketo deyo ikomgi. <verse eid="ISA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 23:10" />Wudok cen i lobowu, wun jo me Tarcic; pien wang wat me Turo dong peke. <verse eid="ISA 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 23:11" />Rwot dong oryeyo cinge woko iwi nam, en bene dong otyeko yengo ker ducu; Rwot dong otyeko miyo cik ikom Kanaan, ni myero kitur cel gogone mateki woko. <verse eid="ISA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 23:12" />Rwot Lubanga owaco ni, “Yomcwiny mayam wutye kwede dong ogik, wun jo Cidon; kombedi dong kidiyowu woko matek, ma kadi bed wukat i Caiprac, kunu bene pe wubinongo kayweyo.”<verse eid="ISA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 23:13" />Kong wunen lobo pa jo Kaldaya! Gin aye rok ma onongo gumoko ni Turo bibedo kabedo pa lee tim, ento pe jo Aciria. Gin aye ma gutado lubele ma gucudu malo likung kunu, ka dok gumuku odi madito woko ducu ki kunu, ci gumiyo odoko wi obur.<verse eid="ISA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 23:14" />Wukoki, wun lukwang mel ma wutye idye nam, pien taunwu madit mayam wugeno dong kiketo woko.<verse eid="ISA 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 23:15" />Ikare meno wi dano biwil woko ikom jo Turo pi mwaka pyere abiro kulu, marom aroma ki kare me kwo pa rwot acel. Ka mwaka pyere abiro dong otum, ci Turo bibedo calo malaya ma kiwero pire ni,<verse eid="ISA 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 23:16" />“Kwany opuk agoya, icit kwede idye taun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:16">in dako ma malaya ma wi dano owil woko i komini!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:16">Mi dwon opuk okok ma winye mamit,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:16">wer bene wer mapol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:16">wek dano gucak po piri.”<verse eid="ISA 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 23:17" />Ka mwaka pyere abiro dong otum, Rwot dok biweko Turo dok i dog tice. En dok bitic calo malaya ki ker ducu ma iwi lobo. <verse eid="ISA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 23:18" />Magoba ducu ma en binongo i cato wile meno, pe bigwoko, pe bene bikano mo kadi matidi mo, ento bityero woko me bedo gin maleng bot Rwot, ci kibiwilo ki cam mabup ki bongi mabeco pi jo ma woro Rwot.<verse eid="ISA 23:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ISA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot biketo can ikom lobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 24:1" />Nen, Rwot biweko lobo dong nono, bimiyo doko obur, dok en biloko lobo bedo okani, ci keyo dano woko ma bedo iye. <verse eid="ISA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 24:2" />Ikare meno can ma bipoto ikom ajwaka bibedo rom ki can ma poto ikom dano ata; can ma bipoto ikom opii bibedo rom ki can ma poto ikom ladite; can pa angeca bene bibedo rom ki can pa mego ma en tiyo bote; can pa lacatwil bibedo rom ki can pa lawilwil; can pa lamii banya bibedo rom ki can pa laden banya; can pa ngat ma pido banya bibedo rom ki pa ngat matye ki banya. <verse eid="ISA 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 24:3" />Lobo kibibalone woko, ci kibiyako jami matye iye woko ducu. Man lok pa Rwot kikome.<verse eid="ISA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 24:4" />Lobo tye kakumu, tekone bene orwenyo woko, iwi lobo ducu piny obale woko, teko pa lobo orwenyo woko, polo ducu dong onyonge woko. <verse eid="ISA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 24:5" />Lobo dong obale gire woko inyim Lubanga, pi jo ma bedo iye; pien dano dong guturu cik pa Lubanga woko, pe gulubu gin mayam en ociko, guturu bene wa gicike ma rii nakanakani woko. <verse eid="ISA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 24:6" />Pimeno Lubanga oceno lobo woko, jo ma bedo iye gitye kaneno can iye pi balgi; meno omiyo jo ma i lobo gitye kaneno can, jo manoknok keken aye gudong. <verse eid="ISA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 24:7" />Olok kikome bene dong oner woko, kongo bwino tye kadoko nok, jo ducu mayam cwinygi yom gitye kacur acura. <verse eid="ISA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 24:8" />Ajaa agoya ma kok malongo pi yomo cwiny dano dong oling woko, woo pa jo ma dange ki yomcwiny madwong dong oling woko, yomcwiny mo mamiyo dano goyo opuk bene dong peke. <verse eid="ISA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 24:9" />Dano pe dok mato kongo bwino ki wer idoggi kit mayam con; lumat kongo dong nongo kongo kec idoggi marac. <verse eid="ISA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 24:10" />Jami ma i taun madit ducu dong onyobe woko atata, odi ducu matye i taun madit meno kiloro doggi woko wek dano pe gudony i iye. <verse eid="ISA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 24:11" />Dano tye ka dange ki koko pi kongo bwino ma dong orwenyo woko; kit yomcwiny mayam gitye kwede dong ogik woko, yomcwiny mo dong peke i lobo. <verse eid="ISA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 24:12" />Taun madit dong kiweko odoko obur, dog cel bene kituru woko, ci kingido matinotino. <verse eid="ISA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 24:13" />Bitime kitmeno ikin lurok ma gibedo iwi lobo, bibedo calo yaa ma dong kipwono nyige woko, nyo macalo olok ma dong kikoro nyige woko. <verse eid="ISA 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 24:14" />Jo ma bibwot biilo dwon gi malo kun giwero wer me yomcwiny; woo ma gibidange kwede pi dit pa Rwot biwinye wa tung kupotoceng. <verse eid="ISA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 24:15" />Pimeno wun jo ma wutye kunyango, wubimiyo deyo bot Rwot; ki wun jo ma wubedo i dog nam, wubimiyo deyo i nying Rwot me Icrael. <verse eid="ISA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 24:16" />Cake ki kamabor ma iwi lobo wabiwinyo dano biwero wer me pako Rwot ma en Ngat ma kite atir!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 24:16">Ento an gen mo peke pira! Ajony ningok, ajony ningok, can iwiya gira! Pien jo ma luroro dong gutany woko ki lok rorogi ikom dano, pi lok rorogini omiyo gidoto dano marac tutwal. <verse eid="ISA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 24:17" />Lworo, bur, ki owic, bimakowu, wun jo ma wubedo i lobo. <verse eid="ISA 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 24:18" />Ngat ma biringo woo ma kelo lworo, bipoto woko i bur; kace bikati woko ki i bur, ci bimoko i owic. Pien polo dong biyabe woko, ci guti me te lobo bene biyenge. <verse eid="ISA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 24:19" />Lobo dong bibale woko, lobo dong bibar woko idyere, lobo biyenge matek tutwal. <verse eid="ISA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 24:20" />Lobo dong bitage calo lamero kongo, biyenge calo ot aduc; bale dong dwong, onure woko, orete woko piny ma pe dok twero a malo. <verse eid="ISA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 24:21" />Ikare meno Rwot biketo can ikom mony me polo, ki i polo kunu, ki i lobo kany, ikom luker me lobo. <verse eid="ISA 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 24:22" />Lubanga bicoko rwodi ducu kacel calo mabuc ma i bur, ci biloro wigi woko i ot buc, ka dong kicako keto can ikomgi ma nongo dong kong kare okato malac. <verse eid="ISA 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 24:23" />Alee bitwodo dwe woko, lewic bene bimako ceng; pien Rwot me mony aye bibedo rwot iwi Cion, ki i Jerucalem, binyutu deyone inyim ludongone.<verse eid="ISA 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ISA 25" />
  <para style="s1">Wer me pak</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 25:1" />Ai Rwot, in aye Lubangana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:1">abidwori dok abipako nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:1">pien dong itiyo jami me aura tutwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:1">dok icobo gin mayam iyubu con, ki gen ki ada.<verse eid="ISA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 25:2" />Iloko taun madito odoko obur;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:2">kadi wa taun madito ducu mayam kirumugi ki cel matek;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:2">odi pa lurok bene gudoko obur;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:2">pe dok kibigero gedo mukene kakare.<verse eid="ISA 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 25:3" />Meno bimiyo lwak rok matego giketo deyo ikomi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:3">taun madito ducu pa lurok ma kica peke iye gibilwori.<verse eid="ISA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 25:4" />Pien in aye kabedo matek ma lucan giringo laro iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:4">in i cel gogo matek kama jo ma piny obwoyogi bene giringo laro iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:4">in aye kama dano gwoko iye yamo kot ki lyeto me ceng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:4">Pien aluu yweyo dog dano ma gin pe lukica</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:4">obedo calo yamo kot ma kodo kun pyeto kot wa i kor cel,<verse eid="ISA 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 25:5" />nyo calo lyeto ka piny dong otwo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:5">Dong ijuku woo pa lukwor woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:5">macalo tipu pol ma kweyo lyeto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:5">meno omiyo jo ma pe lukica dong guling,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:5">pe dok giwero wer.<verse eid="ISA 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lubanga oyubu karama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 25:6" />Rwot me mony bitedo karama pi rok ducu iwi got Cion, karama ma kicamo iye ringo makur, ki mato kongo bwino ma ocek mamit adada, ki ringo ma miu, ma moo ma i cogo dwong ata, ki kongo bwino ma kiliyo woko maber ka dong ocek mamit adada. <verse eid="ISA 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 25:7" />Dok iwi got man, Rwot biyeco bongo me cwercwiny ma kiumu ki rok woko ducu, ma gubedo karukune ikare me kwero cola. <verse eid="ISA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 25:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:54">1 Kor 15:54</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:17">Niy 7:17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:4">21:4</ref></char></note>Rwot Lubanga dong bimwonyo to woko matwal, dok en bidunyo pig wang dano woko ducu, ci bikwanyo lewic woko ki iwi jone inyim jo ducu ma iwi lobo; pien man lok ma Rwot aye owaco.<verse eid="ISA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 25:9" />Inino meno kibiwaco ni, “Nen, man aye Lubangawa ma wabedo ka kurune pi larowa. Man aye Rwot ma wabedo ka kuruneni. Wabedu dong ki yomcwiny pi kit ma en olarowa kwede.”<verse eid="ISA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lubanga bipwodo Moab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 25:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 15:1-16:14">Ica 15:1—16:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 48:1-47">Jer 48:1-47</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:8-11">Eje 25:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 2:1-3">Amo 2:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:8-11">Jep 2:8-11</ref></char>
    </note> Cing Rwot bigwoko got Cion, ento Moab mere kibinyono woko piny i kabedone, kit macalo kinyono kwede reng kal i bur ma kionyo iye cet dyang. <verse eid="ISA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 25:11" />Jo Moab biryeyo badgi idyere kit ma dano mo matye ka kwang ryeyo kwede bade me kwang; ento Rwot bimiyo wakegi gik woko kacel ki dito ma gitye kwede. <verse eid="ISA 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 25:12" />Celgi ma gugero ma ocudu malo likungi kibireto woko piny, kibicoro kireto woko piny wa i apwa.<verse eid="ISA 25:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ISA 26" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga bimiyo loc ki jone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 26:1" />Inino meno kibiwero wer man i lobo Juda ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:1">“Watye ki taun madit matek adada!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:1">Lubanga kikome aye ma gwoke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:1">calo cel ma ogure orume woko dyere.<verse eid="ISA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 26:2" />Wuyab dog cel woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:2">wek rok ma kitgi atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:2">ma gigene, gudony iye.<verse eid="ISA 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 26:3" />Ngat ma tame tye ikomi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:3">imiyo en bedo ki kuc me ada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:3">pien nongo en geni.<verse eid="ISA 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 26:4" />Wugen Rwot nakanaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:4">pien Rwot Lubanga aye ma bigwokowa kare ducu.<verse eid="ISA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 26:5" />Pien dong odwoko woko piny</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:5">jo mayam giwake.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:5">Taun madit mayam gibedo iye ma ocudu malo likung en ocoro oreto woko piny i apwa.<verse eid="ISA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 26:6" />Jo mayam kidiyogi piny dong ginyono ki tyen gi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:6">lucan ma onongo piny obwoyogi dong giwoto ki tyen gi iwiye.<verse eid="ISA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 26:7" />Yo pa dano ma kite atir bedo apyel, cere peke iye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:7">in lakite atir aye ma iyubu.<verse eid="ISA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 26:8" />Ai Rwot, wan walubu mitini</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:8">dok waketo genwa ikomi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:8">cwinywa bene mito dworo in keken.<verse eid="ISA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 26:9" />Aparo piri dyewor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:9">tipuna matye iiya puk odiko con ka yenyi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:9">Pien ka ingolo kop i lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:9">ci jo ma bedo iye gipwonyo kit ma atir.<verse eid="ISA 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 26:10" />Dano marac kadi bed kitime gin maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:10">pe twero pwonye me bedo dano ma kite atir;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:10">bedo mere katimo tim mogo ma pe tye atir i lobo pa dano ma cwinygi atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:10">kun pe neno dit pa Rwot.<verse eid="ISA 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 26:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 10:27">Ibru 10:27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ai Rwot, badi tye otinge malo me pwodogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:11">ento lukwori pe gineno.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:11">Mii lewic omakgi, ai Rwot.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:11">Mii gunen kit ma imaro kwede joni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:11">cwal dong mac ma iyubu pi jo macalo meno wek otyekgi woko.<verse eid="ISA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 26:12" />Ai Rwot, ibimiyo wabedo ki kuc,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:12">pien ticwa ducu in aye ma itiyo pirwa.<verse eid="ISA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 26:13" />Ai Rwot Lubangawa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:13">rwodi mukene ma pe in yam guloyowa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:13">ento in keni aye i Rwotwa.<verse eid="ISA 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 26:14" />Gin dong guto woko, pe dok gibibedo kwo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:14">Dong gudoko tipu, pe dok gitwero a malo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:14">pien in imiyo ki gin pwod ci ityekogi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:14">imiyo wi dano bene dong owil woko ikomgi.<verse eid="ISA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 26:15" />Ento dong imiyo rokwa onya, ai Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:15">in dong imiyo rokwa man onya, deyo obed boti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:15">imedo wang lobowa bene odoko malac.<verse eid="ISA 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 26:16" />Ai Rwot, wan wabedo ka legi ikare ma watye i can,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:16">ikare ma iketo can ikomwa, wan wabedo kayenyi.<verse eid="ISA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 26:17" />Wabedo calo dako matye ki arem me nywal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:17">ma twenye atwenya ki koko pi arem ma en tye kwede;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:17">wan bene yam wabedo kitmeno inyimi, ai Rwot.<verse eid="ISA 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 26:18" />Wan wabedo ki arem calo me nywal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:18">ento maka nywalo latin dano pe dong wanywalo gin mo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:18">Pe tye loc mo ma wan waloyo pi lobowa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:18">pe watye ki likwayowa me leyo katyenwa.<verse eid="ISA 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 26:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan 12:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Joni mayam dong guto woko, pud dok gibibedo kwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:19">komgi mutoni dok bicer.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:19">Wun jo ma wubedo i apwa, wuco woko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:19">wek wuwer wer pi yomcwiny!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:19">Macalo toyo aye kweyo lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:19">kitmeno Rwot bimiyo kwo ki jo mayam dong guto woko.<verse eid="ISA 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 26:20" />Wubin, wun jona, wudony i kicikawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:20">ka wulor dogola woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:20">kong wukane kunu pi kare mo manoknok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:20">nio ka akemo pa Rwot dong okato.<verse eid="ISA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 26:21" />Pien nen, Rwot tye kabino kun a ki i kabedone</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:21">pi keto can ikom jo ma bedo i lobo pi balgi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:21">remo ma dong oo i lobo binen woko kamaleng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:21">lobo bene pe dong bikano kom jo ma oto.”<verse eid="ISA 26:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ISA 27" />
  <para style="s1">Laro jo Icrael ki cokogi kacel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 27:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 41:1">Yub 41:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 74:14">Jab 74:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:26">104:26</ref></char>
    </note>Inino meno, Rwot biketo can ikom Leviatan, ma en aye twol ma ngeyo pange tutwal me laro kwone. Rwot biketo can ikome ki twon pala lucwane matek, mabit mada, dok bineko min kulu ma bedo i nam. <verse eid="ISA 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 27:2" />Inino meno, Rwot biwaco ni, “Wuwer wer ikom poto olok ma yomo cwiny, <verse eid="ISA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 27:3" />ma an Rwot aye agwoko; dok aonyo pii iye kare ducu. Agwoko dyeceng ki dyewor, wek ngat mo pe obal woko. <verse eid="ISA 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 27:4" />An pe atye ki akemo ikom poto olok. Ka kono nene okutu ki ocok tye iye, kono acito alwenyo kwedgi, ka awangogi woko ducu liweng. <verse eid="ISA 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 27:5" />Ento ka lukwora gularo bota ni akonygi, ci myero gucike me bedo kweda ki kuc, adada, myero gucike me bedo kweda ki kuc.” <verse eid="ISA 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 27:6" />Ikare ma bino anyim Yakobo bicomo lwite i ngom, Icrael bituru, dok binyak, ci nyige bipongo lobo ducu.<verse eid="ISA 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 27:7" />Rwot mono yam ojwero Icrael woko lirwatrwat kit ma kijwero ki lukworgi mayam gujwero jo Icraeli? Nyo onekogi woko bene kit macalo en oneko ki jo ma onekogi ca? <verse eid="ISA 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 27:8" />Ai Rwot, yam ipwodogi, ka iryemogi woko, kun ikutugi ki yamo dogi me terogi woko cen i opii, kit ma yamo oro kodo kwede. <verse eid="ISA 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 27:9" />Man bimiyo igonyo Yakobo woko ki i bale, dok man aye bibedo adwogi me kwanyo bale; en biloko godi ducu me keno tyer doko calo gweng ma kiodo woko mapwot, kun Acera ma jok ma dako nyo keno tyer me wango odok eceta pe dok bibedo tye ma ocung.<verse eid="ISA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 27:10" />Gang me cel gogo dong kiweko odong obur, kabedone dong kiweko odong nono calo tim ata; roci dyang gicamo lum kunu, gibutu ki kunu kun gijwero pot oboke woko ducu wa ki i jang yadi. <verse eid="ISA 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 27:11" />Ikare ma jang yadi dong otwo woko, ci gicako turune woko; mon tongo woko me yen tedo. Pien gubedo rok ma pe niang, oweko Lubanga ma ocweyogi kica mo pe bimake ikomgi wa ki acel, en pe bitimogi maber.<verse eid="ISA 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 27:12" />Ikare meno Rwot bidino ngano cake ki i kulu Euprate nio kwede wa i kulu me Ejipt; Rwot bicokowu woko kacel wun jo Icrael. <verse eid="ISA 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 27:13" />Dok bene inino meno, kibikutu iye tum madit mada, ka dong bimiyo jo mayam onongo gurwenyo woko i lobo Aciria, ki mukene ma onongo kiryemogi gucito i lobo Ejipt, gibidwogo cen ka woro Rwot iwi gote maleng, i Jerucalem.<verse eid="ISA 27:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ISA 28" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot ociko lutela me lobo Epraim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 28:1" />Ibineno can in lobo Epraim ma itye ki awaka! Deyoni dong tye kaner woko calo lalukana me ature matye iwi lutelani ma gin lumeroni. Gin giwiro wigi ma opong ki awakani ki moo makur ento kadibed kumeno, gin gibutu calo jo ma oto pien gumer woko ki kongo bwino. <verse eid="ISA 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 28:2" />Nen, Rwot tye ki dano mo matek matye ki twero; macalo yamo kot ma kote tye kacwer ki pee, yamo ma balo piny woko abala, dok macalo yamo kot madit tutwal, ma piine mol lak woko ata, en bireto dano woko piny ki tek kitmeno. <verse eid="ISA 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 28:3" />Tok me wake pa lumero me lobo Epraim kibinyono woko piny ki tyen; <verse eid="ISA 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 28:4" />ki ature me deyone mamwonya madani, ma en aye deyo ma ner woko, matye malo inget kulu ma ceko cam tutwal bibedo marom aroma ki nyig oduru mukwongo cek, ma ngolo kare me oro nongo peya oo; dano ka oneno, ruyu camone oyotoyot teke ka oo i cinge.<verse eid="ISA 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 28:5" />Inino meno Rwot me mony bibedo macalo lalukana me deyo maber tutwal bot jone ma gudong. <verse eid="ISA 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 28:6" />En aye bimiyo bot lungolkop cwiny me ngolo kop atir, ci bimiyo keru bot acikari ma gijuku jo ma gioto lweny ikom taun madit.<verse eid="ISA 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Icaya ki lunebi me Juda ma lumero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 28:7" />Ajwaki ki lunebi bene dong gipange apanga ki wot pi kongo bwino makec, gitage ki wot pien gumato kongo bwino makec mada. Wigi dong pe niang ginanyuta ma Lubanga tye ka nyutu botgi maber, oweko pe gingolo kop kakare. <verse eid="ISA 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 28:8" />Wi meja ducu, ka ma gibedo iye, opong ki ngok keken, pe tye kabedo mo maleng ki iwi meja.<verse eid="ISA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 28:9" />Gin giwaco lok i koma ni, “En bipwonyo anga doki? En dok bitito loke bot anga? Bot lutino ma pud kigengogi agenga dot bo? En tamo ni wan wabedo lutino ma pud kikwanyo doggi akwanya ki i dog tunu bo? <verse eid="ISA 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 28:10" />En temo pwonyowa nukuta ki nukuta, tyeng ki tyeng, wi lok ki wi lok.”<verse eid="ISA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 28:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 14:21">1 Kor 14:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ka pe wuromo winyo loka, ci Rwot dong bilok ki wun ki leb pa jo ma dumu aduma, ki leb pa jo ma gin welo. <verse eid="ISA 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 28:12" />Lubanga yam omiyo botwu yweyo, ento wun giwu wukwero winyo loke woko. <verse eid="ISA 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 28:13" />Pimeno Rwot bipwonyowu nukuta ki nukuta, tyeng ki tyeng, wi lok ki wi lok. Wek wudok wupot woko ki tung ngewu, ci wutur woko, kibicikowu ki owic ci kimakwu wudoko mabuc. <verse eid="ISA 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 28:14" />Pimeno wuwiny lok pa Rwot, wun lungala ma wutye kaloyo rok man i Jerucalem! <verse eid="ISA 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 28:15" />Pien wun wuwaco ni dong wutyeko cike woko ki to, dok bene dong wuporo lok woko kacel ki lyel; wugeno atir ni ka can madit tutwal owok ki ikinwu, pe bigudu komwu gire pien dong wuloko goba odoko kalarewu, dok wukane woko ilok ma pe ada. <verse eid="ISA 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 28:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Jab 118:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:33">Rom 9:33</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:1">10:1</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:6">1 Pet 2:6</ref></char></note>Pimeno omiyo Rwot Lubanga owaco ni, “Nen, dong aketo got me wel i Cion got ma kitemo ma okati woko dong maber, ma en aye bibedo acaki me teguti; ngat ma ye pe bibedo ki lworo mo ma bange woko. <verse eid="ISA 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 28:17" />Abiloko ngolo kop atir doko tol me pimo ot, kun kit ma atir bedo birigi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 28:17">Pee bimolo kalarewu ma opong ki gobani woko, pii bene bipong woko libyeny i kakanewu. <verse eid="ISA 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 28:18" />Meno bimiyo cikewu ma wucike ki to tur woko, ki lok ma wuporo kacel ki lyel bene pe bicung; dok ka can madit biwok ki ikinwu, can meno bigoyowu bimiyo wupwode piny lirat. <verse eid="ISA 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 28:19" />Kare ducu ma can meno biwok ki ikinwu, ci bigoyowu, pien biwok dyeceng ki dyewor nino ki nino; dong niang ilok meno bikelo lworo madit tutwal. <verse eid="ISA 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 28:20" />Pien bibedo rom ki dano ma otemo butu i kitanda macek, kun ume ki gium ma pe rome kadi ki acel. <verse eid="ISA 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 28:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 10:10-12">Yoc 10:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 5:20">2 Cam 5:20</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 14:11">1 Tek 14:11</ref></char></note>Pien Rwot bia malo macalo yam kong otimo iwi got Perajim, akemo bimake kit macalo yam kong omake kwede i lung me Gibeon, pi cobo tice, ento tice dok pat tutwal ba! Pi cobo tice ento tice ma okani!<verse eid="ISA 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 28:22" />Kombedi dong wuwek ngala obedi, wek pe gitwewu dok matek tutwal; pien awinyo ka Rwot Lubanga me mony ociko pi tyeko lobo woko ducu.<verse eid="ISA 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 28:23" />Wucik itwu, wuwiny dwona; wuter itwu, wuwiny loka. <verse eid="ISA 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 28:24" />Ngat ma puru potone me coyo iye kodi, bedo ka purune nakanaka ma pe giko purune bo? Itamo ni en bedo ka boto poto ki lokone nakanaka? <verse eid="ISA 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 28:25" />Itamo ni ka dong otyeko tengone maber, ci pe en coyo iye toki, okwer, ka dok pito iye ngano i tyeng, ki cayiri bene kakare, malube ki wanga cor me potone? <verse eid="ISA 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 28:26" />Pien Lubangane pwonye maber, kun niange bene maber kit ma myero en otii kwede. <verse eid="ISA 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 28:27" />Toki mere pe kidino ki yat me dino bel, okwer bene pe kiloro tyen gadigadi iye; toki gire kitengo atenga ki odoo, ento okwer kityero atyera ki kidi me tyerone. <verse eid="ISA 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 28:28" />Kal kwon bene kidino adina, ento pe kidino matek tutwal ma kityero nyige woko. Aguragura ywayo tyen gadigadi wok ki iye, ento pe tyero nyige gire. <verse eid="ISA 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 28:29" />Man ducu oa ki bot Rwot me mony, en Rwot ma kiuru imiyo tam, dok ryekone dit ma pe wace.<verse eid="ISA 28:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="ISA 29" />
  <para style="s1">Gin ma bitime ikom Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 29:1" />Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Jerucalem, Jerucalem, can madit tye kabino ikomi! Jerucalem aye taun madit ma onongo Daudi oguru kemane iyeni. Kong wumede ki kwero karamawu pi mwaka aryo nyo adek mo. <verse eid="ISA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 29:2" />Ento abimiyo Jerucalem neno can; koko ki kumu madwong bibedo tye iye, ikare ma abiloko en doko calo keno me wango gitum awanga. <verse eid="ISA 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 29:3" />Abiguru kemana ingeti kun arumi woko dyere, abirumi woko ki lubele ma gucudu malo likung, abitoro lobo abako inyimi calo cel. <verse eid="ISA 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 29:4" />Abidwoki piny ite lobo, ibilok ki piny i apwa, dwoni bikati ki ite lobo calo dwon jok, ki loki biwinye liwewe kun kati ki i apwa.<verse eid="ISA 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 29:5" />Jerucalem, lukwori bibedo mapol calo apwa, gin jo ma kica pe i cwinygi, ento gibedo calo cung kal ma yamo tero. Ikare meno cutcut, <verse eid="ISA 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 29:6" />aye Rwot me mony bilari, kun miyo kot mor mwoc atata, oyengyeng bedo tye ki woo bene bedo dit, ki yamo lapiru, yamo kot, kacel ki mac mager tutwal. <verse eid="ISA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 29:7" />Lwak mony me rok mapatpat ma obake lipim ma lwenyo ikom jo Ariel, ki jo ducu ma gilwenyo ikomgi ki ikom kabedo maleng pa Lubanga, gin ducu gibidoko calo lek, onyo gin ma kineno i dyewor. <verse eid="ISA 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 29:8" />Kit macalo dano ma kec neko leko ni etye ka cam, ci cutcut coo woko ma nongo iye nono, nyo macalo dano ma orwo pii oketo woko leko ni etye kamato pii, cutcut coo woko ma nongo orwo pii tye ka neke matek, kun mito mato pii; lwak rok ducu ma lwenyo ikom got Cion bene gibibedo kitmeno.”<verse eid="ISA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael gukwero winyo juk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 29:9" />Wubange giwu kekenwu wek wubed luming, wubo wangwu woko kekenwu wek wubed lutowang! Wumer, labongo mato kongo bwino mo; wupange apanga ki wot labongo kongo mo ma wumato! <verse eid="ISA 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 29:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:8">Rom 11:8</ref></char></note>Pien Rwot dong oonyo ikomwu cwiny me nino matek; omiyo wangwu woko. Lunebi aye myero obed wangwu, ento Lubanga ocido wanggi woko.<verse eid="ISA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 29:11" />Gin ma Lubanga nyutu bot lunebi ducu dong odoko calo buk ma kimwono doge woko ki tung botwu, ma ka kimiyo bot dano mo ma ngeyo kwan kun kiwace ni, “Bin ikwan man,” ci en bigamo ni, “Pe atwero kwanone pien kimwono doge woko.” <verse eid="ISA 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 29:12" />Dok bene ka kimiyo bot ngat ma kwiya kwan, kun kiwace ni, “Bin ikwan man,” en gamo ni, “Pe angeyo kwan.”<verse eid="ISA 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 29:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 15:8-9">Mat 15:8-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 7:6-7">Mar 7:6-7</ref></char>
    </note> Rwot owaco ni, “Rok man giwaco ni giwora, kara giwora ki doggi nono, giketo deyo ikoma bene ki doggi nono, cwinygi pe tye ikoma wa ki acel, lworo ma gilwora kwedeni meno cik pa dano ma kipwonyogi kwede. <verse eid="ISA 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 29:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:19">1 Kor 1:19</ref></char></note>Pimeno, dok abitimo gin me aura ikom rok man, gin me aura dok me tango tutwal; mamiyo ryeko rwenyo woko ki bot jo maryek, ki ngecgi ma gitye kwede bidoko gin ma konye peke.”<verse eid="ISA 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gen matye pi kwo me anyim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 29:15" />Jo ma kano tamgi woko ki bot Rwot kamatut, ki jo ma tiyo ticgi ka macol, gibineno can, ki jo ma giwaco ni, “Anga kono ma nenowa? Anga kono ma ngeyowa?” <verse eid="ISA 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 29:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:9">Ica 45:9</ref></char></note>Kong wunen kit ma wun wuloko kwede kilong! Itamo ni kitwero poro lacwe agulu ki lobo agulu ma en cweyo? Itamo ni gin ma kicweyo acweya twero waco ki ngat ma ocweye ni, “In aye pe icweya?” Nyo gin ma kicweyo twero waco ki ngat ma ocweye ni, “In pe ingeyo gin mo?”<verse eid="ISA 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 29:17" />Odong kare manok tutwal Lebanon bidoko poto ma ceko cam mabup mada, kun poto mayam ceko cam mabup tutwali dong oloke odoko bunga.<verse eid="ISA 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 29:18" />Inino meno jo ma itgi oding gibiwinyo lok ma kikwano ki i buk, lutowang bene wanggi biyabe, kun gia woko ki i mutu ki i colpiny. <verse eid="ISA 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 29:19" />Jo mamwol dok gibinongo yomcwiny i Rwot, lucan bene gibibedo ki yomcwiny i Ngat Maleng me Icrael. <verse eid="ISA 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 29:20" />Pien jo ma pe ki kica dong bibedo peke, jo ma gin lungala bene gibitum woko, lulib dano dyewor me timo tim maracu kibityekogi woko liweng. <verse eid="ISA 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 29:21" />Lubanga bityeko jo mamiyo kop loyo dano pi lokgi, ma giciko owic pi ngat ma jukugi ki i kabedo me ngolo kop, ma giwaco goba wek lok oloo ngat ma kite atir.<verse eid="ISA 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 29:22" />Ma omiyo Rwot, mayam olaro Abraim, oloko lok ikom ot pa Yakobo ni, “Lewic pe dok bimako Yakobo, wange bene pe dok bibale. <verse eid="ISA 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 29:23" />Pien ka wubineno lutino, ma an abimiyowu gitye botwu, ci wubimiyo nyinga bedo me awora; kibingeyo atir ni Ngat Maleng pa Yakobo gire leng, ci gibibedo ki lworo ikom Lubanga me Icrael. <verse eid="ISA 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 29:24" />Jo ma ngak woko ki i cwinygi biniang, ki jo ma bedo ka ngur angura bene biye ni kipwonygi.”<verse eid="ISA 29:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="ISA 30" />
  <para style="s1">Ribe ki jo Ejipt konye peke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 30:1" />Rwot owaco ni, “Lutino ma lujemo gibineno can, jo ma tiyo ki tamgi, ma pe mera; dok ma giribe ki rok mukene ento pe i mitina, me medo bal ikom bal, <verse eid="ISA 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 30:2" />ma gicako wotgi me cito i Ejipt labongo penyo kong tam ki bota, pi laro bot Parao ni ogwokgi, dok pi yenyo ka kane ite tipu pa jo Ejipt! <verse eid="ISA 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 30:3" />Pimeno kagwokewu ki bot Parao bimiyowu lewic, dok tipu me kakanewu i Ejipt bimiyo alee twodowu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:3 </char><char style="fk">Alee twodowu </char> te loke lewic omakowu. </note> woko. <verse eid="ISA 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 30:4" />Pien kadi bed luditone tye i Joan, dok lukwenane o wa i Kanec, <verse eid="ISA 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 30:5" />ngat acel acel lewic bimako, pi rok ma pe twero konyogi, ma pe gunongo iye kit kony mo kadi gin mo maber, ento gunongo lewic ki cac keken.”<verse eid="ISA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 30:6" />Man lok ma Lubanga oloko ikom lee me Negeb. En owaco ni, “I dye lobo matye iye ayelayela madit ki can mapek, kama min labwor ki twon labwor gia iye, twol ororo ki twol lacocodo tye iye, gin gutingo lwak lonyogi madwong adada inge lwak kana, ki lim akanagi ikom aruk pa kinaga, kun gitero bot rok ma pe twero konyogi. <verse eid="ISA 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 30:7" />Pien kony ma Ejipt miyo konye peke, dok gin mo maber peke iye; ma omiyo acako nyinge ni, ‘Rakab ma bedo abeda labongo timo gin mo.’<verse eid="ISA 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 30:8" />Kombedi dong icit; igor coc inyimgi ikom got ma apada, ka dok bene ico i buk, wek kigwok obed tye pi kare me anyim, macalo caden ma bedo nakanaka. <verse eid="ISA 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 30:9" />Pien gin gubedo lujemo ma lugoba, lutino ma kwero winyo lok pa Rwot; <verse eid="ISA 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 30:10" />ma giwaco bot lunenpiny ni, ‘Pe wunen piny.’ Ki bot lunebi giwaco ni, ‘Pe wutit botwa lok matye atir; ento wutit botwa lok ma wamito winyone keken, wutit lok me goba keken. <verse eid="ISA 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 30:11" />Wungak woko, wuwek gengo yowa, wek pe wamede ki winyo lok mo pi Ngat Maleng me Icrael.’ <verse eid="ISA 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 30:12" />Meno omiyo Ngat Maleng me Icrael owaco ni, ‘Pien wun dong wucayo lok man, ento wuketo genwu i unu dano ki bwologi, kun wujenge ikom timwu meno ma wutimo; <verse eid="ISA 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 30:13" />meno bimiyo balwu man bedo i komwu, macalo cel ma ocudu malo likung ma obar woko dok cok muk me poto woko piny, ma muk woko lipuny oyotoyot. <verse eid="ISA 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 30:14" />Muke bedo rom ki muk pa agulu ma kicweyo, ma kingido woko labongo kica mo, kun otakone mo peke ma dong ma kitwero tic kwede me karo mac ki i keno, onyo maromo twomo pii ki i joro.’”<verse eid="ISA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 30:15" />Man aye lok ma Rwot Lubanga owaco, ma en aye Ngat Maleng me Icrael. “Wudwog cen, wubed mot, wek wulare; ka wubedo mot ki gen, wubinongo teko.” Ento wun ceng wukwero woko, <verse eid="ISA 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 30:16" />kun wuwaco ni, “Pe, wan giwa wabiringo woko ki aguragura, wa biringo oyotoyot adada.” Dok ni, “Wabiringo madwir tutwal.” Pimeno jo ma ryemo korwu bibedo jo madwir adada. <verse eid="ISA 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 30:17" />Jo alip kulu biringo pi lworo dano acel keken, wun wubiringo pi lworo lukwor abic keken, nio wang ma wudong calo yat bendera matye iwi got, calo bendera matye iwi cere malo. <verse eid="ISA 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 30:18" />Kadi bed kumeno, Rwot tye ka kuruwu me nyutu bere botwu; en oyube pi timowu kica. Pien Rwot aye Lubanga ma ngolo kop atir, jo ducu ma gibedo kun gigeno en gitye ki gum.<verse eid="ISA 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot ocike me miyo gum bot jone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 30:19" />Adada wun jo Cion, wun jo ma wubedo i Jerucalem, pe dong wubikok matwal. Rwot bitimowu kica kace wukok bote; ka owinyo kokowu, ci en bigamo dogwu. <verse eid="ISA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 30:20" />Rwot bimiyo wuwok ikare marac me aroma, ento en kikome bibedo tye ikinwu kapwonyowu, pe dok wubiyenye ento wubibedo kanene ki wangwu. <verse eid="ISA 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 30:21" />Kace onongo wungak woko ki i yo wudok tung acuc onyo tung acam, ci wubiwinyo dwon ki tung ngewu, ma waco ni, “Yo ene, wulubi.” <verse eid="ISA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 30:22" />Ka dok wubicako balo cal jogiwu ma kipayo apaya ma wudeyo komgi ki ryal, kacel ki calwu ma kiliyo aliya, ma wudeyo komgi ki jabu, wubibologi woko calo gubedo gin me kwer, kun wuwaco ni, “Wudire cen!”<verse eid="ISA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 30:23" />Ci Rwot bimiyo kot cwer botwu pi kodi ma dong wucoyo i poti ki pi cam matye kacek i poti, bimiyo camwu cek maber dok mabup tutwal. Ikare meno dyangiwu bibedo kacam i bar olet malac; <verse eid="ISA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 30:24" />ci bimiyo twoniwu ki kanawu ma gipuru bicamo cam ma kirubu ki kado, ma kipyeto woko ki odero. <verse eid="ISA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 30:25" />Inino meno ma kibimuku gogo pa merokwu woko ki neko danogi matek, pii ma mol bibedo tye iwi godi ducu ki iwi cere ducu. <verse eid="ISA 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 30:26" />Dok bene dwe biryeny maleng tutwal kun caro piny calo ceng maryeny, kun nongo ceng biryeny maleng tyen abiro kulu. Meno aye nino ma Rwot bitweyo iye wang ret pa jone, ki cango wang bur ma en kikome aye oketo rete ikom jone.<verse eid="ISA 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot bipwodo jo Aciria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 30:27" />Nen, twero ki deyo pa Rwot bino kun a ki kamabor, kun kinigane tye kawang calo mac, ma yitone ocido licuc duny cito malo ma ocule woko liking; kun kiniga opongo doge woko, ki lebe bene calo mac matye kawango piny, kun wango jami woko ducu liweng. <verse eid="ISA 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 30:28" />Aluu doge calo kulu ma piine opong libyeny ma mol atata liyakyak, ma mwonyo dano o wa ingute. Rwot yeko rok ki odero me to, dok keto gin mabitogi i doggi wek otergi ito.<verse eid="ISA 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 30:29" />Ento wun jo pa Rwot, wubibedo kawero wer macalo wuwero i dyewor me kwero nino madit pa Rwot; cwinywu bene bibedo yom, calo ngat ma woto lubu dwon nyamulere ma ki tye kakutu, kun woto cito iwi got pa Rwot, bot ngat ma obedo got pa jo Icrael. <verse eid="ISA 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 30:30" />Rwot bilok ci miyo dwone me deyo winye, dok bene bimiyo bade nen ma en oryeyo okemo piny me pwodogi, kun tye ki akemo mo madit ma pe wace, ki leb mac ma wango piny woko ducu, kacel ki kot ma mwoc kun cwer core piny ki pee. <verse eid="ISA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 30:31" />Lworo madit mada bimako jo Aciria, kace guwinyo dwon Rwot, kun en goyogi ki odoone. <verse eid="ISA 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 30:32" />Ka Rwot goyogi teretere, nongo jone tye ka wer kun gigoyo ajaa ki opuk. Rwot kikome aye bilwenyo ki jo Aciria. <verse eid="ISA 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 30:33" />Pien dong kityeko yubune woko wacon; kama mac biwango rwot me Aciria iye. Kityeko yubune woko matut dok malac tutwal, ma mac ki yen bene tye madwong ata iye. Aluu dog Rwot bikati calo mac gweng calfa ma kiliyo, en aye bimoko mace.<verse eid="ISA 30:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="ISA 31" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga bigwoko Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 31:1" />Can iwi jo ma gicito i Ejipt kayenyo kony, ma giketo gen gi ikom aguragura, ki ikom gadigadi me lweny, ni pien gipol, ki ikom wegi aguragura, pien gitek tutwal, ento pe gitingo wanggi malo gineno Ngat Maleng me Icrael, kadi ki penyo tam ki bot Rwot. <verse eid="ISA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 31:2" />Ento kono en ryek, dok kelo can marac tutwal ikom dano, pe dok dwoko lok ma en oloko cen. En bia malo ikom jo me odi pa lutim tim maracu, ki ikom jo ma gikonyo lutim bal. <verse eid="ISA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 31:3" />Jo Ejipt mere gin dano adana, pe gubedo Lubanga; aguraguragi bene gubedo kom mamwa, pe gin cwiny. Ka Rwot oryeyo bade me pwodogi, ci ngat mamiyo kony bipange litamtam, ki ngat ma kikonyo bipoto woko piny, gin ducu gibito kacel ci gitum woko. <verse eid="ISA 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 31:4" />Pien Rwot owaco bota kit man ni, “Kit ma labwor nyo latin labwor mor kwede ikom lee ma en omako, ma kadi ilwong lwak lukwat mapol ka lweny ikome, kome pe myel ka owinyo dwongi dok bene lworo pe mako kadi giwoo matek tutwal, meno aye kit ma Rwot me mony bibino kwede piny ka lweny ikom got Cion ki ikom cerene ducu. <verse eid="ISA 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 31:5" />Rwot me mony bigwoko Jerucalem, kit macalo winyo lwore kwede me gwoko lutinone, en bigwoko dok bene bilaro Jerucalem, miyo en bwot.<verse eid="ISA 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 31:6" />Wun jo Icrael myero wuloke wudok cen bot ngat ma wujemo ikome magwa tutwali. <verse eid="ISA 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 31:7" />Pien inino meno dano acel acel bibolo cal jogine me ryal woko kacel ki cal jogine me jabu ma onongo wutimo bal pi tiyogi ki cingwuni. <verse eid="ISA 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 31:8" />Kibineko jo Aciria woko ki i lweny ento pe ki kero pa dano; pala lucwan ma pe pala pa dano bijwerogi woko lirwatrwat; gibiringo woko pi lworo pala lucwan, gibidiyo awobegi tektek me tiyo tic muroni mapek. <verse eid="ISA 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 31:9" />Lworo bimiyo oteka lwenygi mateki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:9 </char><char style="fk">Oteka lwenygi mateki </char> jo mukene giwaco ni, “Gotgi mateki,” rweny woko pi lworo. </note> ringo woko, myelkom bene biweko luditogi bolo bendera me lwenygi woko.” Rwot ma kiworo i Cion, ki ma keno tyere otwak ki mac i Jerucalem aye ma owaco.<verse eid="ISA 31:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="ISA 32" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot ma kite atir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 32:1" />Nen, kare bibino ma rwot biloyo loc ki kit ma atir, rwodine bene gibibedo i loc kun gingolo kop atir. <verse eid="ISA 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 32:2" />Ngat acel acel bibedo macalo kagwoke ka yamo tye, dok macalo kagwoke ka kot ocore piny. Gin bibedo macalo kulu mapol ma piigi mol i kabedo mutwo, dok macalo tipu got mo madit matye i tim aroo. <verse eid="ISA 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 32:3" />Wanggi ki itgi bibedo twolo me neno ki me winyo gin ma dano mito. <verse eid="ISA 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 32:4" />Gin pe gibitimo jami pi aruya, ento gibitic kiniang ki ngec maber, dok gibiloko lok atir labongo peko mo. <verse eid="ISA 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 32:5" />Ngat maming pe kibilwonge ni dano me awora, ngat ma kite rac bene pe kibilwongo ni twon oteka. <verse eid="ISA 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 32:6" />Pien laming mere loko lok me mingo, tame tye me timo bal keken; gin ma en timo ducu pe yomo cwiny Lubanga, loko lok marac ikom Rwot; en dok medo kec ameda bot jo ma kec dong nekogi, dok twono jo ma orwo pii nekogi pii me amata. <verse eid="ISA 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 32:7" />Dano ma kite rac, nongo time bene rac; en miyo tam me timo gin maracu, me balo lucan woko ki loko lok goba kadi bed lok pa ngat ma can odiyoni tye kakare. <verse eid="ISA 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 32:8" />Ento dano me awora kelo tam ma jo mukene woro bene, en cung mere ikit me woro keken.<verse eid="ISA 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngolo kop ki roco Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 32:9" />Wua malo, wun mon ma wutye ki kuc, wuwiny loka; wuter itwu, wuwiny lok ma awaco, wun anyira ma pe wuparo gin moni. <verse eid="ISA 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 32:10" />Odong kare matidi mo pe dong romo mwaka acel, komwu bibedo ka po apoya, wun mon ma pe wuparo gin moni; pien nyig olok bibedo peke, dok bene pe kibipwono nyig yadi. <verse eid="ISA 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 32:11" />Wubed ki myelkom wun mon ma wutye ki kuc, komwu bene myero obed ka po apoya, wun ma pe wuparo gin moni; wugony bongi woko ki ikomwu, wutwe bongo cola i pyerwu. <verse eid="ISA 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 32:12" />Wudong korwu pi potiwu ma yomo cwinywu, ki pi olok ma nyak matek tutwali, <verse eid="ISA 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 32:13" />pi lobo pa jona, ma okutu ki ocok bidongo iye; ki pi odi ducu ma gitye i taun madit ma dano tye iye ki yomcwiny madwong. <verse eid="ISA 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 32:14" />Pien rwot bia woko ki i ode, taun madit ma dano pol iye bene bidong nongo; got Opel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:14 </char><char style="fk">Opel </char> aye nying kabedo ma ocudu lamal loyo ki i Jerucalem. </note> ki lubele ma ocudu malo likung me ngiyo piny bidoko boro matwal; kana me tim cwinygi bibedo yom pirgi, bidoko kama kikwayo iye romi ki dyegi.<verse eid="ISA 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 32:15" />Man bitime nio wang ma Lubanga oonyo Cwiny ma mere ikomwa kun a ki malo, ma nongo tim bene dong odoko poto ma ceko cam mabup tutwal, kun poto mayam ceko cam dong oloke odoko bunga. <verse eid="ISA 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 32:16" />Ikare meno ngolo kop atir bibedo i tim, kit ma atir bibedo mere i poto ma ceko cam. <verse eid="ISA 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 32:17" />Kit ma atir bikelo kuc, dok bikelo bene bedo mot ki gen ma bedo nakanaka. <verse eid="ISA 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 32:18" />Jona bibedo i kabedo me kuc, kama ayelayela mo peke iye, kabedo maber me yweyo mot. <verse eid="ISA 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 32:19" />Pee bicore, miyo bunga ducu lwer o woko piny, ki taun madit bene kibicoro woko piny lirumrum. <verse eid="ISA 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 32:20" />Wubibedo ki yomcwiny, wun jo ma coyo kodi i dog kulu ducu, wun ma miyo twoni ki kana giwoto ata.<verse eid="ISA 32:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="ISA 33" />
  <para style="s1">Lega pi kony</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 33:1" />Ibineno can, in ngat ma ineko dano, ma kun in kikomi pe kineki, in ngat ma doto dano, kun ngat mo pud peya oketo lok roro ikomi. Ka dong iweko neko dano woko, in bene dong kibijweri woko; ki ka dong iweko tim me doto dano woko, in bene dong kibiketo lok roro ikomi. <verse eid="ISA 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 33:2" />Ai Rwot, timwa kica, pien genwa tye ikomi. Gwokwa nino ki nino, ci ilarwa ikare ma watye i can. <verse eid="ISA 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 33:3" />Rok mukene giringo woko ka guwinyo bwaroni; ka in ia malo ka lweny pirwa, lurok giket woko atata. <verse eid="ISA 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 33:4" />Ci kiyako jamigi woko calo okwil ma camo cam ma i poto; ma gipye apyeya iye, gilaro jamigi calo bonyo. <verse eid="ISA 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 33:5" />Rwot dit adada, en bedo malo, dok loyo jami ducu; en bimiyo jo Cion ducu ngolo kop atir, kun kitgi bene bedo atir. <verse eid="ISA 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 33:6" />Ikarewu en bimiyo wucung matek, dok bilarowu, ci miyo ki wun ryeko ki ngec madit; dong lonyowu madit en aye me lworo Rwot.<verse eid="ISA 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 33:7" />Kong wuwiny kit ma jo ma gitek i lweny gikok kwede pi kony i gudu! Dok lukwena me kuc bene gikok ki cwercwiny ma pe wace! <verse eid="ISA 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 33:8" />Yoo gudu ducu dong gudong nongo, dano mo ma wote iye dong peke. Nen, gicike dong kituru woko, caden ducu dong kicayogi acaya, pe dong gitye ki woro pi dano. <verse eid="ISA 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 33:9" />Lobo dong obale woko; alee bene otwodo Lebanon, tekone bene tye karwenyo woko. Caron dong odoko calo tim aroo; Bacan ki Karmel pot yadigi dong tye ka o woko aoya piny. <verse eid="ISA 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 33:10" />Rwot owaco ni, “Kombedi dong abia woko, abitinge malo; dong abinyutu dit me twerona. <verse eid="ISA 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 33:11" />Wuyubu yub ma konygi peke ki jami ducu ma wutimo konygi peke. Aluu yweyowu aye bidoko mac ma biwangowu. <verse eid="ISA 33:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 33:12" />Rok ducu bidoko calo buru mac ma odong ka mac oto, macalo okutu ma kitongo ka dong kiwango i mac.” <verse eid="ISA 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 33:13" />Wun jo ma wutye kamabor wuwiny gin ma dong atimo, ki wun jo ma wutye cok, myero wunge twero ma atye kwede.<verse eid="ISA 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 33:14" />Lubalo matye i Cion dong lworo omakogi woko, jo ma kwero Lubanga komgi dong myel amyela. Gin giwaco ni, “Ngolo kop pa Lubanga obedo calo mac matye kawang ma pe gik. Anga ikinwa matwero bedo inget mac ma lyel nakanaka ma pe to?” <verse eid="ISA 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 33:15" />Ngat ma twero bwot aye ngat ma kite atir inyim Lubanga ma loko lok ada, ma cwinye tye atir, ma cwinye dag lonyo ma kinongo pi unu dano, ma bene pe ye gamo lim me camcana, ma kwero tim me neko dano, dok ma kwero tim maracu ducu. <verse eid="ISA 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 33:16" />En bibedo i kabedo ma malo kamabor; ka gwokene bibedo i cel gogo ma iwi got; kibimiye came, wa ki pii amatane bene pe bijwik.<verse eid="ISA 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Deyo ma bibino anyim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 33:17" />Wubineno rwot ki wangwu i deyone; wubineno lobo ma oyare malac wa kamabor. <verse eid="ISA 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 33:18" />Wubibedo ki lwod ikom gin ma okato angec ki lworo madit tutwal kun wuwaco ni, “Lakwan wel kono tye kwene? Dano ma kiculu mucoro bote kono tye kwene? Lakwan lubele ma gucudu malo likungi kono tye kwene?” <verse eid="ISA 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 33:19" />Pe dok wubineno rok ma lungala, rok maloko leb mapat atika, ma pe wuniang i gin ma giloko, ma gidumu leb ma niang iye tek. <verse eid="ISA 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 33:20" />Kong wunen Cion, taun madit ma wukwero iye ninowu madito ma kiciko! Wubineno Jerucalem ki wangwu, ma en taun madit ma oling mot calo kema ma pe kikobo ki kakare, ma teke ma kiguro kwede pe kiputu, dok tole bene pe cot. <verse eid="ISA 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 33:21" />Ento Rwot binyutu deyone kunu, kama kulu madongo ki matinone tye iye, kama mel ma kikwango ki pol pe twero oo iye, ki yeya me deyo mo bene pe oo iye. <verse eid="ISA 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 33:22" />Pien Rwot aye langolkopwa, en lalocwa, ki Rwot aye lakerwa, en bilarowa.<verse eid="ISA 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 33:23" />Tol yeyawu ogony woko; pe mako te yat cung matek i kabedone, pe bene kitwero yaro bongo iye wek yamo okol. Ikare meno jami ayaka bibedo ma obake ata lipim ma dano bipoko ikin gi; kadi wa lungolo bene gibinongo jami mogo olo twal. <verse eid="ISA 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 33:24" />Pe tye dano mo ma bedo i lobowa ma biwaco ni, “An koma lit.” Jo ma bedo iye ducu kibitimo botgi kica pi balgi.<verse eid="ISA 33:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="ISA 34" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot bipwodo lukwore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 34:1" />Wubin wunyik cok, wun rok ducu wek wucik itwu wuwiny! Jo ducu ma bedo i lobo myero gubin guwiny. <verse eid="ISA 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 34:2" />Pien akemo dong omako Rwot ikom rok ducu, kiniga okete woko adada ikom monygi, en dong otenyogi wek kijwergi woko. <verse eid="ISA 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 34:3" />Kom danogi ma dong kineko kibibolo woko ata, ngwec komgi biduny mangwe, remogi bene bimol iwi godi. <verse eid="ISA 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 34:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:29">Mat 24:29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:25">Mar 13:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:26">Luk 21:26</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:13-14">Niy 6:13-14</ref></char></note> Jami ducu ma i polo bitop woko, polo bidole woko calo buk adola. Monygi ducu bipoto woko piny, kit ma pot olok o kwede piny, kit ma pot oduru poto kwede piny ki iwi jange.<verse eid="ISA 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 34:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 63:1-6">Ica 63:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:7-22">Jer 49:7-22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:12-14">Eje 25:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 35:1-15">35:1-15</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:11-12">Amo 1:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:1-14">Oba 1-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:2-5">Mal 1:2-5</ref></char>
    </note>Pien Rwot dong oyubu pala lucwane woko ki i polo, me bino ka lweny kwede ikom jo Edom, ikom jo ma dong en omiyogi me aneka. <verse eid="ISA 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 34:6" />Pala lucwane bipuune ki remo i lake, moo dwolo bene dong bidyako kome woko liweng, calo remo romi ki remo dyegi, ki moo dwolo olang pa nyogi romi ma kityero. Pien Rwot bityero gitum i Bojra, dok bineko dano matek i lobo Edom. <verse eid="ISA 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 34:7" />Dano bitinge poto piny libut calo twoni jubi. Lobogi bipong ki remo ma mol liyakyak, dok moo dwolo bimiyo lobogi bedo ma miu adada. <verse eid="ISA 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 34:8" />Pien Rwot tye ki nino me culu kwor, tye bene ki mwaka me koko Cion ki bot lukwore.<verse eid="ISA 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 34:9" />Kulu ducu me Edom biloke doko calo odok lam, lobone bene bidoko calo gweng calfa, dong lobo maca ducu bidoko calo odok lam matye kawang. <verse eid="ISA 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 34:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:11">Niy 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:3">19:3</ref></char></note>Mac bilyel dyeceng ki dyewor benebene ma pe to, yitone biduny ma ocido cito malo litu nakanaka. Ikare pa yalwak ducu lobo bidong nono, dano mo peke ma biwok ki iye matwal. <verse eid="ISA 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 34:11" />Olwit ki coo aye bileyo ci doko meggi, dok tula ki agak bene gibibedo iye. Rwot bityeko lobone woko ci bidong obur. <verse eid="ISA 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 34:12" />Kibilwongo nyinge ni, “Ker peke kunu,” ki luloc ki luker madito bibedo peke iye. <verse eid="ISA 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 34:13" />Okutu bidongo iwi odine madito, ayila ki ocok bidongo i gang gogone, too ki udu gibibedo iye. <verse eid="ISA 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 34:14" />Lee me tim birwate ki lalur, jogi ma obedo calo nyogi oyima bikok bot luwotgi, jok ma dako ma woto dyewor keken bicito kayenyo kayweyo kunu. <verse eid="ISA 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 34:15" />Tula bigero ode kunu, ci bibolo iye tonge, dok bitoko lutinone bene ki kunu, ka coko lutinone woko ite bwome. Okwateng bene bicoke kunu, kun acel acel ki ikin gi tye ki cware.<verse eid="ISA 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 34:16" />Kong wuyeny ci wukwan ki i buk pa Rwot. Pe tye mo acel ki ikin gi ma birwenyo, pe tye mo ma bibedo kene labongo cware. Pien Rwot dong ociko ni obed kitmeno, en kikome aye bicokogi kacel. <verse eid="ISA 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 34:17" />En obolo kwir pirgi, en kikome aye ma opoko botgi lobo kun pimo ki tol. Dong bibedo meggi matwal, gibibedo iye ikare pa yalwak ducu.<verse eid="ISA 34:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="ISA 35" />
  <para style="s1">Dwogo pa jo pa Lubanga i Cion</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 35:1" />Lobo mutwo kacel ki tim bibedo ki yomcwiny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:1">ature bituru iye calo lenga.<verse eid="ISA 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 35:2" />Ature bituru iye ki yomcwiny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:2">kun giwero wer ki yomcwiny madwong tutwal;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:2">deyone bene bibedo dit mada calo got me Lebanon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:2">bibedo ma mwonya tutwal calo poti me Karmel ki Caron.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:2">Gibineno deyo pa Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:2">ki twero ma Lubangawa tye kwede.<verse eid="ISA 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 35:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 12:12">Ibru 12:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Wujing cing jo ma badgi okwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:3">wumii jo ma conggi goro odok matek.<verse eid="ISA 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 35:4" />Wuwac bot jo matye ki lworo i cwinygi ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:4">“Pe wubed lwor, wubed tek!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:4">Nen, Lubangawa bikokowu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:4">en biculu kwor ikom lukworwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:4">En bibino ci larowu.”<verse eid="ISA 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 35:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:5">Mat 11:5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:22">Luk 7:22</ref></char>
    </note>Ikare meno lutowang wanggi biyabe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:5">jo ma itgi oding bene itgi biyabe.<verse eid="ISA 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 35:6" />Ikare meno lungolo bipye malo calo til,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:6">ki jo ma te lebgi oto gibicako wero wer ki yomcwiny.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:6">Pien pii bimwoco piny woko idye tim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:6">ki kulu bene piine bibedo ka mol i lobo mutwo;<verse eid="ISA 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 35:7" />kweyo ma otwo bidoko kut ma pong ki pii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:7">pii bibedo ka gunye atata i lobo mutwo likang.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:7">Lum ki lagada bidongo madwong tutwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:7">i kabedo mayam too aye bedo iye.<verse eid="ISA 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 35:8" />Yoo gudu madit bibedo kunu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:8">yoo ma kibicako nyinge ni, “Yoo Maleng.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:8">Jo ma gin lubalo pe gibilubu yoo meno,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:8">jo ducu ma bilubu yoo meno, kadi wa jo maming bene pe birwenyo.<verse eid="ISA 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 35:9" />Labwor mo pe bibedo kunu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:9">lee mo mager bene pe bicito kunu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:9">pe tye lee mo ma ger ma kibinongo kunu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:9">ento jo ma dong kikokogi aye bilubu yoo meno.<verse eid="ISA 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 35:10" />Jo ma Rwot okokogi bidwogo cen i Cion,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:10">gibibino ma nongo giwero wer licur.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:10">Yomcwiny ma rii nakanaka pe birwenyo ki iwigi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:10">gibibedo maber ki yomcwiny madwong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:10">ci cwercwiny ki cur mayam gubedo kwede dong bia woko ki i cwinygi.<verse eid="ISA 35:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="ISA 36" />
  <para style="s1">Jo Aciria guywayo mony ikom Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 18:13-27">2 Luk 18:13-27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 32:1-19">2 Tek 32:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 36:1" />I mwaka me apar wiye angwen me loc pa rwot Kejekia, en aye Cenakerib rwot me Aciria obino kwede ka lweny ikom taun madito ducu me Juda ma kirumugi ki cel gogo, ci omayogi ducu. <verse eid="ISA 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 36:2" />Rwot me Aciria ocwalo Larabcake bot rwot Kejekia i Jerucalem, kun Larabcake a ki i Lakic ki dul mony madit tutwal. Ci ocito ocung inget yoo pii ma mol ki i joro mamalo, i yoo gudu ma cito i poto pa Lalwok bongo.<verse eid="ISA 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 36:3" />Jo adek me Juda cutcut gubino me rwate kwede: Eliakim wod pa Ilkia, ma en aye ladit maloyo jami ma i ot pa rwot, kacel ki Cebna ma karan, ki Joa wod pa Acap, laco lok ma time.<verse eid="ISA 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 36:4" />Larabcake owaco botgi ni, “Wuwac bot Kejekia ni: rwot madit, rwot me Aciria, owaco kuman ni in igeno gin ango? <verse eid="ISA 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 36:5" />In itamo ni lok me dog nono bedo rom ki ryeko me lweny ki mony madit me loyo lwenye. In kombedi ijenge ikom anga ka, ma omiyo ijemo woko ikomani? <verse eid="ISA 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 36:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 29:6-7">Eje 29:6-7</ref></char></note> Nen, kombedi iloko Ejipt odoko odoo ma ijenge ikome, kun en lagada ma otur dok otyer woko, ma bitucu cing dano mo ma ojenge ikome. Meno kit ma Parao rwot me Ejipt bedo katimo kwede jo ducu ma gijenge ikome. <verse eid="ISA 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 36:7" />Ento ka wuwaca ni, ‘Wan wajenge giwa ikom Rwot ma Lubangawa,’ pe en aye wang jogine ma iwi godi, ki keno tyere ma yam Kejekia omukugi wokoni, kun waco bot jo Jerucalem ki Juda ni, ‘Wubiworo Lubanga inyim keno tyer man ma i Jerucalem keken.?’ <verse eid="ISA 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 36:8" />Kong ijeng gin mo me lacama ki ladita rwot me Aciria! An abimiyi aguragura alip aryo, kace in ki tung boti bene itwero nongo jo ma ngweco kwedgi. <verse eid="ISA 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 36:9" />In itamo ni itwero tayo ladit lweny acel mo ki ikin lutic pa ladita matinone, kace ijenge ikom Ejipt pi gadigadi lweny ki wegi aguragura ma gibicwali? <verse eid="ISA 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 36:10" />Dok bene in itamo ni abino ka lweny ikom kabedo man wek atyek woko labongo twero pa Rwot? Wai Rwot aye ma owaca ni, ‘Cit wek ilweny ikom lobo man ityek woko liweng!’”<verse eid="ISA 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 36:11" />Cutcut Eliakim ki Cebna, ka Joa guwaco bot Larabcake ni, “Walegi ilok ki wan lutici i leb Aram, pien wawinyo. Pe ibed kalok kwedwa i leb Juda ma lwak ma gitye iwi cel bene giwinyo.”<verse eid="ISA 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 36:12" />Ento Larabcake ogamo doggi ni, “Itamo ni rwoda ocwala ka loko lok magi bot laditwu ki botwu keken bo, pe bot lwak ma gubedo iwi cel bene, ma gin kacel ki wun gukeme ki can me camo cetgi ki mato lacgi ken gi?”<verse eid="ISA 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 36:13" />Larabcake ocung ocako dange ki dwon malongo i leb Juda ni, “Wuwiny lok pa rwot madit, rwot me Aciria! <verse eid="ISA 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 36:14" />Rwot me Aciria owaco ni pe wuwek Kejekia obed kabwolowu, pien en pe bitwero larowu. <verse eid="ISA 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 36:15" />Pe bene wuwek Kejekia omiwu wujenge ikom Rwot Lubanga kun wuwaco ni, ‘Rwot Lubanga aye bilarowa, dok ni taun madit man pe kibimiyo i cing rwot me Aciria.’ <verse eid="ISA 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 36:16" />Pe wubed kawinyo lok pa Kejekia; pien man aye lok ma rwot me Aciria owaco ni, ‘Wuyub lok me kuc kweda, ci wukati woko bota; kitmeno ngat acel acel bicamo nyig olok ma i potone, ngat acel acel bicamo nyig odurune, ki ngat acel acel bimato pii ma i wang ite kikome; <verse eid="ISA 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 36:17" />nio ka abiterowu wa i lobo marom ki mewuni, lobo ma ceko kal ki kongo bwino, lobo ma miyowu kwon, matye iye poto olokgu. <verse eid="ISA 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 36:18" />Wugwoke, pe wubed kawinyo lok pa Kejekia matye kabwolowu marac kun waco ni Rwot Lubanga bilarowu. Tye lubanga pa lurok mo mayam olaro lobone ki i cing rwot me Aciria? <verse eid="ISA 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 36:19" />Lubanga pa jo Kamat ki Arpad gitye kwene ka? Lubanga pa jo Ceparvaim gitye kwene? Gin yam gularo Camaria ki i cinga bo? <verse eid="ISA 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 36:20" />Lubanga me lobo mene ki ikin lubanga ducu ma gitye ki lobogi, mayam kong olaro lobone ki i cinga mono, ma omiyo wutamo ni Rwot Lubangawu bilaro Jerucalem ki i cingani?’”<verse eid="ISA 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 36:21" />Ento lwak ducu guling alinga, pe gudoke iye lok mo kadi ki acel, pien onongo rwot ociko ni, “Pe wubigamo doge.” <verse eid="ISA 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 36:22" />Lacen Eliakim wod pa Ilkia ma en aye ladit maloyo jami ma i ot pa rwot, kacel ki Cebna ma karan, ki Joa wod pa Acap ma laco lok ma time guyeco bongigi gucito kwede wa bot Kejekia, ci gutite lok ducu ma Larabcake owaco.<verse eid="ISA 36:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="ISA 37" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot Kejekia openyo tam ki bot Icaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 19:1-7">2 Luk 19:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 37:1" />Ka rwot Kejekia owinyo, ci oyeco bongine woko, ocako ume ki bongo cola, ci ocito kwede wa i Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="ISA 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 37:2" />En ooro Eliakim ma lalo jami ma i ode, kacel ki Cebna ma karan, ki ajwaki pa Lubanga ma gutegi ma guumu komgi woko ki bongo cola. En ocwalogi gucito bot Icaya wod pa Amoj, ma lanebi. <verse eid="ISA 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 37:3" />Gin guwaco bote ni, “Kejekia owaco kuman ni, ‘Tin piny dong oloyowa woko, kiburuwa, lewic omakowa mada. Warom ki dako ma mito nywalo latin, ento tek me nywalone aye peke. <verse eid="ISA 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 37:4" />Rwot me Aciria otyeko cwalo ladit monye me yeto ki cayo Lubanga ma kwo. Myero Rwot Lubangani owiny lok me cac man ci omii pwod ki ngat ma owaco. Piman leg Lubangani tin pi jo ma gubwot, ma gudongi.’”<verse eid="ISA 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 37:5" />Ka lutic pa rwot Kejekia guo bot Icaya, <verse eid="ISA 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 37:6" />ci Icaya owaco botgi ni, “Wuwac bot laditwu ni, ‘Rwot owaco kuman ni: pe ibed ki lworo mo pi lok ma iwinyoni ma lutic pa rwot me Aciria gubedo ka yeta kwede. <verse eid="ISA 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 37:7" />Nen, abiketo cwiny mo i iye, ci biwinyo lok mo ma kiyweko pire, ci dok woko wa i lobo tugi; ci abimiyo kineko en woko ki pala lucwan ki i lobo tugi kunu.’”<verse eid="ISA 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jo Aciria dok gucwalo lok me bura mukene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 19:8-19">2 Luk 19:8-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 37:8" />Ka Larabcake odok, ci onongo rwot me Aciria tye ka lweny ikom Libna; pien onongo owinyo ni rwot otyeko a woko ki i Lakic. <verse eid="ISA 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 37:9" />Lacen ingeye, rwot owinyo lok ikom Tiraka rwot me Etiopia, ni otingo yoo me bino ka lweny ikome, en dok ocwalo lukwena bot Kejekia kun waco ni, <verse eid="ISA 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 37:10" />“Wubiwaco bot Kejekia rwot me Juda kit man ni, ‘Pe iwek Lubangani ma igenoni obwoli ni pe ebimiyo Jerucalem i cing rwot me Aciria. <verse eid="ISA 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 37:11" />Nen, dong ityeko winyo gin ma rwot me Aciria otimo ikom lobo ducu. Tika dong iwinyo kit ma en otyekogi kwede woko, ci in kono itamo ni ibibwot ningning? <verse eid="ISA 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 37:12" />Kwariwa yam gujwero taun madito me Gojan, Karan ki Recep, ci guneko jo Eden ma onongo yam gibedo i Telacar, ento jogigi mo pe olarogi. <verse eid="ISA 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 37:13" />Luker ma giloyo taun madito magi kono gitye kwene? Rwot me Kamat, ki me Arpad, rwot me Ceparvaim, ki me Ena kacel ki me Iya, gin ducu kombedi gitye kwene?’”<verse eid="ISA 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 37:14" />Ci Kejekia ogamo waraga ki i cing lukwena meno ci okwano. Ka oa ocito i Ot pa Rwot, ci oyaro waraga meno woko inyim Rwot, <verse eid="ISA 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 37:15" />ci olego Rwot ni, <verse eid="ISA 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 37:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:22">Nia 25:22</ref></char></note>“Ai Rwot Lubanga me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael, ma ibedo iwi komkeri ka wi lukerubi; in keni giri aye ibedo Lubanga ma iloyo dul lobo ducu ma iwi lobo. In aye ma icweyo polo ki lobo. <verse eid="ISA 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 37:17" />Tim ber icik iti iwinywa, ai Rwot, yab wangi inenwa, dok bene iwiny lok ducu ma Cenakerib ocwalo kun cayo kwede in Lubanga makwo. <verse eid="ISA 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 37:18" />Ada, ai Rwot, wangeyo ni luker me Aciria guneko rok ducu ma omiyo lobogi odong nono, <verse eid="ISA 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 37:19" />dok bene guwango lwak jogigi woko ki mac; pien onongo gin pe Lubanga kikome, gin tic me cing dano, yen ki got keken, ma omiyo kityekogi woko. <verse eid="ISA 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 37:20" />Piman kombedi dong, ai Rwot Lubangawa, larwa ki icinge, wek ker ma iwi lobo ducu gunge ni in giri aye ibedo Lubanga keni.”<verse eid="ISA 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Icaya owaco bot rwot Kejekia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 19:20-37">2 Luk 19:20-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 37:21" />Icaya wod pa Amoj odwoko lok bot rwot Kejekia kun wace ni, “Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael owaco kuman ni: atyeko winyo legani ma icwalo bota pi Cenakerib rwot me Aciria. <verse eid="ISA 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 37:22" />Man aye dong lok ma Rwot owaco ikom Cenakerib: jo Cion gicayi in Cenakerib; anyaka Jerucalem ma pud rini bene cayi, kun yengo wiye ki ingeyi. <verse eid="ISA 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 37:23" />In icayo anga, anga mono ma iyetoni? Imoro dwoni ikom anga, ma itingo wangi ki awakani? In icayo Ngat Maleng me Icrael kulu! <verse eid="ISA 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 37:24" />In aye ma imiyo lukwenani gucayo Rwot, dok iwaco ni in i ito malo iwi godi kun itye ki lwak gadigadi lwenyi, nio wa malo iwi got Lebanon. Iwake bene ni itongo yadi cedar maboco ki kunu woko ki yadi ciprec mabecone madani; ki ni adonyo bene i bungana kamabor, kama yadi ocule iye liking. <verse eid="ISA 37:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 37:25" />In iwake bene ni in aye ikwinyo wang it mapol, dok ni imato pii pa lurok; inyono lobo Ejipt, itwoyo pii ma i jang kulu Nail ducu. <verse eid="ISA 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 37:26" />In peya iwinyo bo ni atyeko yubu wacon ca? Gin ma atye katimo kombedi yam ayubu wa ikare macon ca, ni in myero itur taun madito ducu ma kicelo ki cel gogo, ilokgi odok obur ma odure lipim. <verse eid="ISA 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 37:27" />Jo ma gibedo iye onongo dong gudoko goro; kun cwinygi obale, lewic omakogi, gudoko macalo ginapita ma i poto gicalo lum alita, gicalo lum ma otwi iwi ot ma obware woko ma pud otwi atwiya. <verse eid="ISA 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 37:28" />Ento angeyo bedoni piny, ki citoni woko ki donyoni i ot ki jenyeni ikoma. <verse eid="ISA 37:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 37:29" />Pien ibedo ka jenye ikoma ki akemo, lok me nyateni bene otyeko donyo i ita, ma omiyo abirwako golina i umi, abiketo tola i dogi, abidwoki cen i yoo kama yam iwok ki iye.”<verse eid="ISA 37:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 37:30" />Lacen Icaya owaco bot rwot Kejekia ni, “Man aye gin ma binyutu gin ma bitime. I mwaka man ki i mwaka ma lubu wubicamo cam ma otwi kene, ento i mwaka me adeke wubicoyo kodi, dok wubikayo kac, wubipito olok, dok bene wubicamo nyige. <verse eid="ISA 37:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 37:31" />Jo ma bibwot, ma gibidong ki i ot pa Juda gibibedo macalo yat ma oguru lwite odonyo piny i ngom, dok ma nyako nyige lamalo. <verse eid="ISA 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 37:32" />Pieno jo ma gudong gibikato woko ki i Jerucalem, lwak jo ma obwot gibikato woko ki iwi got Cion. Man bitime pi arima ma Rwot me mony tye kwede pirwu.<verse eid="ISA 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 37:33" />Pimeno Rwot owaco lok kuman ikom rwot me Aciria ni, ‘En pe bidonyo i taun madit man, pe bene bibayo atero mo iye, pe gibidore ki kwotgi me nyiko cok kwede, pe bene gibitoro cel lobo me rumune woko. <verse eid="ISA 37:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 37:34" />En bidok cen ki ngeye kun lubu yoo mayam en obino kwede, pe bidonyo i taun madit man. Man an Rwot kikome aye aloko. <verse eid="ISA 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ISA 37:35" />An abilweny pi taun madit man me larone pira kena ki pi latica Daudi.’”<verse eid="ISA 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ISA 37:36" />I dyewor meno lamalaika pa Rwot ocito, oneko jo Aciria alip miya acel ki pyere aboro wiye abic ki i gonygi. Ka dano gua malo odiko con, ci nen, gunongo kom jo Aciria ma oto orade lirat. <verse eid="ISA 37:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ISA 37:37" />Cenakerib rwot me Aciria ocako a ocito, odok wa i gange ci obedo i Nineve. <verse eid="ISA 37:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ISA 37:38" />Ikare ma Cenakerib tye kamiyo woro i ot pa lubangane Nicirok, ki awobene, Adramelek ki Carejer guneke woko ki pala lucwan, ci guringo woko gularo komgi wa i Ararat. Ci wode, Ecar-kadon aye oleyo katyene.<verse eid="ISA 37:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="ISA 38" />
  <para style="s1">Two pa rwot Kejekia ki cange</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 20:1-11">2 Luk 20:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 32:24-26">2 Tek 32:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 38:1" />Ikare meno two omako Kejekia ma onongo cok to woko. Lanebi Icaya wod pa Amoj ocito bote ci owace ni, “Rwot owaco kuman ni, ‘Yub odi obed maber pien ibito woko, twoni pe bicang.’” <verse eid="ISA 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 38:2" />Kejekia oloko wange ikom kicika ot olego Rwot <verse eid="ISA 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 38:3" />kun waco ni, “Tim ber, ai Rwot, kong ipo, inen kit kwo ma abedo kwede inyimi, kun abedo ngat ma geni, alubu loki ki cwinya ducu, kun abedo katiyo gin manen maber i wangi.” Ci Kejekia ocako koko matek tutwal kun cwinye cwer. <verse eid="ISA 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 38:4" />Cutcut lok pa Rwot dok obino bot Icaya kun wace ni <verse eid="ISA 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 38:5" />owac bot Kejekia ni, “Rwot Lubanga pa kwarowu Daudi owaco kuman ni, ‘Atyeko winyo legani, dok bene aneno pig wangi; nen, abimiyo dok pud ibedo i lobo pi mwaka apar wiye abic. <verse eid="ISA 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 38:6" />Abilari kacel ki taun madit man ki i cing rwot me Aciria, dok bene abigwoko taun madit man.”<verse eid="ISA 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 38:7" />Man aye lanyut ma binyuti ni Rwot bitiyo gin ma otyeko ciko pire: <verse eid="ISA 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 38:8" />Rwot bicoro tipu ceng dok cen tyen apar ki ikom gin me poro ceng pa Akaj. Tipu ceng bene odok cen tyen apar kulu ma onongo okato ikom giporone.<verse eid="ISA 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 38:9" />Ikare ma dong Kejekia ocang ki itwone, ocako coyo wer man me pako Lubanga ni,<verse eid="ISA 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 38:10" />“Yam onongo atamo ni abito ma nongo pud atektek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:10">atamo ni onongo dong icwala woko i lobo pa jo ma oto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:10">kacito kabedo kunu dong matwal pi kare me kwona ducu.<verse eid="ISA 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 38:11" />Onongo yam atamo ni pe dong abineno Rwot</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:11">i lobo pa jo makwo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:11">pe dok abineno dano mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:11">ki ikin jo ducu ma gibedo iwi lobo.<verse eid="ISA 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 38:12" />Onongo dong kiputu kwona woko, kitero kamabor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:12">calo kema pa lakwat ma kiputu woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:12">adolo kwona woko calo lacwe bongo ma odolo bongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:12">ma ongolo woko ki ikom yat lacwe bongo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:12">Rwot, onongo dong imiyo kwona ni ogik woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:12">ma ocake odiko o kwede wa i dyewor.<verse eid="ISA 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 38:13" />Akok dyewor benebene pi kony kun atye ki arem madit tutwal;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:13">Rwot oturu cogona woko ducu calo labwor.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:13">Rwot, onongo dong imiyo kwona ni ogik woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:13">cake odiko o kwede wa i dyewor.<verse eid="ISA 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 38:14" />Dwona onongo dong winye calo lakalagwec ma kok, nyo owalu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:14">onongo dong akok calo akuri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:14">Wanga onongo dong ojony woko ki neno malo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:14">kiuna dong marac; ai Rwot, lara do!<verse eid="ISA 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 38:15" />An kono dok atwero loko gin ango?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:15">Pien oloko kweda, dok en kikome aye ma omiyo man otime,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:15">i dyewor pe anino wa ki acel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:15">pi cwercwiny ma onongo atye kwede.<verse eid="ISA 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 38:16" />Ai Rwot; dano bedo kwo pi gin magi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:16">an gira kwona ocung ikomi keken;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:16">canga woko wek abed kwo.<verse eid="ISA 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 38:17" />Nen cwercwiny madit ma onongo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:17">atye kwede, oloke odoko me kela kuc;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:17">in aye ilaro kwona ki i dog bur me to,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:17">pien ibolo bala woko ducu tung ngeyi.<verse eid="ISA 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 38:18" />Pien pe tye ngat mo i lobo pa jo ma oto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:18">matwero paki kun pwoyi bene; jo ma donyo piny i lyel</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:18">pe dok gitye ki gen ikom geneni.<verse eid="ISA 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 38:19" />Dano makwo aye twero pako in,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:19">kit macalo an tin apaki kwedeni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:19">won lutino tito ki lutinone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:19">kit ma in igene kwede.<verse eid="ISA 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 38:20" />Rwot dong cok lara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:20">wabigoyo nanga ki opuk kun wapaki kwede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:20">wabiwero wer me paki i odi kama kiwori iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:20">pi kare me kwowa ducu.”<verse eid="ISA 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 38:21" />Icaya onongo owaco bot rwot ni kiod nyig oduru ci kimwon iwang odeke pa rwot, wek bure ocang woko. <verse eid="ISA 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 38:22" />Rwot Kejekia onongo openyo ni, “Gin ango ma binyutu ni abicito i Ot pa Rwot?”<verse eid="ISA 38:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="ISA 39" />
  <para style="s1">Lukwena ma gua ki i Babilon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 20:12-19">2 Luk 20:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 39:1" />Ikare meno rwot me Babilon, Merodak-baladan wod pa Baladan, owinyo ni rwot Kejekia kome lit; ci ocwalo lukwena gutero waraga kacel ki mot bote, pien onongo dong bene owinyo ni twone ocang woko. <verse eid="ISA 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 39:2" />Kejekia ojologi maber, ocako nyutu botgi ot kano lime ducu; guneno ryal ki jabu, angwece, moo me wel, ki ot kano jami lwenye ducu. En onyutu botgi gin ducu ma onongo tye i ot kano jamine. Pe tye gin mo ma odong ma en pe onyutu botgi ma onongo tye i ode ki i lobo ducu ma onongo tye ite loce. <verse eid="ISA 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 39:3" />Lacen lanebi Icaya obino bot rwot Kejekia, ci openyo ni, “Jo meno guwaco lok ango? Gin kono gua ki kwene?” Kejekia ogamo ni, “Gua ki i lobo mabor, wa i lobo Babilon.” <verse eid="ISA 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 39:4" />Icaya dok openye ni, “Guneno gin ango ki i odi?” Kejekia ogamo ni, “Gutyeko neno jami ducu matye i oda; pe tye gin mo ma odong matye i odi kano lima ma pe anyutu botgi.”<verse eid="ISA 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 39:5" />Ci Icaya owaco bot rwot Kejekia ni, “Kong dong iwiny lok ma Rwot me mony owaco. <verse eid="ISA 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 39:6" />En owaco kuman ni, ‘Kare dong cok romo, ma jami ducu ma i odi, ki mayam kwarini gukano nio wa onyo, kibiterogi woko wa i Babilon; pe tye gin mo ma bidong kadi ki acel, man Rwot aye ma owaco. <verse eid="ISA 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 39:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:1-7">Dan 1:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:10-16">2 Luk 24:10-16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10">2 Tek 36:10</ref></char></note>Ki awobeni mogo bene, ma in inywalogi, kibiterogi woko bene, kibikolo man gi woko, ci gidoko lutic i gangkal me Babilon.’”<verse eid="ISA 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 39:8" />Rwot Kejekia onongo oniang ni kuc bibedo tye ikare me loce labongo alokaloka mo, omiyo en owaco bot Icaya ni, “Lok pa Rwot ma iwaco botani tye mere maber.”<verse eid="ISA 39:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="ISA 40" />
  <para style="s1">Lok ma kelo gen bot jo pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 40:1" />Lubangawa tye kawaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:1">“Wukwe cwiny lwaka, wukwe cwinygi!<verse eid="ISA 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 40:2" />Wucuk cwiny jo Jerucalem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:2">wuwac botgi ni, karegi me bedo opii dong ogik woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:2">dong kityeko timo kica botgi ikom balgi ducu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:2">Can ma an aketo ikomgi obedo dit mada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:2">obamo balgi ducu ma gutimo.”<verse eid="ISA 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 40:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:3">Mat 3:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:3">Mar 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:23">Jon 1:23</ref></char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 3:4-6">Luk 3:4-6</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Dwon mo ma dange i tim winye kun waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:3">“Wuger yoo pa Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:3">wutir yoone ocung atir i tim aroo pi Lubangawa.<verse eid="ISA 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 40:4" />Lung ducu kibitoro woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:4">godi ki cere ducu kibidwokogi woko piny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:4">kama ogone kibitiro cung atir, dok kama obedo burbur kibipiro woko.<verse eid="ISA 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 40:5" />Kadong deyo pa Rwot binen kamaleng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:5">ci dano ducu bineno kacel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:5">pien Rwot kikome aye ma dong owaco.”<verse eid="ISA 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 40:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 1:10-11">Yak 1:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:24-25">1 Pet 1:24-25</ref></char>
    </note>Dano mo tye ka waco ni, “Dange!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:6">Cutcut agamo ni, “Imito adange ningning?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:6">Ci dwon meno ogamo ni, “Tit ni gin mo ducu matye ki kom obedo calo lum,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:6">bere ducu rom ki ber pa ature me tim.<verse eid="ISA 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 40:7" />Lum ner, ature bene o woko ka Rwot okutu kome ki aluu me yweyone.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:7">Ada, dano mere rom ki lum.<verse eid="ISA 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 40:8" />Lum ner, ci aturene o woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:8">ento lok pa Lubanga bedo matwal.<verse eid="ISA 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 40:9" />In Cion ma ikelo lok maberi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:9">it malo iwi got mabor.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:9">In Jerucalem ma itito lok maberi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:9">med dwoni malo ki tek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:9">med dwoni malo, pe ilwor.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:9">Wac bot jo ma bedo i taun madito ducu me Juda ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:9">‘Wunen Lubangawu tye kabino!’<verse eid="ISA 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 40:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 62:11">Ica 62:11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:12">Niy 22:12</ref></char>
    </note>Wunen, Rwot Lubangawu tye kabino kaloc ki tek mere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:10">nen, en tye kabino ki mote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:10">jo ma en okoko bene tye inyime.<verse eid="ISA 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 40:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 34:15">Eje 34:15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:11">Jon 10:11</ref></char>
    </note>En bikwayo romine calo lakwat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:11">bitingo lutino romine i bade,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:11">en bitingogi i kore,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:11">ci mako lutino romi ma dot, peyogi motmot.”<verse eid="ISA 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pe kitwero poro Lubanga pa jo Icrael ki gin mo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 40:12" />Anga mayam kong opimo pii idye cinge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:12">dok ma opimo polo ki cinge?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:12">Anga ma ojobo apwa me lobo ci oonyo i gipimo jami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:12">nyo mayam opimo godi i mijan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:12">ki kama obedo cerecere i ratili?<verse eid="ISA 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 40:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 11:34">Rom 11:34</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 2:16">1 Kor 2:16</ref></char>
    </note> Anga ma waco ki Rwot gin ma myero en otim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:13">nyo anga ma pwonyo Rwot dok miye tam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:13">macalo lapwonye?<verse eid="ISA 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 40:14" />Anga mayam kong Rwot onongo tam ki bote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:14">nyo anga ma opwonye ki ngolo kop atir?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:14">Anga mayam kong opwonye me medo ngece,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:14">nyo ma onyute yo me bedo ki niang matut?<verse eid="ISA 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 40:15" />Nen rok ducu rom ki pii ma ton kicel ki i agulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:15">dok giyot macalo apwa matye i mijan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:15">nen, en tingo cula woko ki idye nam calo nyig kweyo.<verse eid="ISA 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 40:16" />Yen ducu ma i bunga me Lebanon pe romo wango gitum awanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:16">lee matye iye bene nok, pe giromo me atyera bot Lubanga.<verse eid="ISA 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 40:17" />Rok ducu pe gin mo inyime,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:17">gin ducu pe gubedo gin mo ki tung bote, gin ducu mwa.<verse eid="ISA 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 40:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:29">Tic 17:29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Dong ibiporo Lubanga ki anga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:18">nyo itwero poro cale ki kit cal ango?<verse eid="ISA 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 40:19" />Lubanga pe rom ki cal jok ma kitwako atwaka, ma latet twero twakone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:19">layub jabu mwono kome woko ki jabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:19">dok tiyo nyor ryal pire.<verse eid="ISA 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 40:20" />Ngat ma can odiyo adada, yero yat matek ma pe top atata me gityer,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:20">ci yenyo lapac ma ladiro, wek opane cal apaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:20">ma pe dok romo poto ki kama kiketo iye.<verse eid="ISA 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 40:21" />Pe wungeyo bo? Yam peya wuwinyo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:21">Yam onongo pe kitito botwu pire con?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:21">Peya wuniang nia wa i acaki me cweyo lobo?<verse eid="ISA 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 40:22" />Ngat ma bedo iwi komkere malo en aye ma oketo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:22">en ma bedo wa malo tutwal wa inge pol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:22">jo ma bedo piny i lobo ginen matino calo ocene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:22">En ryeyo polo calo bongo kicika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:22">dok yaro bene calo kema me bedo iye.<verse eid="ISA 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 40:23" />En miyo luloc me lobo gidoko gin ma konygi peke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:23">en dwoko rwodi ducu me lobo woko piny lirwat.<verse eid="ISA 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 40:24" />Gin gubedo calo ginapita ma pud kipito apita,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:24">ma pud kicoyo acoya kun guryeyo lwitgi pud aryeya i ngom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:24">ma ka Rwot ocwalo yamo ikomgi ci giner woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:24">kace yamo lapiru okodo ikomgi, ci tingogi calo cung kal terogi woko.<verse eid="ISA 40:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 40:25" />Ngat Maleng openyo ni, “Dong wubipora ki ango mono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:25">tye ngat mo marom kweda?”<verse eid="ISA 40:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 40:26" />Kong wuting wangwu malo wunen polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:26">anga ma ocweyo lakalatwe magi ducu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:26">En aye obedo ngat ma telo monygi, ma ngeyo welgi ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:26">dok bene lwongogi ki nyinggi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:26">Tekone dwong tutwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:26">meno aye gin ma omiyo ngat acel mo ki ikin gi pe rwenyo.<verse eid="ISA 40:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 40:27" />Pingo itye kakoko, in Yakobo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:27">Pingo kono itye kawaco ni Rwot pe neni, in Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:27">kun iwaco ni Lubanga tika paro piri?<verse eid="ISA 40:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 40:28" />Pud pe wungeyo bo? Yam peya wuwinyo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:28">Rwot en Lubanga ma bedo nakanaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:28">en aye ma ocweyo wi lobo ducu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:28">En pe ol, pe bene doko goro;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:28">ngece tut ma pe wace, kadi tato tere bene pe twere wa ki acel.<verse eid="ISA 40:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 40:29" />En miyo tek bot jo magoro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:29">dok bene medo tek bot ngat ma tekone odok woko piny.<verse eid="ISA 40:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 40:30" />Kadi awobe bene gitwero doko goro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:30">gitwero ol bene ma giromo poto woko piny;<verse eid="ISA 40:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 40:31" />ento jo ma giketo gen gi ikom Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:31">teko bidwogo cen ikomgi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:31">Gibituk gicito malo calo ocur,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:31">gibiringo ma pe giol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:31">gibibedo kawot nakanaka ma komgi pe biloc.<verse eid="ISA 40:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="ISA 41" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot ocike pi konyo jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 41:1" />Rwot Lubanga owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:1">“Wuling mot, wuwiny loka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:1">wun lobo matye i dog nam;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:1">wek rok ducu gulim tek manyen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:1">gucak bino wek gulok lokgi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:1">Myero wan ducu wanyiku cok wek wangolu kop ikinwa kekenwa.<verse eid="ISA 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 41:2" />Anga ma otugu oteka ma oa ki tung kunyango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:2">dok miyo en loyo lweny i kabedo ducu ma en woto iye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:2">Anga mamiyo en loyo rok mapol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:2">kun miyo bote twero me nyono luker woko ite tyene piny?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:2">Pala lucwane miyo dano gidoko calo apwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:2">aterone nekogi, tingogi woko calo cung kal ma yamo tero.<verse eid="ISA 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 41:3" />En ryemogi woko, ci kato cito ki kuc,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:3">ma nongo dwir mada, kun nongo nen calo tyene pe gudo piny.<verse eid="ISA 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 41:4" />Anga ma omiyo gin magi ducu otime?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:4">Anga ma omiyo lwak jami ma kombedi tyeni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:4">kit macalo kombedi gitye kwedeni nia i acaki piny?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:4">An Rwot aye abedo mukwongo nia i acaki piny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:4">an Rwot Lubanga abibedo tye bene i agiki.<verse eid="ISA 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 41:5" />Lobo matye i dog nam dong guneno gin ma atiyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:5">lworo omakogi, komgi obedo ka myel amyela;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:5">gin ducu dong gubino gunyiko cok.<verse eid="ISA 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 41:6" />Dano acel acel konyo lawote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:6">kun waco bot omine ni, ‘Di cwinyi!’<verse eid="ISA 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 41:7" />Lapac cuku cwiny latet jabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:7">ngat ma cwero kom cal apaya wek obed pwot cuku cwiny ngat ma goyo agoya ikom got ki nyono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:7">kun waco ni, ‘Gin meno ber;’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:7">ci kiguro cal meno woko matek ki cumar wek pe dok oput woko.<verse eid="ISA 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 41:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 20:7">2 Tek 20:7</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:23">Yak 2:23</ref></char>
    </note>Ento in latica Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:8">in Yakobo ma dong atyeko yeri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:8">lakwar Abraim ma en ngat ma amaro.<verse eid="ISA 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 41:9" />In ma ceng akeli ki i agiki lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:9">alwongi ki i gul kamabor adada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:9">kun awaci ni, ‘In latica,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:9">dong atyeko yeri, dok bene pe abiboli woko cen.’<verse eid="ISA 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 41:10" />Pe ilwor, an atye kwedi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:10">cwinyi pe opoti, pien an Lubangani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:10">abimiyi tek, dok abikonyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:10">abimaki ki cinga ma lacuc, mamiyo iloyo lukwori.<verse eid="ISA 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 41:11" />Wunen, jo ducu ma kiniga omakogi i komwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:11">gibimiyo lewic makogi, dok alee bene twodogi woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:11">jo ma pyem kwedwu, wun jona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:11">gibidoko calo gin ma konye peke, ci gito woko.<verse eid="ISA 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 41:12" />Wubiyenyo jo ma lwenyo kwedwu, ento pe wubinongogi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:12">jo ma oto mony ikomwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:12">gibidoko calo gin ma konye peke.<verse eid="ISA 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 41:13" />Pien an a Rwot Lubangawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:13">dong amako cingwu ma lacuc woko liking;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:13">an atye kawaco botwu ni, ‘Pe wulwor, an abikonyowu.’”<verse eid="ISA 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 41:14" />Pe ilwor Yakobo, kadi bed ibedo calo kwidi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:14">pe wulwor, wun jo Icrael, kadi wugoro mada!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:14">Abikonyowu, man an Rwot aye awaco;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:14">an Ngat Maleng me Icrael, aye ma bikokowu.<verse eid="ISA 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 41:15" />Nen, abimiyo wudoko opam me dino kal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:15">mapek, dok manyen, ma dino kal maber tutwal;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:15">wubidino godi ci wunginyogi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:15">dok wubiloko lobo ma gubedo cere gidoko calo cung bel.<verse eid="ISA 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 41:16" />Wubipyetogi, ci yamo bitingogi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:16">yamo lapiru me kot bikeyogi woko atata.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:16">Ento wun wubibedo ki yomcwiny i Rwot;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:16">wubiwake bene mada pi Ngat Maleng me Icrael.<verse eid="ISA 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 41:17" />Kace lucan kacel ki jo ma piny obwoyogi gibiyenyo pii me amata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:17">kun pii pe nen wa ki acel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:17">ma nongo dwon gi otwo dok ma lebgi omoko woko likang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:17">ci an Rwot abiwinyo legagi ci abidok iye bene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:17">an Lubanga pa Icrael pe abitenyogi ata.<verse eid="ISA 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 41:18" />Abimiyo pii mol iwi godi kama pii peke iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:18">pii bibedo kagunye agunya ki piny i lung gu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:18">Abimiyo pii pong idye tim kama yam otwo woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:18">Wang it dong bibedo tye i lobo mutwo.<verse eid="ISA 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 41:19" />Abimiyo yadi cedar dongo idye tim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:19">ki okutu lacari ki yadi matino ma ngwecgi kur, ki yaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:19">abiketo yadi cule doko bunga idye tim kama yadi peke iyeni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:19">yadi ciprec kacel ki kit yadi mukene.<verse eid="ISA 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 41:20" />Dano gibineno wek gunge ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:20">Rwot Lubanga Maleng pa Icrael aye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:20">omiyo kit gin man otime,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:20">gin gibitamo pire mot lacen ci gibiniang ni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:20">Rwot aye matye katimo man.<verse eid="ISA 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot Lubanga ocayo lwak lubanga me rok mukene</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 41:21" />Rwot Lubanga ma en Rwot pa jo pa Yakobo owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:21">“Wun lwak lubanga pa lurok, wunyut lok ma wutye kwede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:21">dok wukel pidowu mogo matek bota.<verse eid="ISA 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 41:22" />Wubin wunyut botwa gin ma bitime i anyim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:22">Dong wutit bot lwak gin mayam otyeko time woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:22">wek kong watam;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:22">wutitiwa gin ma bia ki ikom gin ma dong otyeko timenu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:22">wek wan bene waniang ilok ma bitime.<verse eid="ISA 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 41:23" />Wutitiwa gin ma bitime i anyim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:23">wek omii waye ni wun wubedo lubanga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:23">Kong wutim gin maber nyo marac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:23">ma poto cwinywa mamiyo bene lworo makowa.<verse eid="ISA 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 41:24" />Wun pe wugin mo kadi ki acel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:24">gin ma wutiyogu ducu konye peke;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:24">jo ma yerowu doko gin me kwer ki tung bota.<verse eid="ISA 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 41:25" />Dong atyeko tugu ngat ma bedo i lobo ma tung kunyango ci en bibino;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:25">atuge me bino ka lweny kun a ki i tung kumalo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:25">en binyono luloc woko piny ki tyene calo nyono coto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:25">calo lacwe agulu ma nyono lobo me tice.<verse eid="ISA 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 41:26" />Anga mayam otito botwa ki i acaki ni lok man bitime,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:26">wek waye ni en oloko lok matye atir dok ada?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:26">Ngat mo ma otito botwa peke, dok bene ngat ma otucu peke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:26">pe tye ngat mo ma owinyo ka wubedo ka loko gin mo.<verse eid="ISA 41:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 41:27" />An Rwot aye akwongo tito lok man bot jo Cion,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:27">dok bene acwalo lakwena ocito i Jerucalem wek otit lok maber bot jo ma bedo kunu.<verse eid="ISA 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 41:28" />Ento ka angiyo piny aneno gin lwak lubangagu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:28">pe anongo mo acel matwero miyo tam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:28">onyo matwero dok i peny ma apenyo.<verse eid="ISA 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 41:29" />Nen, gin ducu konygi peke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:29">ticgi ma gitiyo ducu mwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:29">calgi ma kitiyo ki mola ma kiliyo ducu mwa calo yamo.”<verse eid="ISA 41:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="ISA 42" />
  <para style="s1">Latic pa Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 42:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:5">17:5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">9:35</ref></char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:18-21">Mat 12:18-21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rwot owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:1">“Nen, latica ma an amiyo ki en teko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:1">ma an kikoma aye ayero ma cwinya yom ikome.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:1">Dong atyeko keto Cwiny ma mera ikome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:1">en dong bimiyo jo me rok ducu gibitiyo gin matye atir.<verse eid="ISA 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 42:2" />En pe biredo dok pe bidange kun ilo dwone malo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:2">pe kibiwinyo dwone i wanga yoo.<verse eid="ISA 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 42:3" />En pe bituru lagada ma okak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:3">dok pe bineko mac tara ma lyel niminimi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:3">en bikelo ngolo kop atir bot dano ducu.<verse eid="ISA 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 42:4" />En bibedo ki gen nakanaka ma cwinye pe bale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:4">nio ka dong omiyo tiyo gin matye atir oromo lobo ducu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:4">Lobo ma kamabor i dog nam ducu gitye kakuru cike.”<verse eid="ISA 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 42:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:24-25">Tic 17:24-25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rwot Lubanga ocweyo polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:5">ka dong oryeyo woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:5">ma oyaro wi lobo ki jami ducu matye iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:5">ka omiyo kwo ki yweyo bot jo ducu ma bedo iye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:5">Rwot Lubanga dong owaco kuman bot latice ni,<verse eid="ISA 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 42:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 49:6">Ica 49:6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:32">Luk 2:32</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:47">Tic 13:47</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:23">26:23</ref></char>
    </note>“An Rwot, dong atyeko lwongi me neno ni itiyo gin matye atir i lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:6">amako cingi, dok bene agwoki;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:6">dong atyeko miyi woko bot lurok macalo gicike,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:6">me bedo dero ma menyogi.<verse eid="ISA 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 42:7" />In aye ibiyabo wang lutowang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:7">ibigonyo lumabuc ki i buc ka ma kitweyogi iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:7">wek bene ikwanygi woko ki i piny macol kama onongo gibedo iye.<verse eid="ISA 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 42:8" />An nyinga Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:8">pe anywako deyona ki lubanga mo mukene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:8">kadi wa pak ma kipaka kwede bene pe abinywako ki cal jogi ma kipayogi apaya.<verse eid="ISA 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 42:9" />Nen, gin mukwongo mayam atito pire dong otime woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:9">kombedi atito botwu pi gin manyen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:9">ma pud peya ocako time.”<verse eid="ISA 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wer me pak</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 42:10" />Wuwer wer manyen me pako Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:10">wupake wun lobo ducu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:10">Wek nam kacel ki jami ducu matye iye gupake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:10">lobo matye i dog nam ki jo ducu ma bedo iye gupake.<verse eid="ISA 42:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 42:11" />Tim aroo ki lwak gangi ducu matye iye myero gupak Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:11">jo Kedar ducu myero gupake!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:11">Wek jo ma gibedo i Cela guwer pi yomcwiny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:11">wek bene gudange ki woo ki iwi godi pi yomcwiny.<verse eid="ISA 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 42:12" />Dano ducu ma gibedo i dog nam kamabor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:12">myero bene gupak Rwot kun gimiye deyo.<verse eid="ISA 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 42:13" />Rwot cito ka lweny calo oteka lweny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:13">akemone tuge calo dano ma lalweny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:13">en dange dok bene woo ki dwon malongo adada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:13">ento nyutu teke ikom lukwore.<verse eid="ISA 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rwot ocike me konyo jone</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 42:14" />Lubanga owaco ni, “Aling alinga dong</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:14">pi kare malac tutwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:14">abedo kadiyo cwinya kun pe agamo dog jona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:14">kombedi dong abicako yele pirgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:14">myero dong acak omo cwinya ki yweyo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:14">calo dako matye kacole ki arem me nywal.<verse eid="ISA 42:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 42:15" />Abibalo lobo ma obedo godigodi kacel ki godi ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:15">dok bene abimiyo gin ducu ma otwi iye two woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:15">abimiyo kulu ma pii tye iye two tal woko likang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:15">abimiyo pii two woko liweng ki i kabedo ducu mayam pii logo iye.<verse eid="ISA 42:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 42:16" />Abitelo lutowang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:16">i yoo ma gin pe ngeyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:16">i yoo mayam peya guwok ki iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:16">en aye abipeyogi ki iye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:16">Abimiyo colpiny mayam umugi wokoni doko dero,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:16">kama obedo burbur abipiro woko doko ma opire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:16">Magi aye gin ma abitimo, pe abitenyogi ata liyak.<verse eid="ISA 42:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 42:17" />Dano ducu ma gigeno cal jogi ma kipayo apaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:17">gin jo ma waco bot cal jogi ni, ‘Wun aye lubangawa,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:17">kibidwokogi cen ki lewic madwong tutwal.”<verse eid="ISA 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael pe gupwonye matwal</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 42:18" />Rwot dok owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:18">“Wuwiny loka wun ludingit,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:18">wun lutowang bene wuyab wangwu, wek wunen piny.<verse eid="ISA 42:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 42:19" />Tye ngat mo ma wange oto macalo wang latica,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:19">nyo ite oding macalo it lakwena ma aoroni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:19">Anga ma wange oto calo wang danona ma dong otyeko dyero kwone pira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:19">nyo ma wange oto calo wang latica?<verse eid="ISA 42:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 42:20" />Icrael neno jami mapol tutwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:20">ento pe keto cwinye me nenogi maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:20">ite tye twolo maromo winyo lok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:20">ento pe winyo gin mo wa ki acel.”<verse eid="ISA 42:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 42:21" />Pi kit ma atir pa Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:21">en mito ni kiwor cike, wek obed ki deyo.<verse eid="ISA 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 42:22" />Ento jone dong kiyakogi dok kimayo limgi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:22">gin ducu dong kicikogi woko ki bur,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:22">kikanogi woko i ot buc;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:22">gudoko dong ginayaka pa dano labongo ngat mo ma larogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:22">gin dong mere kiyakogi wa labongo ngat mo ma waco ni, “Wudwok jamigi botgi.”<verse eid="ISA 42:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 42:23" />Anga ikinwu ma biciko ite kawinyo lok man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:23">anga ma biketo cwinye kawinyone pi kare ma pud tye anyim?<verse eid="ISA 42:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 42:24" />Anga ma omiyo jo Icrael i cing ngat ma oyakogi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:24">Meno pe obedo Rwot ma wan watimo bal i nyimeni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:24">Pe en aye Rwot ma gukwero lubu yo ma en mitoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:24">ma bene gukwero lubu cike wokoni?<verse eid="ISA 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 42:25" />Pimeno omiyo en ocoro lyeto me</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:25">akemone ikom jo Icrael, ci otyekogi woko idog lweny.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:25">Macalo mac, akemone olyel oromo i lobo Icrael ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:25">ento jo Icrael pe gumedo ki niang gin matye katime,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:25">mace owangogi, ento jo Icrael pe guparo pire wa ki acel.<verse eid="ISA 42:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="ISA 43" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga ocike me laro jone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 43:1" />Kombedi dong Rwot Lubanga ma ocweyo in Icrael, owaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:1">“Pe ilwor, pien dong atyeko koko in woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:1">An alwongi ki nyingi, in i mega.<verse eid="ISA 43:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 43:2" />Ka ibiwok ki idye nam matut, abibedo kwedi, abigwoki;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:2">pii ma i kulu bene pe bimwonyi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:2">kadi ibiwot iwok ki idye mac, pe ibiwang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:2">leb mac pe bigudu komi.<verse eid="ISA 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 43:3" />Pien an a Rwot Lubangani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:3">an Ngat Maleng pa Icrael ma lari.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:3">Abimiyo Ejipt bedo calo lim mo me koko in,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:3">Etiopia ki Seba bibedo gin ma kiwili kwede.<verse eid="ISA 43:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 43:4" />Pien in ibedo gin me wel mada bota,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:4">piri dit, dok amari adada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:4">meno aye gin ma omiyo amiyo dano me koko in,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:4">dok amiyo rok pi laro kwoni.<verse eid="ISA 43:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 43:5" />Pe ilwor, an atye kwedi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:5">abikwanyo likwayi woko ki tung kunyango akelogi kany,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:5">dok abicoko joni woko ki tung kupotoceng adwokogi kany bene.<verse eid="ISA 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 43:6" />Abiwaco bot jo matye tung kumalo ni, ‘Dong wuweke,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:6">dok abiwaco bot jo matye tung kupiny ni, ‘Pe dong wumede ki make’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:6">wek awobena kacel ki anyirana gudwog woko dong ki kamabor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:6">wek gua gudwog cen ki i lobo ducu.<verse eid="ISA 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 43:7" />Gin jona, kilwongogi ki nyinga, an aye acweyogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:7">dok acweyogi wek guket deyo ikoma.”<verse eid="ISA 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jo Icrael gubedo Caden pa Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 43:8" />Lubanga owaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:8">“Wukel lwaka i kabedo me ngolo kop.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:8">Wanggi tye, ento pe gineno piny;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:8">itgi tye, ento pe giwinyo lok.<verse eid="ISA 43:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 43:9" />Wek rok ducu gucoke kacel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:9">mii dano ducu gucoke kunu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:9">Anga ikin lubangagi ma twero tito lok ikom gin ma bitime ikare me anyim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:9">anga ikin lubangagi ma onyutu botwa gin mayam dong otime wacon?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:9">Myero gukel caden gi pi tito lok ikomgi wek gulo lok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:9">wek ka dong guwinyo lok, gumok kacel ni loke kakare dok ada.”<verse eid="ISA 43:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 43:10" />Rwot owaco ni, “Wun jo Icrael, wun cadena.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:10">Wun wubedo lutica ma an aye yam ayero,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:10">wek wungeya dok bene wuye an, wuniang atir ni an aye Lubanga kena.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:10">Cake yam con lubanga mo peke ma obedo tye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:10">dok bene pe bibedo tye lubanga mo ma biluba.<verse eid="ISA 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 43:11" />An kena aye a Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:11">pe dok tye ngat mo mukene matwero larowu.<verse eid="ISA 43:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 43:12" />An yam aye atucu pi larowu, ci alarowu, dok atito pire kamaleng bot dano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:12">ikare ma onongo lubanga mo ma welo pud peke ikinwu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:12">wun bene wubedo cadena.<verse eid="ISA 43:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 43:13" />An Lubanga, pud bene abimede me bedo Lubanga nakanaka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:13">pe dok tye ngat mo mukene matwero larogi ki i cinga:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:13">pe tye ngat mo matwero genga tiyo tica.”<verse eid="ISA 43:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A ki i lobo Babilon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 43:14" />Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael ma larowu owaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:14">“Abicwalo mony ikom jo Babilon pi larowu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:14">gin bituru rii me dog cel woko ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:14">woo me yomcwiny pa jo Kaldaya biloke doko kumu.<verse eid="ISA 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 43:15" />An a Rwot Lubangawu Maleng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:15">an aye ma acweyowu wun jo Icrael, dok an aye rwotwu.”<verse eid="ISA 43:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 43:16" />Rwot yam oyabo yoo idye nam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:16">en ma omiyo yoo obedo tye idye pii makato ki i iye tek adada.<verse eid="ISA 43:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 43:17" />En opeyo dul mony matek tutwal okelogi ci onekogi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:17">ki lwak gadigadi kacel ki aguragura.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:17">Gin ducu gupoto piny ma pe dok giromo a malo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:17">odiyogi woko lirwit calo mac tara ma kineko.<verse eid="ISA 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 43:18" />Rwot Lubanga owaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:18">“Wiwu myero dong owil woko ikom gin mayam otime con tutwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:18">pe wubed katamo gin mayam dong otime woko con.<verse eid="ISA 43:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 43:19" />Myero wucik wangwu wunen gin manyen ma atye katimone;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:19">kombedi dong tye katime.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:19">Wun pe wuneno ce?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:19">Abitucu yoo baro ki idye tim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:19">ki kulu bicako bedo tye i tim aroo kunu.<verse eid="ISA 43:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 43:20" />Lee tim ducu gibiwora, too ki udu gibipaka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:20">pien abimiyo pii bedo idye tim ata, ki kulu i tim aroo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:20">pi miyo pii ki jona ma ayero wek gumati.<verse eid="ISA 43:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 43:21" />Gin rok ma an aye acweyogi pira kena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:21">wek guwer wer me paka.”<verse eid="ISA 43:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bal pa jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 43:22" />Rwot owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:22">“Ento wun yam pe wuwora, wun jo Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:22">onongo dong wuol kweda woko ce!<verse eid="ISA 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 43:23" />Onongo dong pe wukelo romiwu me atyera bota me gitum awanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:23">onongo bene pe dong wuwora ki gitumwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:23">An bene pe abedo kayelowu pi gitum,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:23">pe bene abedo ka olo komwu pi odok luban.<verse eid="ISA 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 43:24" />Pe wuwilo lum makur pira ki lim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:24">dok pe wumiya ayeng ki moo dwolo me gitumwu ma wubedo katyerone bota.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:24">Ento wumiya atingo peko me balwu kun wuolo koma ki balwu maracu tutwali.<verse eid="ISA 43:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 43:25" />Kadi bed an kena aye ma ajwayo balwu woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:25">atimo kumeno pi kit ma an atye kwede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:25">pe dong abipo pi balwu.<verse eid="ISA 43:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 43:26" />Wukel adotwu i koma wek walar lok kacel kwedwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:26">wukel lok ma nyutu ni lokwu tye atir wek wulo giwu kop.<verse eid="ISA 43:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 43:27" />Kwarowu mukwongo bene obalo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:27">wa lulocwu bene yam gutimo roc mapol ikoma.<verse eid="ISA 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 43:28" />Pimeno aketo kipwola ikom rwodi ma giloyo kabedo maleng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:28">ajalo jo Icrael me aneka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:28">jo Icrael dong gudoko gin ayeta pa dano.”<verse eid="ISA 43:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="ISA 44" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot aye Lubanga kene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 44:1" />Rwot owaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:1">“Winya ba, in latica Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:1">wun aye jona ma ayero, wun likwayo pa Yakobo.<verse eid="ISA 44:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 44:2" />An a Rwot ma aketi, ma acweyi nia ki ii meni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:2">an aye ma abedo kakonyi ikare ma kwo dong cake ikomi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:2">In Icrael, pe ibed ki lworo, pien in latica,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:2">in Jecurun<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">44:2 </char><char style="fk">Jecurun </char> obedo nying twat pa Icrael. Nying man kitiyo kwede i Nwoyo Cik 32:15; 33:5, 26 keken ki i Baibul. </note> ma an aye ayero.<verse eid="ISA 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 44:3" />Pien abionyo pii i lobo mutwo ma pii peke iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:3">abimiyo ora kulu tonge cako mol i lobo mutwo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:3">abiketo Cwiny ma mera ikom likwayi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:3">dok abimiyo gum bene bot likwayi.<verse eid="ISA 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 44:4" />Gin bibedo maber calo lum ma pii oromo kome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:4">calo yat ma odongo inget kulu ma piine mol.<verse eid="ISA 44:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 44:5" />Dano ducu ki acel acel gibiwaco ni gin jo pa Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:5">ci gibicako bino bot jo Icrael me ribe kwedgi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:5">Jo mukene bicoyo nying Rwot i ngut cinggi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:5">ci gibilwonge ken gi ni gin dano matye ikin jo pa Icrael.”<verse eid="ISA 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 44:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 48:12">Ica 48:12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:17">Niy 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:13">22:13</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot ma en Rwot me Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:6">Rwot me mony ma laro jo Icrael owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:6">“An aye abedo mukwongo ki me agiki;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:6">pe dok tye lubanga mo mukene kono an keken.<verse eid="ISA 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 44:7" />Anga macalo an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:7">matwero tito kikore gin ma bitime ikare me anyim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:7">cake ki i acakine nio kwede wa i agikine?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:7">Wek gutit botwa gin ma bibedo i anyim.<verse eid="ISA 44:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 44:8" />Pe wulwor, komwu bene pe omyel;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:8">yam atito lok man botwu woko con,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:8">kun anyutu jami ducu ma bitime.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:8">Wun aye cadena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:8">dok tye lubanga mo mukene ma pe an?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:8">Tye dok lubanga mo matek tutwal ma an peya awinyo pire?”<verse eid="ISA 44:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Woro cal jogi obedo tim mingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 44:9" />Dano ducu ma tiyo cal jogi gubedo jo ma konygi peke, dok cal jogi ma pirgi tek botgini pe konyo gin mo kadi ki acel. Jo ducu ma giworo cal jogi meno gin lutowang ma pe giniang; gin jo meno kibimiyo lewic makogi matek. <verse eid="ISA 44:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 44:10" />Konyo gin ango me payo cal jok, nyo me liyo nyonyo pi yubu cal jok me awora ma pe twero konyo gin mo? <verse eid="ISA 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 44:11" />Nen, kibimiyo lewic mako jo ducu ma giworo cal jogi macalo meno. Jo ma giyubu cal jogi meno gin dano adana mamwa. Wek gin ducu gucoke kacel, gubin gucung i kabedo me ngolo kop; ci lworo bimakogi, dok alee bene bitwodogi gin ducu.<verse eid="ISA 44:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 44:12" />Latet nyonyo tiyo tice ki mac. Tek matye i bade en aye tingo kwede nyol me lungo nyonyo. Kec neke, orwo pii bene make matek, ci miyo tekone cako dok woko piny.<verse eid="ISA 44:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 44:13" />Lapac bene cako pimo bao, ci cero ka wange woko ki kalam kalu, cwero ki rana, ka dong cako pimone ki gin tice. En yubu cal meno bedo calo dano kikome, ma nongo nen maber bene tutwal calo dano, me aketa i ot me worone. <verse eid="ISA 44:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 44:14" />En twero tongo yadi cedar, nyo twero yero yat mo matye i bunga i tim ci tongo gire. Ikare mukene en kikome pito yat cedar, ka kot ocwer ci miyo dongo. <verse eid="ISA 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 44:15" />Lacen yat meno bikonyo dano macalo yen me awanga i mac, kun dule mukene bedo me tiyo cal jok. Dule tungcel bedo me moko mac me aoya ki me tedo; dul mukene en dong tiyo ki cal jok me aworane. <verse eid="ISA 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 44:16" />Nucu dule en moko ki mac, bulu ki ringo me acamane mamiyo en limo teko. Ka dong tye ka oyo mac ci waco ni, “Mace mit adada! Olyeto koma dong atika!” <verse eid="ISA 44:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 44:17" />Ka dule mudonge ducu en tiyo ki cal joke me aworane; en woro cale meno, kun lego ni; “In aye lubangana, lara do!”<verse eid="ISA 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 44:18" />Jo meno pe gingeyo dok bene pe giniang gin ma gitiyo, pien wanggi oume woko, pe giromo neno piny; tamgi bene obale woko pe gitwero niang i gin matye ada. <verse eid="ISA 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 44:19" />Pe tye ngat mo ikin jo ma tiyo cal jogi ma tamo tam, nyo matye ki ngec, ma weko en twero niang ci waco ni, “Nucu yat an atiyo ki cal jok ki mukene awango woko i mac, lodine atedo ki mugati, abulu ki ringo ci acamo woko; dule mukene ma dong odonge en aye atiyo ki cal joka me awora. Cake ningning ni an ada aye dong atye kany kaworo odul yat aye?”<verse eid="ISA 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 44:20" />Wic ma oding ki tam me mingo ca omiyo en dong orwenyo woko matwal ma pe dong romo neno ni etye kaworo cal apaya ma wang wokoni, en keto gene ikom cal jok apaya ma pe twero laro en wa ki acel.<verse eid="ISA 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot aye lacwec dok lalar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 44:21" />Rwot owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:21">“In Icrael kong ipo ilok magi, myero ipo ni in latica.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:21">An yam acweyi ni ibed latica,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:21">wiya pe biwil ikomi wa ki acel, in Icrael.<verse eid="ISA 44:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 44:22" />Dong ayweyo bali woko ducu calo pol ma yamo otero,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:22">ki tim maracu ducu mayam ibedo ka timogi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:22">dong aketogi woko bene macalo lupuu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:22">Dong idwog cen bota,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:22">pien dong atyeko koki woko.<verse eid="ISA 44:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 44:23" />Wudange ki wer me yomcwiny, wun lwak me polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:23">pien Rwot dong otyeko tiyo lok man!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:23">Wudange ba, wun piny matut!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:23">Wuwoo ki wer, wun godi ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:23">ki yadi ducu matye i bunga i tim!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:23">Pien Rwot dong okoko jone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:23">deyone dong binen ikom Icrael.<verse eid="ISA 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 44:24" />An aye Rwot ma Lalari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:24">an aye ma acweyi ki i meni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:24">An aye a Rwot ma aketo jami ducu, dok aryeyo polo kena;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:24">ikare ma acweyo lobo ngat mo onongo peke ka ngeta ma okonya.<verse eid="ISA 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 44:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 1:20">1 Kor 1:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Amiyo akota pa lukota doko gin ma konye peke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:25">dok amiyo lutyet gidoko jo maming;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:25">acoro jo maryek adwokogi cen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:25">amiyo ryekogi doko mingo.<verse eid="ISA 44:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 44:26" />Amiyo lok ducu ma lutica gitito cobe kakare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:26">gin ma lukwenana giwaco bene amiyo cobe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:26">Awaco bot Jerucalem ni dano dok bibedo i iye doki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:26">ki taun maditi me Juda ni dok kibigerogi odoco;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:26">ka mayam wi obur dok bidoko gang.<verse eid="ISA 44:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 44:27" />Awaco ki kut matut ma i nam ki kulu ducu ni gudwon woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:27">ci pii bene dwon woko.<verse eid="ISA 44:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 44:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 36:23">2 Tek 36:23</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 1:2">Eji 1:2</ref></char>
    </note>Awaco bot Ciro ni en bigwoko jona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:28">ni en bitiyo gin ma amito ni otiine; en bimiyo kigero Jerucalem odoco,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:28">dok bimiyo kiketo teguti ot me wora.”<verse eid="ISA 44:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="ISA 45" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot oyero Ciro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 45:1" />Rwot owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:1">“Ciro dong odoko rwot ma dong atyeko wirone ki moo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:1">amiyo ki en twero, dok aketo en me loyo rok mapol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:1">acwale wek ocit otur teko pa luker woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:1">atye kayabo dogcel me taun madito woko i nyime.<verse eid="ISA 45:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 45:2" />Abitelo nyimi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:2">abiyubu yoo bedo mapwot piri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:2">abituru dogola ma kitiyo ki mola woko liweng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:2">abitongo nyonyo rii me dogcel ducu aturu woko.<verse eid="ISA 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 45:3" />Abimiyo boti lim ma kikano ka macol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:3">ki jami mogo ma kikano i kabedo matye i mung,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:3">wek inge ni an Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:3">an aye ma atyeko yeri dok alwongi ki nyingi.<verse eid="ISA 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 45:4" />Aketi ni wek ikony latica Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:4">ma gin jona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:4">meno aye gin ma omiyo ayero in;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:4">alwongi ki nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:4">amiyi woro madit kadi bed pe ingeya.<verse eid="ISA 45:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 45:5" />An keken aye abedo Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:5">pe dok tye Rwot mo mukene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:5">lubanga mo mukene bene dong peke kono an keken;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:5">abimini teko kadi pe ingeya.<verse eid="ISA 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 45:6" />Man atimo wek dano gunge ni an kena aye a Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:6">cake ki tung kupotoceng nio kwede tung kunyango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:6">pe dok tye lubanga mo mukene kono an keken.<verse eid="ISA 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 45:7" />An aye ma aketo dero ki colpiny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:7">amiyo kuc bedo tye ki can bene bedo tye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:7">an Rwot aye ma atiyo jami magi ducu.<verse eid="ISA 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 45:8" />Abionyo loc o piny i lobo kun a ki i polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:8">abimiyo cwer calo kot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:8">lobo biyabe pi gamo lare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:8">dok bedo ki kit ma atir bene bicake i lobo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:8">an Rwot abimiyo lok man time ada.<verse eid="ISA 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot aye ma ocweyo gigu ducu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 45:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 9:20">Rom 9:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ngat ma pyem ki Lubanga ma ocweye bineno can.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:9">Agulu lobo twero pyem ki ngat ma ocweye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:9">Lobo twero penyo lacwe agulu gin ma en tiyo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:9">Nyo agulu twero waco bot lacwe agulu ni pe kicweya maber?<verse eid="ISA 45:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 45:10" />Latin ma penyo wone ni, ‘In inywalo ango?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:10">Latin meno bineno can;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:10">nyo ma penyo mine ni, ‘Itye ki arem me nywalo gin ango?’”<verse eid="ISA 45:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 45:11" />Rwot, en Ngat Maleng ma ocweyo Icrael, owaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:11">“Wun pe wuromo penya lok ikom lutinona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:11">dok bene pe wutye ki twero mo me tita gin ma myero atii.<verse eid="ISA 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 45:12" />An aye ma acweyo lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:12">ka dong acweyo dano me bedo iye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:12">aryeyo polo obedo tye kit macalo tye kwedeni pi teka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:12">an bene aye ma aciko jami ma i polo ni gubed kit macalo gitye kwedeni.<verse eid="ISA 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 45:13" />An aye ma aketo Ciro i tice me loc,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:13">abimiyo en cobo tic ducu kakare, en bigero odoco tauna maditi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:13">dok bigonyo jona woko ki i opii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:13">pe pi cul nyo kadi pi pwoc mo ma abimiyo bote.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:13">Man lok ma an Rwot me mony aye awaco.<verse eid="ISA 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 45:14" />Rwot owaco ki Icrael ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">“Lonyo ducu me Ejipt ki jami acata ducu me Etiopia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">gin ducu bidoko meri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">ki jo Seba ma gin twoni jo maboco,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">gin ducu gibibino boti ci gidoko opiini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">gibilubu kori ma nongo dong kitweyogi woko ki nyor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">gibiryebe piny inyimi ka wori.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">Gin ducu gibimwole woko inyimi kun giwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">‘In keken giri aye itye ki Lubanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">lubanga mo mukene dong peke kono merini keken.’”<verse eid="ISA 45:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 45:15" />Ada, in aye ibedo Lubanga ma kane woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:15">ai Lubanga pa Icrael, in aye ma ilaro dano.<verse eid="ISA 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 45:16" />Lewic bimako jo ducu ma yubu cal jogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:16">alee bitwodo gin ducu.<verse eid="ISA 45:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 45:17" />Ento jo Icrael Rwot bilarogi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:17">lar ma en larogi kwede birii nakanaka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:17">lewic pe bimakogi wa ki acel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:17">alee mo bene pe bitwodogi liweng.<verse eid="ISA 45:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 45:18" />Pien Rwot aye gire ma ocweyo polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">en bene aye ma obedo Lubanga!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">En ocako tic me cweyo lobo, ci otiyo otyeko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">en omiyo ocung omoko matek kakare.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">En yam pe ocweyo lobo ci oweko woko kun onyobe atata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">en oketo ni dano twero bedo iye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">En Rwot aye ma owaco ni, “An a Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">pe dok tye Rwot mo mukene.<verse eid="ISA 45:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 45:19" />An yam pe aloko lok i mung,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:19">i lobo matye i piny macol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:19">an gira yam pe awaco bot likwayo pa Yakobo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:19">‘Wubiyenya i kabedo ma obedo atata.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:19">An Rwot aloko lok ada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:19">dok anyutu gin matye kakare.”<verse eid="ISA 45:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot me wi lobo ducu ki cal jogi me Babilon</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 45:20" />Rwot owaco ni, “Wucoke kacel, ci wubin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:20">wubin wunyik cok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:20">wun jo me rok mapatpat ma dong wubwot.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:20">Jo ma bedo katingo cal jogi ma kipayo apaya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:20">gin jo ma pe giniang gin mo kadi ki acel;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:20">gibedo kalego cal jok ma pe twero larogini.<verse eid="ISA 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 45:21" />Wubin wunyut lokwu i kabedo me pido;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">wek jo ma pido gupenye ken gi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">Anga ma oweko lok man ongene cake ikare macon?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">Pe an Rwot aye ma ceng atimo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">Pe dok tye lubanga mo mukene kono an keken,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">an aye Lubanga ma kite atir, ma laro dano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">pe dok tye lubanga mukene kadi ki acel.<verse eid="ISA 45:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 45:22" />Wuloke wubin bota, wek alarwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:22">wun jo ma bedo iwi lobo ducu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:22">Pien an Lubanga kena, pe tye lubanga mukene.<verse eid="ISA 45:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 45:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 14:11">Rom 14:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>An dong atyeko kwonge ki nyinga kena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:23">lok ma aloko tye atir;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:23">lok meno pe bipoto piny i ngom ma nongo pe ocobe kun awaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:23">‘Jo ducu gibirumu conggi inyima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:23">dano ducu gibikwongo kwong me lubu loka.<verse eid="ISA 45:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 45:24" />Dano gibiwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:24">Rwot keken aye bimiyo wabedo ki kit ma atir ki tek gire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:24">ci jo ducu mayam cwinygi obedo kawang ikom Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:24">gibibino bote ma nongo lewic makogi mada.<verse eid="ISA 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 45:25" />Likwayo Icrael ducu gibibedo ki loc pi Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:25">ci dong gibipake pi gin ducu ma en otiyo.<verse eid="ISA 45:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="ISA 46" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 46:1" />Jogi pa jo Babilon dong cok gik woko!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:1">Bel ki Nebo mayam kiworogini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:1">kombedi dong gudoko yec ma kiketo inge kana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:1">ma dong gudoko yec mapek tutwal</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:1">mamiyo lee ol adada.<verse eid="ISA 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 46:2" />Gin ducu dong gukule piny, gugungu kacel;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:2">cal jogi pe gitwero lare ken gi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:2">ento dong kimakogi woko kimito terogi i opii.<verse eid="ISA 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 46:3" />Wuwiny loka, wun jo me ot pa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:3">wun jo ma wudong i ot pa jona Icrael.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:3">Abedo kagwokowu cake wa ki i i megiwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:3">atingowu cake ikare ma kinywalowu.<verse eid="ISA 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 46:4" />An Lubangawu ma bigwokowu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:4">abigwokowu nio wang ma wutii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:4">abibedo katingowu kadi wa ikare ma nongo lwar dong otwi i wiwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:4">An aye ma acweyowu dok agwokowu bene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:4">abikonyowu, dok abilarowu.”<verse eid="ISA 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 46:5" />Rwot owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:5">“Wupora ki anga mono?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:5">Tye ngat mo marom kweda?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:5">Wupora do wek wabed calcal.<verse eid="ISA 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 46:6" />Jo ma jobo jabu ajoba ki i kicaa megi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:6">ma gipimo ryal ki mijan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:6">giculu lim bot latet jabu wek oyub botgi cal jok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:6">ka dong giryebe piny inyime ka worone.<verse eid="ISA 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 46:7" />Gitingo giketo iwi gwokgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:7">gicibo i kabedone, ci cung iye matwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:7">kun pe twero a woko kene ki i kabedone meno.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:7">Ka dano mo kok bote pi kony, en pe gamo doge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:7">pe laro dano meno ma okok bote ikare me cane.<verse eid="ISA 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 46:8" />Ber wupo ikom lok man, wun lubalo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:8">kong wutam, wek wulwod loke ki i cwinywu.<verse eid="ISA 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 46:9" />Wupo ikom gin mayam otime wacon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:9">pien an kena aye Lubanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:9">pe dok tye mo mukene ma cal kweda.<verse eid="ISA 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 46:10" />Cake wacon i acaki piny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:10">anyutu kit ma gin man bitime kwede woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:10">ki kit ma bigik kwede bene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:10">Awaco ni gin ducu ma ayubu bicobe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:10">dok abitimo gin mo keken ma ayube me tiyone.<verse eid="ISA 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 46:11" />Abilwongo dano calo acut ki tung kunyango;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:11">dano meno bia ki kamabor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:11">me cobo gin ma dong atyeko yubu con.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:11">An dong aloko, dok abicobone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:11">dong atyeko yubune, dok bene abitimo.<verse eid="ISA 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 46:12" />Wuwiny loka, wun jo ma ludingo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:12">wun jo ma wutamo ni lare bor kwedwu tutwal.<verse eid="ISA 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 46:13" />Nino ma abilarowu iye dong cok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:13">pe dong bor wa ki acel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:13">pe abigale me laro dano, abilaro Cion,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:13">pi Icrael ma anongo deyona pire.”<verse eid="ISA 46:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="ISA 47" />
  <para style="s1">Ngolo kop ikom Babilon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 47:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:1-14:23">Ica 13:1—14:23</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:1">Jer 50:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:64">51:64</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:1">“Lor piny, ibed i apwa in nya Babilon ma pud rini!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">47:1 </char><char style="fk">Rini </char> man nyako ma pud tye olu ma peya obutu ki laco. </note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:1">In taun madit pa jo Kaldaya ma irom ki nyako ma pud rini.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:1">Bin ilor piny ibed i apwa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:1">Bed piny i ngom, pe iwi komker!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:1">Pien pe dok kibidwori ni in iyom tutwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:1">dok pe iromo tiyo gin mo.<verse eid="ISA 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 47:2" />Kwany lanyakidi wek ireg moko kwon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:2">gony kitambara woko ki iwii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:2">luny bongini mabori woko wek tyeni odong nono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:2">ngol ki idye kulu ikat loka tungcel.<verse eid="ISA 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 47:3" />Ibidong munero, ci lewic bimaki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:3">komi me mon ma myero pe onen dong binen kamaleng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:3">An dong abiculu kwor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:3">pe abiweko dano mo bibwot kadi ki acel.”<verse eid="ISA 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 47:4" />Ngat ma kokowa nyinge Rwot me mony,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:4">en Ngat Maleng pa Icrael.<verse eid="ISA 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 47:5" />Wubed ma wuling mot kun wutye i piny macol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:5">in Babilon;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:5">pien pe dong kibilwongi ni in daker maloyo rok mapol.<verse eid="ISA 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 47:6" />Kiniga yam omaka ikom jona, oweko amiyo gubedo calo gin kipyeda;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:6">amiyo gubedo ite loci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:6">ento kica pe omaki ikomgi wa ki acel;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:6">okol ma itweyogi kwede obedo mapek tutwal bot jo muteggi.<verse eid="ISA 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 47:7" />Onongo itamo ni ibibedo kaloyo rok mapol nakanaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:7">omiyo pe giri iketo cwinyi ilok magi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:7">kadi wa po pi kit ma bigik kwede bene pe ipo.<verse eid="ISA 47:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 47:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 18:7-8">Niy 18:7-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pimeno winy lok man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:8">in ma imaro yomcwiny tutwali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:8">in ma ibedo mot labongo ayela mo ni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:8">ibedo katamo ni pe tye ngat mo marom kwedi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:8">dok ni pe ibibedo macalo dato nyo ni kadi ki lutinoni bene pe bito.<verse eid="ISA 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 47:9" />Kit can aryo ma kitmeno bipoto ikomi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:9">inino acel, i dakika mo manoknok keken;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:9">to pa lutino ki doko dato,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:9">gin ducu bipoto iwi lawangacel magwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:9">kadi bed itim lwak tim jokjok mapol ata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:9">kadi bed dong ityet tyet marom mene.<verse eid="ISA 47:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 47:10" />In onongo dong itamo ni itye ki kuc ikom tim maracu ma ibedo katimonegu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:10">kun itamo ni ngat mo peke ma neni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:10">Ryekoni kacel ki ngec ma itye kwede gubedo ka rwenyi arwenya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:10">ibedo katamo ki i cwinyi ni pe tye ngat mo marom kwedi.<verse eid="ISA 47:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 47:11" />Ento gin marac bipoto ikomi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:11">ma in pe itwero timo gin mo me jukune.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:11">Can bipoto ikomi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:11">ma pe ibitwero kwanyone wa ki acel;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:11">topiny bipoto ikomi oyot mada, ma in pe ingeyo iye gin mo.<verse eid="ISA 47:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 47:12" />Cung matek i tyet</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:12">dok imede ki timo tim me jokjok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:12">mayam ibedo katimone cake wa i tinoni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:12">gwok nyo man twero konyi i yo mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:12">nyo bene twero miyo dano gilwori.<verse eid="ISA 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 47:13" />Komi dong oloc woko pi tam mapol tutwal ma kitye kamiyo boti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:13">kong gin dong gubin gulari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:13">gin jo ma ngeyo poko polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:13">ki jo ma ngiyo lakalatwe kun giciko wanggi malo likang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:13">jo ma ka i Por Dwe manyen ducu gitito gin ma bitime i komini.<verse eid="ISA 47:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 47:14" />Nen, gin girom ki cung kal ma mac wangogi woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:14">pe gitwero laro kwogi pirgi ken gi ki i tek me leb mac.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:14">Mac man pe obedo mac me aoya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:14">pe bene mac ma gitwero bedo ingete.<verse eid="ISA 47:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 47:15" />Jo ma ibedo kayele kwedgini tye kitmeno ki tung boti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:15">ma ibedo kabalo kareni botgi cake wa katinoni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:15">Gin ducu gibitenyi woko ata liyak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:15">kun ngat acel acel cito i yone pat;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:15">ngat mo peke ikin gi ma bilari.<verse eid="ISA 47:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="ISA 48" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga aye Rwot me kare mabino anyim</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 48:1" />Kong wuwiny man, wun jo me ot pa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:1">ma kilwongowu ki nying Icrael, wun likwayo pa Juda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:1">wun wukwongo kwong i nying Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:1">kun wutucu bene nying Lubanga pa Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:1">ento pe i ada, dok pe i yo ma atir.<verse eid="ISA 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 48:2" />Kadi bed wulwonge kenwu ni wun jo me taun madit maleng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:2">dok wujenge ikom Lubanga pa Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:2">ma nyinge Rwot me mony.<verse eid="ISA 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 48:3" />Lubanga owaco bot Icrael ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:3">“Yam atito con gin ma bitime i anyim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:3">loke yam okati ki idoga, ci amiyo dano gungeyo woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:3">aruyugi me time oyotoyot, ci bene otiine ocobe kakare.<verse eid="ISA 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 48:4" />Pien onongo angeyo ni wun jo ma wuding,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:4">ma wiwu tek calo nyonyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:4">dok tur nyimwu bene obedo macalo mola.<verse eid="ISA 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 48:5" />Man aye gin ma omiyo yam atitiwu loke con,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:5">atucu lok man botwu con ma peya otime,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:5">wek ka otime pe wuwac ni cal jogiwu aye mutimo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:5">kun wumede ki waco ni cal apayawu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:5">ki cal ma wuliyo aliya ki mac aye ma guwaco ni otime.<verse eid="ISA 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 48:6" />Dong wutyeko winyo lok man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:6">kombedi dong wuneno gin magi ducu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:6">ci pe wubitito pire?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:6">Cake kombedi cito kwede anyim abimiyo wuwinyo jami mogo manyen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:6">gin mukene ma pe wun wungeyo kadi ki acel.<verse eid="ISA 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 48:7" />Pud amiyo gitime atima kombedi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:7">peya gutime wacon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:7">onyo wuwinyo pirgi kadi ki acel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:7">wek pe wuwac ni yam onongo wungeyogi con.<verse eid="ISA 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 48:8" />Peya yam wuwinyo pirgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:8">dok bene peya onongo wungeyogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:8">cake wacon itwu onongo pud oding woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:8">Pien onongo angeyo woko ni wubibedo ki tim aranyi me goba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:8">dok bene cake wa ki i ic, onongo wubedo jo ma lujemo.<verse eid="ISA 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 48:9" />Dong pi nyinga abimiyo kinigana gale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:9">kong abijuku kinigana woko pirwu wek dano gupaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:9">wek pe atyekwu woko.<verse eid="ISA 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 48:10" />Nen, dong atyeko liyowu woko, ento pe macalo ryal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:10">atemowu i mac buk me can magwa adada.<verse eid="ISA 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 48:11" />Man atimo pira kena, atimo pi bera gira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:11">Atwero weko kipyedo nyinga ningning?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:11">Pe atwero miyo deyona wa ki acel bot lubanga mo mukene.”<verse eid="ISA 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ciro aye latela ma Rwot oyero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 48:12" />Rwot owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:12">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 44:6">Ica 44:6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:17">Niy 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:13">22:13</ref></char>
    </note>“Wuwiny loka, wun jo pa Yakobo, wun jo Icrael ma an alwongowu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:12">An Lubanga, an aye abedo mukwongo dok abedo me agiki.<verse eid="ISA 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 48:13" />An aye ma aketo teguti me lobo ki cinga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:13">ayaro polo ki cinga ma lacuc;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:13">ka alwongogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:13">ci gin ducu gicung kamaleng kacel.<verse eid="ISA 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 48:14" />Wugure kacel wun ducu, wek wuwiny loka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:14">Anga ki i kin lubanga mo mayam kong otito pi gin ma bitime anyim ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:14">ngat ma an Rwot amaro en aye abioro me cobo yuba ikom Babilon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:14">en bilwenyo ikom jo Kaldaya.<verse eid="ISA 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 48:15" />An kikoma aye dong aloko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:15">dok bene dong atyeko lwonge woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:15">nyime bibedo leng, dok en bibedo bene maber.<verse eid="ISA 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 48:16" />Wunyik cok bota kany, wek wuwiny:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:16">cake i acaki piny, pe aloko gin mo i mung,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:16">cake ikare ma ocako time, onongo atye kunu.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 48:16" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:16">Kombedi Rwot Lubanga dong oora ci oruka ki Cwiny Maleng.<verse eid="ISA 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yub pa Lubanga pi jone</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 48:17" />Rwot ma en Ngat Maleng me Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:17">ma en aye okokowu ki i opii, owaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:17">“An a Rwot Lubangawu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:17">amito pwonyowu wek wubed maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:17">kun atelowu i yo ma myero wuwot iye.<verse eid="ISA 48:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 48:18" />Kono yam wubedo kawinyo cika, kono ber!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:18">Kono onongo kucwu omol calo kulu ma mol jwi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:18">kono loc obino botwu calo nam ma piine mol labongo yweyoni.<verse eid="ISA 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 48:19" />Likwayowu kono obedo calo kweyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:19">dano ma gua ki i komwu kono dong gidwong calo apwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:19">kono nyinggi pe orwenyo kadi ki acel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:19">kono bene pe kijwerowu woko liweng ki inyima.”<verse eid="ISA 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 48:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 18:4">Niy 18:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Wua woko ki i Babilon, wuring woko ki bot jo Kaldaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:20">wunyut lok man kun wugoyo kijira, dok wutit pire bene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:20">wucwal loke ocit wa i agiki piny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:20">kun wuwaco ni, “Rwot dong okoko latice Icrael woko!”<verse eid="ISA 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 48:21" />Ikare ma en obedo katelogi i tim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:21">orwo pii pe onekogi matek;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:21">en omiyo pii otuc omol pirgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:21">kun a ki ikom pata got,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:21">obaro got ci pii onyete woko kamaleng.<verse eid="ISA 48:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 48:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 57:21">Ica 57:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ento Rwot owaco ni, “Kuc peke pi jo ma gin lutim maracu.”<verse eid="ISA 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="ISA 49" />
  <para style="s1">Icrael aye dero ma menyo lurok</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 49:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 1:5">Jer 1:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Wuwiny loka, wun lobo ma wutye i dog nam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:1">wucik itwu wuwiny, wun rok ma wua ki kamabor.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:1">Rwot olwonga ma onongo pud atye i ic,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:1">ocako nyinga ma onongo pud atye i i maa.<verse eid="ISA 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 49:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 4:12">Ibru 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:16">Niy 1:16</ref></char>
    </note>En omiyo lok ma kati ki idoga tye bit calo lak pala lucwan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:2">okana woko i tipu cinge;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:2">en omiyo adoko calo atero ma gipako lake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:2">okana woko i juru aterone.<verse eid="ISA 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 49:3" />En owaco ni, “In latica,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:3">pi in Icrael, dano biketo deyo ikoma.”<verse eid="ISA 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 49:4" />Ento an awaco ni, “Ayele me tiyo tic nono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:4">atyeko tekona woko ducu nonono, labongo kony mo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:4">ento kadi bed kumeno, gin ma myero pira tye bot Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:4">Lubanga gire bicula pi tic ma atiyo.”<verse eid="ISA 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 49:5" />Ma pud peya kinywala, onongo Rwot dong oyera woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:5">en oketa me bedo latice ma bidwoko jo pa Yakobo cen bote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:5">ki me coko jone jo Icrael mayam guket woko ata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:5">pien Rwot oketo deyo ikoma, Lubangana aye dong omiya teko.<verse eid="ISA 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 49:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:6">Ica 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:32">Luk 2:32</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:47">Tic 13:47</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:23">26:23</ref></char>
    </note> Rwot owaco bota ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:6">“Tic ma alwongi iye pe obedo me roco deyo pa kaka pa Yakobo me dwokone malo kit macon ca keken,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:6">ento an Rwot dong aketi me bedo dero bot lurok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:6">wek imii lare oo wa i agiki piny ducu.”<verse eid="ISA 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 49:7" />Rwot ma en Ngat Maleng me Icrael, ma en aye koko jo Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">en owaco kit man bot ngat ma kicayo matek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">ngat ma rok mapatpat dong okwero woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">matye macalo opii pa luloc ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">“Luker bineni ci gia woko malo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">rwodi bineni ci gibiryebe woko piny.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 49:7" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">Man bitime pien Rwot, ma en lagen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">Ngat Maleng me Icrael dong otyeko yero in.<verse eid="ISA 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Roco Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 49:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 6:2">2 Kor 6:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rwot owaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:8">“Abigamo dogi ikare me timo ber bot dano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:8">abikonyi ikare me laro dano, abigwoki bene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:8">pi in omiyo abiketo gicike ki rok ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:8">abimiyo dong ibedo i lobo pa kwarowu ma kombedi dong odoko oburri.<verse eid="ISA 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 49:9" />Abiwaco bot lumabuc ni, ‘Wukati woko,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:9">ki bot jo matye kama col ni, ‘Wukati woko kamaleng.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:9">Gin bibedo calo romi ma camo lum inget yoo ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:9">ka camgi bibedo iwi cere ducu kama yadi peke iye.<verse eid="ISA 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 49:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 7:16-17">Niy 7:16-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kec pe binekogi, kadi orwo pii bene pe binekogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:10">yamo malyet ki ceng bene pe biwangogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:10">pien ngat ma kica omako ikomgi aye ma bitelogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:10">bitelogi kelogi wa inget wang it ma piine gunye agunya ki i ngom.<verse eid="ISA 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 49:11" />Abiketo yoo wok ki iwi godina ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:11">kibitucu yoo guduna cito malo iwi godi.<verse eid="ISA 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 49:12" />Nen, gibia ki kamabor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:12">kun gia ki tung kumalo ki tung kupotoceng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:12">jo mukene gibia ki i lobo Ciene.”<verse eid="ISA 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 49:13" />Wer wer ki yomcwiny, in polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:13">cwinyi obed yom ba in lobo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:13">wumwoc ki wer, wun godi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:13">Pien Rwot dong okweyo cwiny jone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:13">kica bimake ikom jone ma guneno can tutwali.<verse eid="ISA 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 49:14" />Ento jo Cion guwaco ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:14">“Rwot dong obwotowa woko ata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:14">wiye dong owil woko ikomwa.”<verse eid="ISA 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 49:15" />Ci Rwot ogamo cutcut ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:15">“Wi dako twero wil ikom latine ma en doto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:15">kica pe twero make ikom wode ma en onywalo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:15">Kadi bed dano wiye twero wil, ento an wiya pe biwil i komwu.<verse eid="ISA 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 49:16" />Nen, in Cion dong atyeko coyo nyingi woko idye cinga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:16">cali nen i wanga kare ducu.<verse eid="ISA 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 49:17" />Lugedoni gibibino oyotoyot tutwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:17">jo ma guyaki gibia cito woko.<verse eid="ISA 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 49:18" />Ting wangi malo, nen kabedo ducu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:18">pien joni ducu gibicoke gibino boti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:18">Rwot owaco ni, ‘Akwonge ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:18">gin gibibedo gin me deyo boti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:18">macalo tiko me wel bedo me deyo ingut nyakoger.’<verse eid="ISA 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 49:19" />Adada, wi oburri dong odong nono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:19">loboni dong otyeko bale woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:19">ento kombedi dong bibedo mading mada bot jo ma bibedo kunu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:19">jo mayam guranyowu dong gibibedo kamabor.<verse eid="ISA 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 49:20" />Lutinoni ma kinywalogi i opii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:20">ibiwinyo ka giwaco ni, ‘Kabedo man ding tutwal;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:20">myero dok kimed kabedo botwa.’<verse eid="ISA 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 49:21" />Ibicako penye kekeni ki i cwinyi ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:21">‘Anga ma onywalo jo magi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:21">An yam abedo lalur, dok abedo ki cwercwiny madit,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:21">kikwanya kitera woko cen calo opii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:21">anga kono dok ma opito lutino magi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:21">Kong inen, yam adong kena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:21">ento lutino magi dok gua ki kwene kono?’”<verse eid="ISA 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 49:22" />Rwot Lubanga owaco ki jone kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:22">“Nen, abiryeyo cinga bot lurok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:22">ci abitingo benderana malo bot rok mapol;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:22">gibikelo awobeni kun gikwakogi ikorgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:22">dok bene gibitingo anyirani iwi gwokgi.<verse eid="ISA 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 49:23" />Luker bidoko wegi lutinoni ci gipitogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:23">mon pa luker bibedo macalo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:23">megigi ma bidotogi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:23">Gibiryebe piny inyimi kawori,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:23">ki mwolo madit gibinyutu worogi boti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:23">Meno bimiyo ingeyo ni An a Rwot;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:23">lewic pe bimako jo ma kura.”<verse eid="ISA 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 49:24" />Itamo ni kitwero kwanyo jami ayaka woko ki i cing dano matek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:24">nyo kitwero mayo opii woko ki i cing dano mager?<verse eid="ISA 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 49:25" />Ento Rwot owaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:25">“Opii ma dano matek omakogi, kibimayogi woko ki bote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:25">jami ayaka matye i cing ngat mager bene kibikwanyo woko ki bote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:25">pien abipyem ki jo ma pyem kwedwu, ci abilaro lutinoni woko.<verse eid="ISA 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 49:26" />Abimiyo jo ma unuwu bineke keken gi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:26">dok gibimer ki nek macalo dano gimer ki kongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:26">calo gumato kongo bwino.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:26">Meno bimiyo dano ducu ngeyo ni, An a Rwot ma Lalarwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:26">Ngat Matek pa Yakobo ma kokowu.”<verse eid="ISA 49:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="ISA 50" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 50:1" />Rwot owaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:1">“Waraga me keto nyom mayam aryemo ki minwu tye kwene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:1">ma ceng amiye ikare ma onongo aryemeni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:1">Yam acatowu bot anga ikin jo mayam onongo acamo banyagi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:1">Nenu, yam kicatowu pi balwu, dok pi turu cik,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:1">en aye ma oweko kiryemo minwu woko.<verse eid="ISA 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 50:2" />Pingo kono yam pe anongo dano mo ikare ma abino kalarowu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">Dok ikare ma alwongo lwongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">pingo ngat mo kono pe ogamo doga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">Wutamo ni cinga cek, pe twero kokowu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">Tekona peke me larowu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">Atwero ciko nam ci two woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">dok atwero loko kulu ducu doko tim aroo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">miyo rec ma i igi bidoko coo pi can pii, ci gito woko.<verse eid="ISA 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 50:3" />Atwero bene loko polo doko macol licuc,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:3">macalo bongo cola ma kiruku ikare me kumu.”<verse eid="ISA 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Latic pa Lubanga ma lawiny</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 50:4" />Rwot Lubanga dong opwonya ilok ma myero aloki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:4">wek ange lok mamiyo teko bot dano ma ool.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:4">En coya woko ki iwang nino kare ducu i odiko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:4">en coya wek awiny gin ma en pwonya kwede.<verse eid="ISA 50:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 50:5" />Rwot Lubanga dong otyeko yabo ita woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:5">pe ajemo, pe bene aloke ngeya.<verse eid="ISA 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 50:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:67">Mat 26:67</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mar 14:65</ref></char>
    </note>Aloko ngeya bot jo ma goya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:6">dok bene aloko lema bot jo ma telo yer tika;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:6">pe akano wanga woko ki lewic ki i laa ma kingulu iye.<verse eid="ISA 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 50:7" />Ento Rwot Lubanga konya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:7">ma omiyo alee mo peke ma otwoda;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:7">meno omiyo wanga obedo matek calo got,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:7">dok onongo angeyo bene ni pe kibiketo lewic iwiya;<verse eid="ISA 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 50:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 8:33-34">Rom 8:33-34</ref>
      </char>
    </note>pien ngat ma bimiyo aloyo kop tye cok kweda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:8">Tye ngat mo ma mito pido kweda?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:8">Wek wacung kacel kwede i otkot.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:8">Anga ce ma lakworani?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:8">Wek obin cok ingeta kany.<verse eid="ISA 50:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 50:9" />Nen, Rwot Lubanga konya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:9">anga ma bingolo kop loya ni an labal?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:9">Nen, gin ducu gibiti woko calo bongo, nyenye bicamogi woko.<verse eid="ISA 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 50:10" />Anga ikinwu ma lworo Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:10">ma winyo lok ma latice waco?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:10">Anga ma woto i piny macol</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:10">ma pe neno yoo ma en tye kawot iyeni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:10">ento geno gire Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:10">kun jenge ikom Lubangane?<verse eid="ISA 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 50:11" />Nen, wun jo ducu ma wumoko mac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:11">wun jo ma moko mac ikom yen!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:11">Wuwot i dero mac ma dong wumokoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:11">kun nongo mac ma wumoko i lak yen ca lyel menyo yoo botwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:11">Gin ma wubinongo ki bota en ene:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:11">wubibutu piny ma nongo wutye ki arem madit tutwal.<verse eid="ISA 50:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="ISA 51" />
  <para style="s1">Lok me kweyo cwiny jo Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 51:1" />Rwot owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:1">“Wuwiny loka, wun jo ma wumito lare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:1">wun jo ma yenyo Rwot;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:1">kong wunen got mayam kipayowu ki iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:1">ki bur madit adada me gweng matek ma kikwinyowu ki iye.<verse eid="ISA 51:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 51:2" />Kong wutam pi kwarowu Abraim, ki Cara ma obedo dawu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:2">Ikare ma alwongo Abraim onongo pe tye ki latin mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:2">ento lacen amiye gum, ci onywalo lutino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:2">dok anyayo likwaye odoko mapol tutwal.<verse eid="ISA 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 51:3" />Pien Rwot bikweyo cwiny Cion;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:3">bikweyo cwiny jo ma gitye i kabedone ducu ma kibalo woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:3">tim ma iye bibedo calo Eden,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:3">ki tim aroo mutwo bibedo calo poto pa Rwot;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:3">yomcwiny madwong bibedo tye kunu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:3">kun dano giwero wer me pwoc ki me pak.<verse eid="ISA 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 51:4" />Wuwiny loka, wun jona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:4">wuter itwu wuwiny loka, wun roka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:4">pien abimiyowu cik,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:4">ki ngolo kop atir ma bibedo macalo dero bot lurok.<verse eid="ISA 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 51:5" />Kare me loca dong onyiko cok tutwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:5">lare ma abikelo tye kabino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:5">an ki koma aye abiloyo rok ducu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:5">lobo ducu matye i dog nam gitye ka kura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:5">gitye ki gen ni abilarogi.<verse eid="ISA 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 51:6" />Wuting wangwu malo i polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:6">dok wukul wangwu piny wunen lobo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:6">pien polo ma wunenoni biket woko macalo yito,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:6">ento lobo biti woko calo bongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:6">ka dong jo ma bedo iye gito woko calo ober;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:6">ento lare ma abikelo birii nakanaka, loca pe bigik wa ki acel.<verse eid="ISA 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 51:7" />Wuwiny loka, wun jo ma wungeyo kit ma atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:7">wun jo ma dong wumako cika i cwinywu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:7">pimeno pe wubed ki lworo kadi dano cayowu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:7">cwinywu bene pe myero obale kace kiyetowu.<verse eid="ISA 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 51:8" />Pien gibirwenyo woko macalo bongo ma nyenye ocamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:8">macalo yer romo ma kwidi ocamogi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:8">ento loca pe bigik wa ki acel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:8">larena bibedo pi yalwak me kare ducu.”<verse eid="ISA 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 51:9" />Coo woko, coo woko ki iwang nino, wek iruk teko, in cing Rwot;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:9">coo woko macalo ikare ma okato, ki yalwak me kare macon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:9">Pe in aye yam ingolo Rakab ingido woko matinotino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:9">ci icobo min kulu ineko woko?<verse eid="ISA 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 51:10" />Pe in aye mayam imiyo pii ma i nam otwo woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:10">pii madit ma onongo yam tut tutwali</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:10">pe in aye imiyo yoo obaro dye nam matut ca,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:10">wek jo ma kikokogi gukat ki iye wa loka nam tungcel?<verse eid="ISA 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 51:11" />Jo ma Rwot okokogi bidwogo cen i Cion,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:11">gibibino kun giwero wer.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:11">Yomcwiny ma rii nakanaka pe birwenyo ki i wigi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:11">gibibedo ki yomcwiny madwong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:11">cwercwiny ki cur bia woko ki botgi.<verse eid="ISA 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 51:12" />Rwot owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:12">“An aye abedo ngat ma kweyo cwinywu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:12">Pingo wulworo dano mamwa ma to wokoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:12">dano adana marom aroma ki lumii?<verse eid="ISA 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 51:13" />Pingo wiwu owil woko ikom Rwot ma ocweyowu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:13">ma oryeyo polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:13">dok bene ma ocibo teguti me lobo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:13">Pingo kono wubedo ki lworo nakanaka nino ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:13">pi akemo malyet pa jo ma giunu dano wadigi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:13">kace gucako ticgi me neko dano?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:13">Akemo malyet pa ngat ma unu danoni kono tye kwene?<verse eid="ISA 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 51:14" />Jo ducu ma onongo kitweyogi macalo mabuc kibigonyogi woko oyotoyot;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:14">gin pe gibito gidonyo piny i bur lyel, cam bene pe biremogi.<verse eid="ISA 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 51:15" />Pien an a Rwot Lubangawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:15">ma tugu pii ki i nam, miyo twage kun mor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:15">nyinga Rwot me mony.<verse eid="ISA 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 51:16" />Dong atyeko keto loka i dogi, akano wangi woko bene dong i tipu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:16">an aye ayaro polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:16">ki aketo teguti me lobo, dok awaco bot jo Cion ni, ‘Wun wujona.’”<verse eid="ISA 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 51:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 14:10">Niy 14:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:19">16:19</ref></char>
    </note> Jerucalem, coo woko ki iwang nino, coo woko, ci i a malo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:17">In ma dong imato kikopo me akemo ma Rwot aye omiyo boti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:17">ikare ma imato ducu, ci icako tage.<verse eid="ISA 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 51:18" />Pe tye ngat mo matwero peyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:18">ikin lutinoni ducu ma in inywaloni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:18">pe tye ngat mo matwero mako cingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:18">ikin lutino ducu ma in ipitogi.<verse eid="ISA 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 51:19" />Can magi aryoni ducu opoto ikomi lawang acel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:19">anga ma binywako kumu pi can magi kacel kwedi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:19">Kiyako loboni kibalo woko liweng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:19">kec ki neko dano opoto iye magwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:19">man anga ma bikweyo cwinyi?<verse eid="ISA 51:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 51:20" />Awobeni guwile woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:20">gubutu piny liraba kama yoo ogik iye ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:20">calo til ma omoko ki obwo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:20">akemo pa Rwot dong oketo komgi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:20">ki juk ma Lubangani obedo ka jukugi kwede.<verse eid="ISA 51:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 51:21" />Pimeno, wun jona ma kiunuwu dong wuwiny lok man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:21">wun jo ma wumer, ento pe wumer ki kongo bwino.<verse eid="ISA 51:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 51:22" />Rwot Lubangawu ma pido lok pa jone owaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:22">“Nenu, dong atyeko kwanyo kikopo woko ki i cingwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:22">en kikopo mamiyo wumer wutageni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:22">agulu me akemona pe dok wubimede ki matone.<verse eid="ISA 51:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 51:23" />Dong abimiyone bot jo ma unuwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:23">mayam guwaco botwu ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:23">‘Wuryebe piny aryeba ic</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:23">wek wawot ki i komwu.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:23">Ma omiyo wuloko ngewu odoko ngom me anyonagi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:23">dok ngewu onongo dong tye macalo yoo ma kilubu.”<verse eid="ISA 51:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="ISA 52" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga bilaro Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 52:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">52:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 21:2">Niy 21:2</ref> </char>
    </note>Coo woko, coo woko ki iwang nino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:1">ruk tekoni, in Cion;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:1">ruk bongini mabecone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:1">in Jerucalem, taun madit maleng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:1">pien dano mo ma pe kiliro, ki jo ma komgi ki keni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:1">pe dok gibidonyo boti.<verse eid="ISA 52:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 52:2" />Teng apwa woko ki ikomi wek ia malo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:2">in Jerucalem mayam ibedo opii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:2">Wugony tol woko dong ki ingutwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:2">wun jo Cion mayam wubedo opii.<verse eid="ISA 52:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 52:3" />Pien Rwot owaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:3">“Pe yam kiculu lim mo me wilowu ikare ma wudoko opii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:3">dok bene pe kibiculu lim mo me kokowu ki i opii.<verse eid="ISA 52:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 52:4" />Yam wuwoto wucito i lobo Ejipt macalo lubedo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:4">lacen jo Aciria guunuwu labongo bal mo.<verse eid="ISA 52:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 52:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">52:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 2:24">Rom 2:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kong wunen kombedi dok kitero jona woko i Babilon nonono;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:5">jo ma gitye kaloyogi gitye kawake kun giyeto nyinga dyeceng jwi.<verse eid="ISA 52:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 52:6" />Pimeno jona dong gibingeyo nyinga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:6">gibingeyo ni an Lubanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:6">gibingeyo ni an aye ma aloko kwedgi.”<verse eid="ISA 52:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 52:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">52:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NAM 1:15">Nak 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:15">Rom 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:15">Epe 6:15</ref></char>
    </note>Neno tyene ber mada iwi godi, ngat makelo lok maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:7">ma tito pi kuc,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:7">makelo lok maber me gin maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:7">ngat ma tito lok me lare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:7">ma waco bot Cion ni, “Lubangani tye kaloc.”<verse eid="ISA 52:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 52:8" />Kong wuwiny, lukur taun madit gitye kawer ki dwon malongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:8">giwero wer me yomcwiny kacel;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:8">pien gitye kaneno Rwot ki wanggi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:8">kun tye kadwogo cen i Cion.<verse eid="ISA 52:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 52:9" />Wumwoc ki wer lawangacel, wun ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:9">wun wi obur Jerucalem;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:9">pien Rwot dong okweyo cwiny jone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:9">dong okoko Jerucalem woko.<verse eid="ISA 52:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 52:10" />Rwot dong onyutu tekone maleng kamaleng inyim rok ducu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:10">dano ducu ma iwi lobo gibineno,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:10">kit ma Rwot Lubangawa larowa kwede.<verse eid="ISA 52:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 52:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">52:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 6:17">2 Kor 6:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Wua, wua woko, wua woko ki kunu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:11">pe wugud gin mo ma kome ki keni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:11">wua woko ki kunu, wek wucit wulonye kekenwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:11">wun jo ma wutingo jami pa Rwot.<verse eid="ISA 52:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 52:12" />Pe wubia oyotoyot ma komwu myel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:12">pe bene wubiringo aringa, pien Rwot bitelo nyimwu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:12">dok Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael bibedo i ngewu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:12">kun gwokowu cawa ducu.<verse eid="ISA 52:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Can pa latic pa Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 52:13" />Rwot owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:13">“Nen, tic pa latica biwot maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:13">kibiwore ci kitinge malo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:13">en bibedo dano mamalo tutwal.<verse eid="ISA 52:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 52:14" />Jo mapol ma gunene gubedo ki ur matek;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:14">wange onongo nen pat mada ki wang dano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:14">wa kome bene onongo pe rom ki kom dano.<verse eid="ISA 52:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 52:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">52:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 15:21">Rom 15:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>En bipoyo kom rok mapol kitmeno,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:15">luker ducu doggi bitwo woko pire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:15">pien gibineno gin mayam pe kititigi pire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:15">dok gibiniang i gin mayam peya guwinyo pire.”<verse eid="ISA 52:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 52" />
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="ISA 53" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 53:1" />Dano gugamo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:1">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">53:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 12:38">Jon 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:16">Rom 10:16</ref></char>
    </note> “Anga mono ma onongo romo ye lok ma kombedi wan watitoni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:1">Dok anga ma oneno teko pa Rwot ilok man?<verse eid="ISA 53:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 53:2" />Pien onongo obedo miti pa Rwot pi latice me dongo inyime calo ginapita ma pud tye ka dongo adonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:2">ma pud lwite donyo adonya i ngom mutwo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:2">En pe tye ki kom mo maber nyo deyo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:2">ma kono omii wacik wangwa ikome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:2">gin mo ma ywayo tam pa dano onongo peke bote kadi ki acel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:2">dok gin mo matwero miyo wabedo ki tam ikome bene peke.<verse eid="ISA 53:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 53:3" />Wan wacaye dok wakwere woko bene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:3">en obedo ki cwercwiny madwong ki arem madit ma okato kare.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:3">En tye ngat ma dano giumu wanggi woko ikome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:3">wan wacaye, ma pe waparo pire wa ki acel.<verse eid="ISA 53:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 53:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">53:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 8:17">Mat 8:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Adada, en ociro can pirwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:4">otingo aremwa woko ducu ikome;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:4">kigoye dok kitime marac atika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:4">ma omiyo wabedo katamo ni Lubanga aye ma oketo can man ikome.<verse eid="ISA 53:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 53:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">53:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 2:24">1 Pet 2:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yam kicobe pi balwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:5">kiketo ret ikome pi timwa marac;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:5">can ma kiketo ikomeni okelo kuc botwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:5">pi goco ma kigoye kwede omiyo wacang.<verse eid="ISA 53:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 53:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">53:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 2:25">1 Pet 2:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Wan ducu onongo yam wangak warwenyo woko calo romi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:6">ngat acel acel onongo okwanyo yone kene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:6">ento Rwot dong otingo can me balwa ducu oketo ikome.<verse eid="ISA 53:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 53:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">53:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 5:6">Niy 5:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">53:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:32-33">Tic 8:32-33</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yam kiune, kiketo can ikome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:7">ento en pe ongamo doge me loko lok mo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:7">calo latin romo ma kitero ka nekone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:7">dok calo romo ma oling inyim lunyar yere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:7">kitmeno en pe ongamo doge me loko gin mo.<verse eid="ISA 53:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 53:8" />Kiune, kingolo kop ikome, ka kikwanye woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:8">anga kono ma oparo pi gin ma otime ikome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:8">ni kikwanye woko ki i lobo pa jo makwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:8">kigoye pi bal pa jo me rokwa?<verse eid="ISA 53:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 53:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">53:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 2:22">1 Pet 2:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kiyike kacel ki lutim maracu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:9">dok ki yiko kacel ki lulonyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:9">kadi bed onongo en pe otimo bwami mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:9">dok pe oloko lok goba ki doge.”<verse eid="ISA 53:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 53:10" />Rwot owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:10">“An aye yam amito ni en oden can;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:10">wek tone obed me koko dano ki i balgi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:10">Ci en bineno likwaye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:10">dok en bikwo nakanaka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:10">Ci mitina bicobe kun wok ki bote.<verse eid="ISA 53:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 53:11" />Inge neno can matek, en bibedo ki yomcwiny adada;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:11">ci en bingeyo atir ni pe edeno can nono, ci weko cwinye bikwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:11">Latica ma kite atir, bimiyo kikwano jo mapol ni kitgi atir;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:11">en bitingo balgi ducu ikome.<verse eid="ISA 53:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 53:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">53:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 15:28">Mar 15:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:37">Luk 22:37</ref></char>
    </note>Meno bimiyo amiyo bote kabedo me woro ikin jo madito,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:12">en bene binywako jami ma kiyako i lweny kacel ki jo matego.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:12">Pien en dong omine kene me to woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:12">ma omiyo kikwane kacel ki lubalo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:12">ento en otingo bal pa dano mapol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:12">dok obako doge olego pi lubalo adada.”<verse eid="ISA 53:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 53" />
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="ISA 54" />
  <para style="s1">Mar pa Lubanga ikom jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 54:1" />Rwot owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:1">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">54:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 4:27">Gal 4:27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Wer wer ki dwon malongo, in dako ma lalur,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:1">mayam pe inywalo latin mo, mwoc ki wer kun idange matek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:1">in dako ma pud peya yam arem ogoyi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:1">Pien lutino pa dako ma kiweko odong kene bibedo pol</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:1">makato lutino pa dako ma kinyomo ma bedo kacel ki cware.<verse eid="ISA 54:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 54:2" />Med kabedo me kemani obed malac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:2">wek kiyar bongi angaba me kicikani woko i kabedoni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:2">pe ibed ladur, med toli obed maboco,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:2">dok bene gur teke me kemani ocung matek liking.<verse eid="ISA 54:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 54:3" />Pien wang loboni bimede malac tungi ki tungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:3">likwayu bileyo kabedo pa lurok dok gibinya gipongo taun madito ducu mayam gudong oburri.<verse eid="ISA 54:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 54:4" />Pe ilwor, pien lewic pe bimaki;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:4">pe iwek alee otwodi, pien pe kibiketo lewic ikomi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:4">Wii biwil woko ikom lewic mayam onongo ibedo kwede ikare me tinoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:4">pe dok ibipo ikom cac ma kibedo kacayi kwede pi bedo keni macalo dato.<verse eid="ISA 54:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 54:5" />Pien ngat ma ocweyi aye obedo cwari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:5">nyinge Rwot me mony;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:5">ngat ma okoki ki i can en aye Ngat Maleng me Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:5">kilwonge ni Lubanga me wi lobo ducu.<verse eid="ISA 54:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 54:6" />Pien Rwot dong otyeko lwongi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:6">calo dako ma gibwoto odong kene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:6">kun tye ki cwercwiny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:6">calo dako ma kinyomo ma onongo en pud nyako ka kiryemo woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:6">man Lubangani ma owaco.<verse eid="ISA 54:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 54:7" />Yam onongo aweki keni pi kare mo manok keken,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:7">ento abidwoki woko bota ki kica madwong.<verse eid="ISA 54:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 54:8" />Yam akano wanga woko ki boti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:8">pi kare manok ma onongo akemona dwong tutwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:8">ento abitimo kica boti ki mar ma pe gik.<verse eid="ISA 54:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 54:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">54:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 9:8-17">Aca 9:8-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pien man ki tung bota rom aroma ki kare pa Nua,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:9">ma akwonge ni pii pe dok bipong iwi lobo ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:9">kitmeno bene dong akwongo ni kiniga pe dong bimaka ikomi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:9">dok bene pe abijuki onyo abipwodi.<verse eid="ISA 54:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 54:10" />Kadi bed godi gitwero a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:10">onyo kadi bed cere bene gitwero kobo woko kamukene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:10">ento mara ma pe loke pe bia ki ikomi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:10">dok cikena me kuc pe kibidiro woko cen.”<verse eid="ISA 54:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jerucalem manyen</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 54:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">54:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 21:18-21">Niy 21:18-21</ref>
      </char>
    </note> In taun madit ma ineno can, mayamo okodo ikomi ki tek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:11">ma pe kikweyo cwinyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:11">nen, abimwono got meri ki libi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:11">dok abiketo te gutini ki capir.<verse eid="ISA 54:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 54:12" />Abitiyo wi labila odini ki tiko makwar me wel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:12">dog celi abitiyo ki got makwar ma mil amila,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:12">ki kor celi dong abideyo ki lutino kidi me wel.<verse eid="ISA 54:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 54:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">54:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:45">Jon 6:45</ref>
      </char>
    </note> An kikoma aye abipwonyo lutinoni ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:13">dok abimiyo lutinoni gibibedo maber tutwal ki kuc.<verse eid="ISA 54:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 54:14" />Kit ma atir bimiyo ibibedo kun icung matek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:14">pe kibiuni kadi ki acel, lworo mo pe bimaki;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:14">dok jo ma giuni pe gibinyiko cok ka ngeti.<verse eid="ISA 54:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 54:15" />Kace dano biero daa ikomi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:15">meno nongo pe oa ki bota;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:15">ngat ma ero daa ikomi bipoto gire pire kene.<verse eid="ISA 54:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 54:16" />“Nen, an ma aketo latet, ma buku lodi mac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:16">ci teto jami lweny pi tice;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:16">dok bene aketo ngat ma labal lobo wek ojwer jami woko ducu.<verse eid="ISA 54:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 54:17" />Pe tye jami lweny mo ma kiteto pi lweny ikomi ma bicobo tice,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:17">ibiloyo lok me adot ducu ma kikelo ikomi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:17">Man aye gum ma lutic pa Rwot ginongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:17">ki loyo kopgi a ki bota.”<verse eid="ISA 54:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 54" />
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="ISA 55" />
  <para style="s1">Mot me nono me kica pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 55:1" />Rwot owaco ni, <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">55:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:6">Niy 21:6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:17">22:17</ref></char></note>“Wubin wutwom pii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:1">wun jo ducu ma orwo nekowu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:1">ngat ma lime mo peke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:1">myero bene obin owil cam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:1">Wubin wuwil kongo bwino ki cak labongo lim, labongo wel mo.<verse eid="ISA 55:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 55:2" />Pingo wubalo limwu ikom gin ma pe kwon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:2">pingo kono wutyeko tekowu woko ka nongo gin ma pe yengowu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:2">Wucik itwu atika iloka, ci wucam cam maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:2">dok wubed ki yomcwiny pi cam mabeco ma amiyowu.<verse eid="ISA 55:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 55:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">55:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 13:34">Tic 13:34</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Wucik itwu wuwiny loka, ci wubin bota;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:3">wuwiny loka, wek wubed kwo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:3">ci abicike kwedwu i gicike ma rii nakanaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:3">abimiyowu mar mera ma pe loke, ma gene, mayam aciko bot Daudi.<verse eid="ISA 55:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 55:4" />Nen, yam aketo en obedo caden bot lurok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:4">latel ki lamii cik bot lurok.<verse eid="ISA 55:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 55:5" />Nen, wun wubilwongo rok mapatpat ma pe wungeyogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:5">ki rok mapol mapatpat mayam pe gingeyowu gibiringo gibino botwu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:5">An Rwot Lubangawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:5">Ngat Maleng me Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:5">abiweko magi ducu time</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:5">abiketo deyo i komwu.<verse eid="ISA 55:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 55:6" />Wuyeny Rwot ikare ma en pud twero nonge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:6">wukok bot Rwot ma pud en tye cok.<verse eid="ISA 55:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 55:7" />Latim marac myero obwot time maraci woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:7">ki dano ma pe kite atir bene owek tame ma pe beri woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:7">oloke odwog cen bot Rwot, wek Rwot otime kica,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:7">myero odwog cen bot Lubangawa, pien en biweko bale woko ducu.”<verse eid="ISA 55:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 55:8" />Rwot waco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:8">“Pien tama pe obedo tamwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:8">ki yowu bene pe obedo yona.<verse eid="ISA 55:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 55:9" />Kit macalo polo tye malo kamabor makato loboni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:9">yona bene tye malo kitmeno makato yowu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:9">ki tama bene tye malo kato tamwu woko.<verse eid="ISA 55:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 55:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">55:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 9:10">2 Kor 9:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kit macalo kot ki pee core bino piny kun gia ki i polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:10">ma pe dok gidok malo kunu, ento gikweyo lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:10">miyo ginapita twi ci dongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:10">miyo kodi bot lacokodi ki miyo kwon bene bot dano me acama,<verse eid="ISA 55:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 55:11" />lok ma a ki idoga bene bibedo kitmeno;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:11">pe bidwogo bota nono ma nongo pe otiyo gin mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:11">loka bitiyo gin ma amito ni otii, dok bicobo gin ma acwale pire.<verse eid="ISA 55:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 55:12" />Pien wubikato woko wuweko Babilon kun wucito ki yomcwiny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:12">kibiterowu ki kuc;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:12">godi ducu ki cere ducu ma inyimwu gibimwoc ki wer licur,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:12">ki yadi ducu me tim biyenge ki yomcwiny.<verse eid="ISA 55:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 55:13" />Yat ciprec bitwii maka okutu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:13">ki yadi ma ngwecgi kur bitwii maka ocok.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:13">Meno bibedo gin me nipo ma bedo nakanaka, ma pe birwenyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:13">me nyutu ni an Rwot aye ma ceng atiyo man.”<verse eid="ISA 55:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 55" />
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="ISA 56" />
  <para style="s1">Jo pa Lubanga bikwako Rok ducu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 56:1" />Rwot owaco bot jone kuman ni, “Myero wutim gin matye atir dok ma opore, pien dong acok larowu, lar ma alarowu kwede binen kamaleng. <verse eid="ISA 56:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 56:2" />Abimiyo gum madwong ikom ngat ma timo kit man, ngat ma omako gin meno matek liking, ma gwoko ceng Cabit kun pe pyedo, dok gwoko cinge pe timo gin marac.”<verse eid="ISA 56:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 56:3" />Larok mo ma obino oribe ki Rwot pe myero owac ni, “Rwot bikoya woko matwal ki ikom jone weko abedo kakena.” Dok dano ma kikolo bene pe myero owac ni, “Nen, dong atye macalo yat ma otal.” <verse eid="ISA 56:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 56:4" />Pien Rwot dong owaco kuman ni, “Jo ma kikologi ma gigwoko ceng Cabita, dok giyero tiyo gin ma yomo cwinya, ma gumako gicikena liking, <verse eid="ISA 56:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 56:5" />abimiyo botgi gin mo me po nyinggi ma bibedo i Ot pa Lubanga kama kiwora iye idye ganga, maber makato bedo ki lutino awobe nyo lutino anyira; abimiyo botgi nying ma bedo matwal, ma pe birwenyo kadi ki acel.”<verse eid="ISA 56:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 56:6" />Dong Rwot waco bot lurok ma guribe ki en, me tic bote, kun gimaro nyinge, dok ma gumine me bedo lutice, ki dano ducu ma gwoko ceng Cabit, kun pe pyedo, ma omako gicikena woko liking ni, <verse eid="ISA 56:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 56:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">56:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:13">Mat 21:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:17">Mar 11:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:46">Luk 19:46</ref></char></note>“Abikelowu i Cion i got mera maleng, dok abiyomo cwinywu i ot me lega kama kiwora iye. Abigamo gitum awangawu ki gityer ma kityero bota, magi ducu abigamo iwi keno tyera; pien oda kibilwongo ni, ‘Ot me lega pa jo me rok ducu.’”<verse eid="ISA 56:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 56:8" />Rwot Lubanga ma ocoko jo Icrael ma onongo kiryemogi woko owaco kuman ni, “Dok abicoko jo mukene agurugi bota, amedo ikom jo ma dong atyeko cokogini.”<verse eid="ISA 56:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kop oloyo lutel pa jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 56:9" />Rwot owaco bot rok me lobo ducu me bino calo lee tim kamwodo jone. <verse eid="ISA 56:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 56:10" />En owaco ni, “Lukurpiny pa jo Icrael ducu wanggi oto, gin ducu gipe ki ngec kadi ki acel, gin ducu gicalo gwogi ma te lebgi oto, pe dok gitwero gweyo; gibutu piny gibedo ka lek aleka, gimaro nino matut keken. <verse eid="ISA 56:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 56:11" />Gin gwogi ma giwor tutwal ma cam pe romogi. Gin lukwat ma pe giniang gin mo; ngat acel acel ikin gi kwanyo mere yone kene, ngat acel acel bene yenyo magobane kit ma cwinye mito. <verse eid="ISA 56:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 56:12" />Gilwonge keken gi ni, ‘Wubin wacitu ka kelo kongo bwino, wubin wamatu kongo makec wek wamer woko, diki dok binonge, madit makato matin.’”<verse eid="ISA 56:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 56" />
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="ISA 57" />
  <para style="s">Kikwero woro cal jogi apaya pa jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 57:1" />Dano ma kite atir to, ngat mo peke ma keto iye cwinye. Jo ma maro Lubanga kikwanyogi woko; ngat mo peke ma paro pirgi. Pien dano ma kite atir nongo kikwanyo woko ki i can, <verse eid="ISA 57:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 57:2" />en cako donyo i kuc; jo ma bedo kun cwinygi atir giywe mot i kabutugi. <verse eid="ISA 57:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 57:3" />Ento wun wubin wunyik cok bota kany, wun lutal, wun lutim abor, ki wun malaya. <verse eid="ISA 57:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 57:4" />Meno wutye kanywaro anga ce? Wungamo dogwu malac kumeno ikom anga ma lebwu okati woko kumenoni? Wun lutim bal, ki wun lugoba. <verse eid="ISA 57:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 57:5" />Wun aye jo ma woro jogi me nywal ite yat kworo, ite yadi ducu ma potgi oluk liyuk; dok wutyero lutinowu macalo gitum, i boro got? <verse eid="ISA 57:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 57:6" />Wun wucoko got mapwot matye i lung piny ci wuworo gi macalo lubanga, gin jami meno ducu mewu; pien dong wutyeko tyero gityer amata woko botgi, wukelo bene gityerwu me moko kwon, ci wutyero. Cwinya bibedo yom pi kodi tim macalo meno? <verse eid="ISA 57:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 57:7" />Dong wuketo kabutuwu iwi got ma wiye bor, wun dong wutyeko cito kunu ka tyero gitumwu bot jok. <verse eid="ISA 57:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 57:8" />Wuketo bene cal jok inge kika ki inge yat me dogola. Pi weka woko, omiyo wulunyo bongiwu iwi kabutuwu, ci wulwongogi botwu, kun wucike kwedgi pi culugi, dok bene wumaro butu kwedgi pi cobo miti wu, kun wuneno tim munero me lewic. <verse eid="ISA 57:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 57:9" />Wucito bot jok Molek ki moo, wumedo moowu ma ngwece kur onya odoko mabup; wuoro lukwenawu gucito kamabor, wucwalogi bene gucito wa piny i lyel pi yenyo lubanga mukene me awora. <verse eid="ISA 57:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 57:10" />Wuolo komwu woko pi yenyo lubangagu, ento pe wuwaco ni, “Konye peke”; pien wutamo ni wunongo kwo manyen ma medo tekowu, omiyo pe wudoko goro giwu i wangayo.<verse eid="ISA 57:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 57:11" />Rwot openyo ni, “Kit lubanga mene ma onongo wulworo tutwal, ma omiyo komwu myel, ma oweko wuwaco lok goba, ma omiyo wiwu dong owil woko pe wupo ikoma bo, ma pe dong wutwero tamo pira? Pe atemo diyo cwinya pi kare malac, ma oweko pe wubedo ki lworo mo ikoma? <verse eid="ISA 57:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 57:12" />En kitwu ma wutamo ni tye atiri, ki gin ducu ma wutimo abitucu woko kamaleng, ento magi ducu pe bikonyowu. <verse eid="ISA 57:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 57:13" />Kace wukok matek pi kony, gin cal jogiwuni myero gularwu do! Yamo bitingogi terogi woko, aluu dog bicwalogi woko wa cen. Ento ngat ma ringo laro bota bileyo lobo, dok bene bibedo ikom got mera maleng.”<verse eid="ISA 57:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lubanga ocike me konyo ki cango jone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 57:14" />Rwot biwaco ni, “Wutor yoo, wutor yoo, wuyub yoo, wuput ajut woko liweng ki i yoo pa jona.”<verse eid="ISA 57:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 57:15" />Lubanga ma en Ngat Mamalo Twal, ma bedo nakanaka i kabedo ma otinge malo, ma bedo matwal, ma nyinge lengi, owaco ni, “An abedo i kabedo maleng ma otinge malo, dok bene abedo kacel ki dano mamwol, ma cwinygi cwer, dok ma gingut, pi miyo kwo manyen bot jo ma cwinygi cwer dok ma gingut. <verse eid="ISA 57:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 57:16" />Pien pe abibedo ka pyem nakanaka, dok bene kiniga pe bimaka kare ducu, pien cwiny dano oa ki bota, an aye ma amiyogi yweyo me kwo. <verse eid="ISA 57:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 57:17" />Bal pa jona ki paro lim aye oweko akeco; omiyo apwodogi, akane woko, kun kiniga maka, ento gumede ameda ki jemo kun gitiyo gin ma cwinygi mito. <verse eid="ISA 57:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 57:18" />Dong atyeko neno kitgi, ento pud abicangogi; abitelogi, abiculugi bene ki gin ma kweyo cwinygi, kun amiyo jo ma kumu pirgi giloko lok me pwoc. <verse eid="ISA 57:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 57:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">57:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:17">Epe 2:17</ref></char></note>Abimiyo kuc bot jo matye kamabor ki jo matye kamacok, dok bene abicango jona. <verse eid="ISA 57:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 57:20" />Ento jo maracu gubedo calo nam ma twage, ma pe kong twero pye mot, kun piine kelo yugi ki coto keken. <verse eid="ISA 57:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 57:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">57:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 48:22">Ica 48:22</ref></char></note>Kuc mo peke pi jo ma gin lutim maracu.” Man lok ma Lubanga owaco.<verse eid="ISA 57:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 57" />
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="ISA 58" />
  <para style="s1">Rii kec me ada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 58:1" />Rwot waco ni, “Dange matek, pe iling, yab dwoni owinye malongo calo koko tum, tit bot jona bal ma gin gutimo, tuc bot jo me ot pa Yakobo balgi. <verse eid="ISA 58:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 58:2" />Nen kono giyenya nino ducu ba, cwinygi bene yom me ngeyo gin ma an amito ni guti, ginyute macalo jo me rok ma kitgi atir, ma pe giweko lubu cik pa Lubangagi, gipenya bene pi ngolo kop atir, cwinygi yom pi bedo cok ki Lubanga.”<verse eid="ISA 58:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 58:3" />Dano gipenyo ni, “Pingo wabedo ka rii kec, kun in pe ineno? Pingo kono wabedo ka mwole kenwa inyimi, kun in pe iparo lok mo iye wa ki acel?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 58:3">Ci Lubanga gamo ni, “Kong wunen, inino me rii kecwu, wuketo mere tamwu itimo gin ma yomo cwinywu keken, kun bene wunu jo ma tiyo tic botwu. <verse eid="ISA 58:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 58:4" />Kong wunen, wun wurii kec ki daa dok ki lweny, wudongo dano bene ki cingwu ma wungino woko ki kolo pi lweny. Kit rii kecwu ma wutye ka rii ikare man pe bimiyo dwonwu winye malo i polo. <verse eid="ISA 58:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 58:5" />Wutamo ni kit rii kecwuni en aye gin ma an amito dok apwoyo, ma miyo dano bedo ka deno can, en rii kec ma dano kulu iye wiye piny calo lagada ma okule, peto bongo cola, pworo buru iye, ka dong cako butu iye, wulwongo man ni rii kec? Wutamoni man gin ma cwinya pwoyo?<verse eid="ISA 58:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 58:6" />Kit rii kec ma an amito ene: gonyo tol me tim maracu woko, ki gonyo okol woko ki i tyen opii, weko jo ma kiunugi guwot ki kuc, ki turu okol woko ki i tyen dano. <verse eid="ISA 58:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 58:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">58:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:35">Mat 25:35</ref></char></note>Wupok cam bot jo ma kec nekogi, wukel lucan ma pacogi peke i gangwu; ka wuneno dano matye munero myero wuruk bongo ikome, pe myero wukane woko ki inyim joni.<verse eid="ISA 58:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 58:8" />Ci bera bituc boti macalo ceng me rupiny, ci wang buri matye ikomi bicang woko oyotoyot. Kit ma atir ma itye kwede bitelo nyimi, deyo pa Rwot aye ma bigengo ngeyi.<verse eid="ISA 58:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 58:9" />Dok bene ka wulega, ci an Rwot abigamo legawu, wubikok bota, ci abigamo ni; ‘An ene.’ Kace, wubikwanyo okol woko ki ikinwu, ki cimo dano ki lwet cingwu, ki loko lok maracu, <verse eid="ISA 58:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 58:10" />kace wubimiyo cam bot jo ma kec nekogi, dok bene wucobo miti pa jo ma kiunugi, man bimiyo ceng tuc pirwu ki i piny macol, piny macol licuc botwu biloke doko dyeceng. <verse eid="ISA 58:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 58:11" />An Rwot abitelowu ikare ducu, dok abicobo mitiwu ki jami mabeco, abimiyo cogowu bedo matek; wubibedo calo poto ma kionyo pii iye ci pii oromo iye maber tutwal, wubibedo macalo pii ma gunye agunya kare ducu, ma piine pe two kadi ki acel. <verse eid="ISA 58:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 58:12" />Wun wubigero gangwu iwi oburri macon doki, wun wubigero ikom acaki teguti mayam kwarowu gugero; kibilwongowu ni wun layub cel ma otur, jo ma yabo yoo mayam obale ducu doko maber.”<verse eid="ISA 58:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mot pi gwoko ceng Cabit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 58:13" />Rwot owaco ni, “Kace wuworo ceng Cabit macalo ceng maleng, dok wuweko timo gin ma yomo cwinywu inino maleng, kace wugwoko ceng Cabit macalo nino me yomcwiny, dok macalo nino ma Rwot olonyo ma obedo maleng me deyo; kace wuworo ceng Cabit kun pe wulubu yowu kenwu, kadi ki yenyo gin ma yomo cwinywu, nyo loko lok atata; <verse eid="ISA 58:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 58:14" />ci dong wubinongo yomcwiny pi tic bota an Rwot, ci abimiyo kibiworo wun iwi lobo ducu; doki wubibedo ki yomcwiny i lobo mayam kwarowu Yakobo oleyo, pien an Rwot kikome aye ma dong awaco lok man.”<verse eid="ISA 58:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 58" />
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="ISA 59" />
  <para style="s1">Icaya onyutu bal pa jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 59:1" />Nen, bad Rwot pe odoko cek, ma pe dong twero laro dano, ite bene pe oding ma pe rome winyo lok. <verse eid="ISA 59:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 59:2" />Ento timwu marac aye opokowu woko ki Lubangawu, balwu omiyo wange dong oume woko i komwu, omiyo dong pe winyo kokowu. <verse eid="ISA 59:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 59:3" />Pien remo dong onywano cingwu woko, ki lwet cingwu opong ki tim me bal keken; dok bene wuloko lok goba ki dogwu, ki lebwu bene mungu lok me timo tim maracu.<verse eid="ISA 59:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 59:4" />Pe tye dano mo ma doto lawote ilok matye ada, pe tye ngat mo ma cito i otkot ci pido pido kakare; dano ducu gijenge ilok ma tere peke kun giloko lok goba keken, wuparo pi timo gin maracu makelo can bot luwotwu. <verse eid="ISA 59:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 59:5" />Dano ducu ginywalo tim marac calo tong lacocodo, giciko obwogi calo oboropyen; ngat ma camo tonggi to woko, ento ka onyono anyona ororo a iye. <verse eid="ISA 59:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 59:6" />Ento obwogi macalo meno pe bikonyogi wa ki acel, pe bikonyogi me aruka kadi ki me ume, ticgi ma gityero obedo tic me bal, ki cinggi bene timo tim bwami. <verse eid="ISA 59:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 59:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">59:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:15-17">Rom 3:15-17</ref></char></note>Tyen gi yot giringo kwede madwir katimo gin marac, giwile awila me cito oyotoyot ka neko jo ma peke ki bal. Gitamo meggi tam me cito katimo gin marac keken; kama giwoto iye ducu giyako dok gibalo jami woko matye kunu. <verse eid="ISA 59:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 59:8" />Pe gingeyo yo me kuc, timo gin matye atir bene peke i gudugi, gin gilubu yo ma ogom woko, pe tye ngat mo ma wok ki iye ma nongo kuc.<verse eid="ISA 59:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael gutucu balgi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 59:9" />Dano giwaco ni, “Meno omiyo tiyo gin ma atir botwa dong peke, wayenyo lengpiny ci wanongo mutu, maka woto i ceng wawoto i colpiny. <verse eid="ISA 59:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 59:10" />Wabedo kabongo kor ot ki cingwa calo lutowang, wabongo calo jo ma wanggi oto; wayoke kawot ma piny pud leng calo watye kawot i dyewor, wanen calo jo ma oto ki ikin jo ma komgi tek. <verse eid="ISA 59:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 59:11" />Nen dong watye kangur angura calo lee, wabedo kakok akoka calo amam, wakuru timo tim atir ento pe wanongo; wakuru lare, ento tye kamabor kwedwa. <verse eid="ISA 59:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 59:12" />Pien balwa dong odure mapol inyimi, roc ma watimo aye dong obedo caden ikomwa; pud wapo ikom balwa, wangeyo gin marac ma watimo. <verse eid="ISA 59:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 59:13" />Wakalo wi cik, wakwero Rwot woko, waweko bene lubu kor Lubangawa, kun waloko lok me unu dano kijemo. Wagamo lok goba bedo i cwinywa, ci waloko bene kamaleng. <verse eid="ISA 59:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 59:14" />Ento ngolo kop atir kidwoko woko cen, kit ma atir bene pe dong nyiko cok ingetwa, ki ada bene opoto woko i kabedo ducu idye gang, gin mo matye kakare pe dong nongo yo me donyo. <verse eid="ISA 59:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 59:15" />Ada dong peke matwal, ngat ma kwero timo tim marac kitime marac.”</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ISA 59:15">Rwot oyube me laro jone</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 59:15">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">59:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 63:5">Ica 63:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rwot oneno ci cwinye ocwer matek, pien ngolo kop atir dong peke. Ngat ma konyo jo ma kiunugi dong peke. <verse eid="ISA 59:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 59:16" />Rwot ouru mada pien ngat mo dong peke matwero larogi. Ci en kikome aye dong bilarogi ki teke kene, kit ma atir bimiyo en cobo timo man. <verse eid="ISA 59:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 59:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">59:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:14">Epe 6:14</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 6:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:8">1 Tec 5:8</ref></char></note>Oruku kit ma atir macalo gin me gengo kore, ki otang nyonyo me lar bene oruku i wiye; cwiny me culu kwor bibedo macalo bongo arukane, dok akemo biboyo kome woko calo jor. <verse eid="ISA 59:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 59:18" />En biculugi kun poro kit macalo timgi tye kwede, akemo bot lumonene, ki cul bot lukwore; dok biculu cul marac bot lobo matye i dog nam. <verse eid="ISA 59:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 59:19" />Meno bimiyo kibilworo nying Rwot cake ki tung kupotoceng, ki deyone cake ki itung kunyango; pien biruyu bino oyotoyot calo pii ma mol mager, mayamo pa Rwot aye ma twago.<verse eid="ISA 59:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 59:20" />Rwot dok owaco bot jone ni, <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">59:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:26">Rom 11:26</ref></char></note>“An abibino i Cion ka kokowu ki i gwokwu, wun jo pa Yakobo ma wuweko timo bal.<verse eid="ISA 59:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 59:21" />Dong ki tung bota, man en aye obedo gicike ma acike kwede kwedwu: tek ma mera ma dong atyeko miyo botwu, ki loka ma dong atyeko keto i dogwu, pe dong bia ki i botwu, kadi ki i dog lutinowu, nyo i dog lutino pa lutinowu, cake tin cito kwede anyim kun bedo bene nakanaka.”<verse eid="ISA 59:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 59" />
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="ISA 60" />
  <para style="s1">Deyo ma bibedo tye i Jerucalem i anyim</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 60:1" />A malo ba, in Jerucalem, wek iryeny calo ceng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:1">deyo pa Rwot dong otuc ocaro komi woko.<verse eid="ISA 60:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 60:2" />Nen, colpiny biumu lobo woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:2">mutu macol licuc biumu rok mukene woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:2">ento dero pa Rwot biryeny ikomi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:2">ci kibineno deyone ikomi.<verse eid="ISA 60:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 60:3" />Lurok gibibino i leng pinyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:3">luker gibibino i dero ceng ma otuc ikomi.<verse eid="ISA 60:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 60:4" />Ting wangi malo wek kong inen piny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:4">jo ducu gibicoke kacel, gibibino boti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:4">awobeni gibia ki kamabor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:4">dok anyirani kibitingogi atinga i kor.<verse eid="ISA 60:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 60:5" />Ibineno ci cwinyi bipong ki yomcwiny madwong atika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:5">cwinyi bibedo kagone adada pi lwak yomcwiny ma itye kwede;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:5">pien lim mabup me nam dong kibiweko i cingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:5">ki lonyo pa rok mapol kibikelo boti.<verse eid="ISA 60:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 60:6" />Lwak kinaga mapol ki lutino kinaga bibino ki i Midian ki Epa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:6">kadi wa jo me Ceba ducu gibibino boti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:6">Gibibino kun gikelo jabu ki odok luban,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:6">gin bitito kun gipako Rwot pi gin ducu mabeco ma en otimo.<verse eid="ISA 60:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 60:7" />Romi ducu me Kedar kibicokogi boti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:7">nyogi romi me Nebayot kibikelogi boti pi gin atyera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:7">kibikelogi macalo gitum iwi keno tyeri me atyera, ci ibigamogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:7">dok ibimedo deyo ikom odi ma dong ideyoni.<verse eid="ISA 60:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 60:8" />Magi kono jo mene ma gituk calo poli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:8">nyo macalo amam ma gidok i dog odigi?<verse eid="ISA 60:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 60:9" />Meli ma a ki i dog nam ducu bigure,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:9">mel ma oa ki i Tarcic aye bitelo yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:9">me kelo lutino pa Lubanga ki kamabor</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:9">kacel ki lonyo madwong tutwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:9">pi nying Rwot Lubanga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:9">ma en Ngat Maleng me Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:9">pien en dong oketo deyo ikom jone.<verse eid="ISA 60:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 60:10" />Rwot Lubanga owaco kuman bot Jerucalem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:10">“Lurok bigero celi, lukergi bikonyi ki tic;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:10">pien ikare mayam akemo omaka omiyo apwodi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:10">ento pi mitina kena dong atyeko timo kica boti.<verse eid="ISA 60:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 60:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">60:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 21:25-26">Niy 21:25-26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Dogceli bibedo twolo kare ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:11">pe kibiloro i dyeceng kadi i dyewor;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:11">wek ibed kagamo lonyo pa rok ducu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:11">Kibikelo luker me lobo ducu ma kimakogi ki loc madit atika.<verse eid="ISA 60:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 60:12" />Pien rok ki ker ma pe biye loci kibinekogi woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:12">kodi rok macalo meno pud dok kibibalo lobogi dok aye.<verse eid="ISA 60:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 60:13" />Deyo me Lebanon kibikelo boti, ciprec ki yadi mabeco ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:13">wek omii kabedona maleng onen ma mwonya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:13">dok bene abimiyo kabedo me teno tyena pong ki deyo.<verse eid="ISA 60:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 60:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">60:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 3:9">Niy 3:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Lutino pa jo mayam gubedo kauni gibibino boti lagungu gungu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:14">ki jo mayam gubedo kacayi gibiryebe piny ka tyeni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:14">gibilwongi ni in ibedo taun madit pa Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:14">Cion ma obedo taun madit pa Ngat Maleng me Icrael.<verse eid="ISA 60:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 60:15" />Kun kono yam kong kiweki ata, kikweri woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:15">kun ngat mo peke ma wok kato ki boti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:15">An dong abimiyo ibedo dit nakanaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:15">jo me kare ducu bibedo ki yomcwiny piri.<verse eid="ISA 60:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 60:16" />Ibigamo lonyo pa jo me rok ducu kacel ki lukergi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:16">Ka man bitime miyo ibingeyo ni An a Rwot, an aye ma lalari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:16">dok an aye ma akoko in,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:16">an a Won Twero ma abedo Lubanga pa Yakobo.<verse eid="ISA 60:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 60:17" />Abikelo jabu maka mola,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:17">abikelo ryal, maka nyonyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:17">abikelo mola maka bao,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:17">abikelo nyonyo maka gweng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:17">Luloci pe dok biuni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:17">abimiyo gin bibedo kaloyo loc atir dok ki kuc bene.<verse eid="ISA 60:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 60:18" />Tim me bwami pe dok biwinye i loboni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:18">kadi yak nyo kadi bale pa lobo pe binen iwang apoki loboni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:18">Abigwoki dok akani macalo cel;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:18">ci ibipaka pien atyeko lari.<verse eid="ISA 60:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 60:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">60:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 21:23">Niy 21:23</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:5">22:5</ref></char>
    </note>Ceng aye pe dok bimenyi dyeceng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:19">kadi dero me dwe bene aye pe bimenyi dyewor;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:19">an Rwot aye ma abimenyi nakanaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:19">an Lubangani aye ma abimiyo ibedo ki deyo.<verse eid="ISA 60:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 60:20" />Kareni me kumu bigik woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:20">an Rwot aye abibedo deroni ma rii nakanaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:20">cengi pe dok bipoto, dweni bene pe birwenyo.<verse eid="ISA 60:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 60:21" />Joni ducu dong gibibedo jo ma kitgi atir;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:21">gibileyo lobo doko meggi matwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:21">gibinen macalo jang yat ma an aye apito,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:21">tic ma an kikoma aye atiyo wek dano gumiya deyo.<verse eid="ISA 60:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 60:22" />Dogola pa joni tye manok ento olo dong bidoko kaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:22">ngat matidi mada bidoko twon rok mo matek.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:22">An a Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:22">abimiyo man time oyot ka karene oromo.”<verse eid="ISA 60:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 60" />
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="ISA 61" />
  <para style="s1">Kwena maber me laro Cion</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 61:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">61:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:5">Mat 11:5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:22">Luk 7:22</ref></char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">61:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 4:18-19">Luk 4:18-19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rwot Lubanga dong ocwalo Cwiny mere ikoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:1">en dong oyera ci oora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:1">wek ater lok me kwena maber bot jo ma kiunugi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:1">Oora bene me cango jo ma cwercwiny onurugi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:1">ki me tito bot jo matye i opii ni kibigonyogi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:1">ki jo ma kitweyogi i buc ni kibiyabo botgi dogola ci gibikati woko.<verse eid="ISA 61:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 61:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">61:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:4">Mat 5:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note> En dok ocwala ni atit pi mwaka ma Rwot bitimo iye ber bot dano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:2">ki kare me culu kwor pa Lubangawa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:2">dok pi kweyo cwiny jo ma kumu.<verse eid="ISA 61:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 61:3" />En oora me miyo lalukana me deyo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:3">bot jo ma kumu i Cion maka buru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:3">moo wir me yomcwiny maka kumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:3">ruk me pako Lubanga maka bedo ki cwiny magoro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:3">Gin gibibedo calo yadi ma Rwot aye opito,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:3">gin gibitiyo gin matye atir ci kibipako Lubanga pi gin ma en otiyo.<verse eid="ISA 61:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 61:4" />Gibigero gedo odoco iwi obur mayam obale con;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:4">gibiyubu taun madito ducu ma onongo kibalogi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:4">ma onongo obale con ikare pa yalwak mapol mukato angec.<verse eid="ISA 61:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 61:5" />Lurok gibicung kun gikwayo romiwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:5">gin bene aye ma gibipuru potiwu ki gwoko poti olokwu.<verse eid="ISA 61:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 61:6" />Ento wun kibilwongowu ni ajwaki pa Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:6">dano gibilwongowu ni wun lutic pa Lubangawa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:6">wubicamo lonyo pa rok mapol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:6">dok wubibedo bene ki deyo pi limgi.<verse eid="ISA 61:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 61:7" />Wun yam kiketo lewic madit i komwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:7">dok bene kijerowu matek tutwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:7">pimeno wubibedo i lobowu kikome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:7">lonyowu bene kibidode kiryo iwi wadigi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:7">wubibedo dong ki yomcwiny nakanaka.<verse eid="ISA 61:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 61:8" />Rwot owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:8">“An amaro tim matye atir, adag yak ki tim marac;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:8">abiculu wang can ma opoto ikom jona ma opore kakare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:8">ki abicike kwedgi i gicike ma rii nakanaka.<verse eid="ISA 61:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 61:9" />Likwayogi bibedo jo matek ikin lurok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:9">ki nying lutino ma gin gunywalo biwinye adada ikin rok ducu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:9">jo ducu ma gibinenogi gibiniang ikomgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:9">ni gin gubedo rok ma an Rwot amiyo botgi gum.”<verse eid="ISA 61:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 61:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">61:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 21:2">Niy 21:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Cwinya bibedo yom matek i Rwot, abium pi Lubangana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:10">pien dong otyeko ruka woko ki bongo me lare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:10">dok bene ouma woko ki jor me kit ma atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:10">macalo lanyom ma oruke maber ki tok me deyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:10">dok macalo dako manyen ma oruke ki tiko me wel.<verse eid="ISA 61:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 61:11" />Pien kit macalo jami mapatpat twi i lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:11">ki poto bene miyo gin ma kicoyo iye twi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:11">kitmeno Rwot Lubanga bene bimiyo kit ma atir ki pak</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:11">bedo tye i kin rok ducu.<verse eid="ISA 61:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 61" />
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="ISA 62" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 62:1" />Pe abiling pi Cion,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:1">pe bene abiywe pi Jerucalem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:1">nio kadong kityeko gonye woko ki icing jo ma une,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:1">nio kadong larne ocaro piny calo dero mac ma menyo piny idyewor.<verse eid="ISA 62:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 62:2" />Rok ducu bineno ka kigonyi woko ki icing jo ma giuni, in Jerucalem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:2">ki luker ducu gibineno deyoni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:2">dong kibilwongi ki nying manyen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:2">ma Rwot kikome aye bicakone.<verse eid="ISA 62:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 62:3" />Ibibedo calo lalukana me deyo matye i cing Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:3">dok ibibedo macalo tok me ker ma nyutu loc pa Lubangani.<verse eid="ISA 62:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 62:4" />Dong pe kibimede ki lwongi ni taun madit ma dong kibwoto woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:4">loboni bene pe kibilwongo ni dako ma kiweko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:4">ento kibilwongi ni taun madit ma Lubanga cwinye yom ikome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:4">ci kibilwongo loboni ni dako ma kinyomo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:4">pien Rwot cwinye yom ikomi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:4">ci en bibedo macalo cwari.<verse eid="ISA 62:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 62:5" />Kit macalo awobi nyomo nyako ma peya ongeyo laco,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:5">kitmeno Ngat ma ocweyo in binyomi bene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:5">dok kit macalo lanyom cwinye bedo yom pi nyako ger,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:5">Lubangani bene cwinye bibedo yom piri kitmeno.<verse eid="ISA 62:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 62:6" />In Jerucalem, aketo lukurpiny iwi celi malo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:6">pe gibiling dyeceng ki dyewor benebene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:6">Wun jo ma poyo wi Rwot ikom cikene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:6">pe wuywe,<verse eid="ISA 62:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 62:7" />dok bene pe wumiye kare me yweyo nio wang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:7">ma en dong omiyo Jerucalem ocung matek</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:7">ma dong omiyo odoko gin ma kipako iwi lobo ducu.<verse eid="ISA 62:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 62:8" />Rwot dong otyeko cike matek tutwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:8">en bicobo cikene ki twerone.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:8">En owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:8">“Pe dok abimiyo lukwori gicamo kali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:8">lurok bene pe dok gibimato kongo bwinoni ma in iyele me tiyo tic pire.<verse eid="ISA 62:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 62:9" />Ento jo ma gukayo kal gibicamo ci gipako iye Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:9">ki jo ma gupwono olok gibimato kongo bwinone</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:9">idyekal me kabedona maleng.”<verse eid="ISA 62:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 62:10" />Wuwok ki kunu, wuwok ki i dog cel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:10">wuyub yoo pi lwaka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:10">wutor yoo, wutor yoo gudu woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:10">wucok gweng woko bene ki i yoo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:10">ka dong wuil bendera malo wek rok ducu gunge ni:<verse eid="ISA 62:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 62:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">62:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:10">Ica 40:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:12">Niy 22:12</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot dong otyeko waco bot lwak ducu ma i lobo pi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:11">tito bot jo Cion ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:11">“Nen larewu dong tye kabino;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:11">kun jo ma en olaro telo nyime,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:11">ki mot me culu jo ma otiyo maber bote bene tye inyime.”<verse eid="ISA 62:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 62:12" />Kibilwongogi ni gin rok maleng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:12">gin jo ma Rwot okokogi ki i can;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:12">dok bene kibilwongo Jerucalem ni, “Taun madit ma Rwot omaro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:12">ma pe oweko woko ata.”<verse eid="ISA 62:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 62" />
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="ISA 63" />
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Rwot ikom rok ducu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 63:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">63:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 34:5-17">Ica 34:5-17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:7-22">Jer 49:7-22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:12-14">Eje 25:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 35:1-15">35:1-15</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:11-12">Amo 1:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:1-14">Oba 1-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:2-5">Mal 1:2-5</ref></char>
    </note>Apenyo ni, “Man anga ma bino ki i Edomi, ki i Bojra ma oruku bongo makwari, ma oruku ruk me deyoni, kun tye kanyate ki twon tekone maditi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 63:1">Ci Rwot ogamo ni, “Meno an enu ma atye katito lok me loyo kop, pien an atek, atwero laro dano.”<verse eid="ISA 63:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 63:2" />Dok apenyo ni, “Pingo kono bongoni ma irukuni kwar, kun nen calo bongo pa ngat ma nyono olok me biyo pige?”<verse eid="ISA 63:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 63:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">63:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 14:20">Niy 14:20</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:13">19:13</ref>,<ref loc="REV 19:15">15</ref></char>
    </note>Ci Rwot gamo ni, “Anyono rok ducu calo nyig olok i bur me biyo pige an kena, kun ngat mo peke ma obino kakonya. Anyonogi woko lirwacrwac ki akemo adada; ci remogi okir ikoma omiyo bongona ducu onywane woko marac. <verse eid="ISA 63:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 63:4" />Pien nino me culu kwor onongo tye i cwinya, mwaka me koko jona bene dong oromo. <verse eid="ISA 63:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 63:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">63:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:16">Ica 59:16</ref></char></note> Aneno piny, ci anongo ni pe tye ngat mo matwero konya; angiyo piny, ento onongo pe tye ngat mo maromo miya teko; meno omiyo cing an kikoma aye oloyo loc, akemona aye omiyo anongo teko. <verse eid="ISA 63:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 63:6" />Ceng anyono rok mapol woko ducu piny ki kinigana, akemona omiyo anginyogi woko, dok aonyo remogi omol piny i ngom.”<verse eid="ISA 63:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ber pa Rwot bot jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 63:7" />Abitito pi mar pa Rwot ma pe loke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:7">kun apake pi gin ducu mabeco ma en Rwot otimo pirwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:7">ki twon ber madit ma en onyutu bot jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:7">ma en otimo botgi pi kicane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:7">kun lubu bene mar mere madwong ma pe loke.<verse eid="ISA 63:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 63:8" />Rwot owaco ni, “Adada, gin jona, lutino ma pe bibwola.” Ci en odoko Lalargi <verse eid="ISA 63:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 63:9" />i can gi ducu en bene oneno iye can, en kikome aye olarogi, pe lakwenane mo nyo kadi ki lamalaika mo. En okokogi pi mar mere ki pi kicane; en obedo kagwokogi nino ki nino cake wa ikare mayam con. <verse eid="ISA 63:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 63:10" />Ento gin gujemo woko ikome, omiyo kiniga omako Rwot, Cwiny mere maleng okumu tutwal. Pimeno en oloke odoko lakworgi, omiyo en kikome olwenyo ikomgi. <verse eid="ISA 63:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 63:11" />Dano dok wigi opo pi kare macon, ikare pa Moses ma latic pa Rwot, ci gupenyo ni, “Ngat mayam okwanyo lukwat romine ki i nami mono tye kwene? En ngat ma oketo Cwiny mere maleng ikin gi kono tye kwene? <verse eid="ISA 63:11" /><verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="ISA 63:12-13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">63:12-13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21">Nia 14:21</ref></char></note>Rwot kong tye kwene, en ngat mayam omiyo twer me deyone bot Moses? En yam omiyo pii opoke i dul aryo inyim jone ci omiyo guwok gukato ki i dye nam. En otiyo man wek enong nying ma rii nakanaka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 63:12-13">Rwot otelogi kangolo nam, gin gubedo calo aguragura ma woto i tim, pe gubedo kagate kadi ki acel. <verse eid="ISA 63:12-13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 63:14" />Cwiny pa Rwot omiyo botgi yweyo, calo dyangi ma guo i nota kulu. En otelo jone kumeno, wek enong kwede nying me deyo.<verse eid="ISA 63:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lega pi kica ki kony</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 63:15" />Ai Rwot, kul wangi ki i polo inen piny i lobo, inen piny ki i kabedoni maleng me deyo. Arimani ki teki kono dong tye kwene? Mar meri ki kicani kono tye kwene? In dong ityeko kwanyogi woko ki botwa. <verse eid="ISA 63:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 63:16" />Pien in aye i Wonwa, kadi bed Abraim pe ngeyowa, dok Icrael bene pe paro pirwa; in Rwot giri aye ibedo Wonwa, dok ibedo lakokwa cake yam con. <verse eid="ISA 63:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 63:17" />Pingo imiyo wangak woko ki i yoni, ai Rwot? Pingo imiyo wadoko jo ma lujemo ma pe gilwori? Dwog cen botwa pi jo ma gitiyo piri, pi kaka ducu ma gubedo meri kikome. <verse eid="ISA 63:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 63:18" />Joni maleng gubedo i kabedoni maleng pi kare manok mo tutwal, lukworwa koni dong gunyono kabedo man ki tyen gi gubalo woko. <verse eid="ISA 63:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 63:19" />Dong wadoko calo jo mayam in pe iloyogi, wadoko calo jo ma pe kilwongogi ki nyingi.<verse eid="ISA 63:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 63" />
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="ISA 64" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 64:1" />Ai kono onongo ibaro polo woko likwak ilor piny, kono ber! Kono onongo imiyo godi guyenge inyimi. <verse eid="ISA 64:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 64:2" />Kono onongo komgi omyel calo pii ma yenyo iwi keno ma mace lyet. Bin dong wek inyut tweroni bot lukwori, wek rok ducu komgi omyel inyimi! <verse eid="ISA 64:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 64:3" />Yam itiyo gin mogo makelo lworo madwong ma wan ki komwa pe waromo tamo pire, yam ilor piny, ci godi guyenge inyimi. <verse eid="ISA 64:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 64:4" />Cake con ki con ngat mo gire pe owinyo, ngat mo pe ma owinyo ki ite, ngat mo bene pe oneno Lubanga mapat kono in keken, Lubanga ma tiyo tic pi jo ducu ma giketo gen gi ikome. <verse eid="ISA 64:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 64:5" />In i jolo ngat ma tiyo tic ma atir ki yomcwiny, irwate ki jo ma wigi po pi yoni ma imito ni gulubi. Nen, kiniga ceng omaki, pien onongo wabalo; wabedo katimo bal pi kare malac tutwal. Tika wan wabilare ada? <verse eid="ISA 64:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 64:6" />Wan ducu dong wadoko calo ngat ma kome ki keni, gin ma atir ducu ma watimo dong nen calo bongo ma onyobe woko ki gin me kwer. Wan ducu waner woko calo pot yat, balwa bene terowa woko cen calo yamo ma kodo. <verse eid="ISA 64:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 64:7" />Pe tye dano mo ma loke boti kalega, ma cuke ka maki liking; pien in ikano wangi woko ki botwa, dong ibwotowa i balwa.<verse eid="ISA 64:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 64:8" />Ento kadi bed kumeno, ai Rwot, in pud i Wonwa; wan lobo agulu, in aye lacwecwa. Wan ducu wabedo gin ma in aye itiyo ki cingi. <verse eid="ISA 64:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 64:9" />Ai Rwot, pe myero kiniga dok omaki matek, pe bene ibed ka po ikom balwa nakanaka. Kong inen, dok ipar, wan ducu wabedo joni. <verse eid="ISA 64:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 64:10" />Taun madito maleng ma meri ducu dong gudoko tim. Cion dong odoko tim, ki Jerucalem dong odoko obur. <verse eid="ISA 64:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 64:11" />Otwa maleng ma obedo Ot pa Lubanga, ma munya tutwali, kama yam kwariwa gipaki ki iye, dong kityeko wangone woko ki mac; kabedo ducu mayam yomo cwinywa dong odoko obur. <verse eid="ISA 64:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 64:12" />Ka ineno magi ducu ka time ci pe itwero timo iye gin mo, ai Rwot? Ibiling kun nongo iunuwa matek kuman?<verse eid="ISA 64:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 64" />
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="ISA 65" />
  <para style="s1">Pwod ma Lubanga keto ikom jo ma lujemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 65:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 10:20">Rom 10:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Yam ayube pi gamo lega pa jona, ento gin gigi pe gulega. Ayube bene ni myero gunonga, ento pe gutemo yenya. Abedo kawaco ni, ‘An atye en, an atye en me konyi,’ bot rok ma onongo dong pe gilwongo nyinga. <verse eid="ISA 65:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 65:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">65:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:21">Rom 10:21</ref></char></note>Abedo katango cinga dyeceng jwi bot jo ma gijemo woko ajema, jo ma woto i yo ma pe ber wa ki acel, kun gilubu gigi yubgi ken gi. <verse eid="ISA 65:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 65:3" />Gubedo kangeto cwinya kare ki kare, kun gubedo katyero gitum bot jogi i poti, guwango odok ecetagu wa ikom keno tyer pa jogi; <verse eid="ISA 65:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 65:4" />gubedo kabedo i lyelgu, i dyewor gibedo i kabedo mogo ma i mung; gibedo kacamo ringo opegogu, jami tedogi ducu onyobe woko ki pig ringo lee ma kikwero. <verse eid="ISA 65:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 65:5" />Gin jo ma giwaco ni, ‘Bed kakeni kunu, pe ibin cok kweda, pien an dong kipoka woko pat kwedi pien an aleng.’ Jo magi calo yito ma duny i uma, gical ki mac ma pe to kadi ki acel.<verse eid="ISA 65:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 65:6" />Nen, dong kityeko coyo lok inyima ni, ‘An pe abiling alinga, ento abiculu wange ikorgi kikome. Adada, abiculugi gire, <verse eid="ISA 65:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 65:7" />pi timgi maracu kacel ki tim maracu pa kwarigi,’ man Rwot ma owaco pien gubedo kawango odok eceta iwi godi, dok gubedo kayeta bene iwi ceregu ducu; abimiyo botgi pwod ma pore ki balgi.”<verse eid="ISA 65:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 65:8" />Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Kit macalo kongo bwino nonge ki i nyig olok, ci dano giwaco ni, ‘Pe ibal woko, pien gum tye iye,’ abitimo kitmeno pi lutica, pe abityekogi woko ducu. <verse eid="ISA 65:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 65:9" />Abimiyo likwayo a ki ikom Yakobo, ki jo ma bileyo wi godi na a ki i Juda; jona ma ayero gibileyo lobona ma obedo godigodi bedo meggi, dong lutica gibibedo kunu. <verse eid="ISA 65:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 65:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">65:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:24-26">Yoc 7:24-26</ref></char></note>Caron ki Akor bidoko kama kikwayo iye romi ki dyangi pa jona ma gubedo ka yenya.<verse eid="ISA 65:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 65:11" />Ento bibedo pat botwu wun jo ma dong wubwota, ma wiwu dong owil woko ikom got mera maleng, ma wuyubu meja pa jok wek omiwu gum, ma wupiko kongo ma kinyobo pong kikopo pi jok wek nyimwu obed leng. <verse eid="ISA 65:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 65:12" />Abimiyo kinekowu woko ki pala lucwan, pien ikare mayam alwongowu wun wukwero gamo doga woko, ikare ma abedo kalok bene pe wuciko itwu ka winyo loka, ento wubedo katimo gin manen marac inyima, wuyero bene gin ma pe yomo cwinya. <verse eid="ISA 65:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 65:13" />Pimeno omiyo an Rwot Lubanga awaco ni lutica bicamo cam, ento wun kec binekowu; lutica bimato pii, ento wun orwo pii binekowu matek; lutica gibibedo ki yomcwiny, ento wun kibimiyo lewic makowu; <verse eid="ISA 65:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 65:14" />lutica gibiwer ki yomcwiny ento wun wubikok ki cwercwiny. <verse eid="ISA 65:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 65:15" />Nyingwu bidong bot jona ma dong ayero wek gucen ki dano. An Rwot Lubanga kikoma aye ma binekowu; ento lutica dong abilwongogi ki nying mapat. <verse eid="ISA 65:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 65:16" />Pimeno, kace ngat mo lamo gum i lobo, en bilamo gum ikome kene ki nyinga, dok ngat ma bikwongo kwong i lobo man, bikwongo ki nyinga. Pe dong kibipo ikom can mayam con ca.”<verse eid="ISA 65:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Polo manyen ki lobo manyen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 65:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 66:22">Ica 66:22</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:13">2 Pet 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:1">Niy 21:1</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot dok owaco kuman ni, “Nen, dong acweyo polo manyen ki lobo manyen; pe dong kibipo pi jami macon, dok pe bene dano mo bitamo pirgi. <verse eid="ISA 65:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 65:18" />Ento myero cwinywu obed yom kun wubedo ki yomcwiny nakanaka ikom jami magi ma aketogini; pien nen, Jerucalem ma manyen bibedo me yomcwiny, jone bene bibedo ki yomcwiny madwong. <verse eid="ISA 65:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 65:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">65:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:4">Niy 21:4</ref></char></note>Abibedo ki yomcwiny pi Jerucalem, cwinya bibedo yom ikom jona; dwon mo me koko pe dok biwinye iye, kadi koko mo me can bene pe biwinye iye. <verse eid="ISA 65:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 65:20" />Latin mo ma kinywalo ma rii pi kare manoknok keken bene pe bibedo tye iye, kadi ladit mo ma otii ma pe bicobo karene. Ngat ma bito ki mwaka miya acel kibikwano ni bulu, ngat ma bito ma mwakane pe biromo miya acel kibikwano ni en ngat ma kiceno. <verse eid="ISA 65:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 65:21" />Dano gibigero odi ci gibedo i igi, gibipuru poto olokgi, ci gibicamo nyige bene. <verse eid="ISA 65:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 65:22" />Pe gibigero odigi ci kiweko ngat mukene aye bedo iye, pe gibipuru poto olokgi ci kiweko ngat mukene aye ma dok camo nyige. Jona gibiri marom aroma ki yat. Jona ma an aye ayerogi gibilimo gum ikom tic me cinggi pi kare malac. <verse eid="ISA 65:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 65:23" />Ngat mo ikin gi pe biyele ki tic nono, dok bene pe kibinywalo latin ci dok neno can; pien gin dong gibibedo lutino pa jo ma Rwot dong otyeko miyogi gum, kun gumgini bimako bene wa lutinogi. <verse eid="ISA 65:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 65:24" />Ma peya gulwongo lwongo, an abigamo doggi, ma pud gitye kalok aloka, abiwinyo lokgi woko. <verse eid="ISA 65:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 65:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">65:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:6-9">Ica 11:6-9</ref></char></note>Orudi ki latin romo gibicam kacel, labwor bicamo lum calo twon; twol bene bimoko apwa. Pe gibiketo ret ikom dano nyo kadi ki nek, iwi got mera maleng ducu.”<verse eid="ISA 65:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 65" />
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="ISA 66" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot ngolo kop ikom rok ducu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 66:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">66:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:34">Mat 5:34</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 5:35">35</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:22">23:22</ref></char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">66:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 7:49-50">Tic 7:49-50</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Polo aye komkera, lobo obedo kom me teno tyena. Kit ot ango ma wutwero gero pira? Ka yweyona kono binen ningning? <verse eid="ISA 66:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 66:2" />Jami magi ducu an aye atiyogi ki cinga, pimeno jami magi ducu gubedo mega. Man Rwot aye ma owaco. Dong man aye dano ma abiciko wanga ikome, dano mamwol, ma ngut bene ki icwinye, dok ma kome myel ilok ma an awaco.<verse eid="ISA 66:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 66:3" />Dano gitimo kit ma gimito, dok dano ma neko twon dyang pi tyer rom ki ngat ma neko dano; ngat ma tyero latin romo macalo gitum, rom ki ngat ma turu ngut gwok me atyera; ki ngat makelo gityer me moko kwon tyero bota, rom ki ngat ma tyero remo opego; ngat ma wango odok luban macalo gityer me nipo rom ki ngat ma lego gum ikom cal jok. Jo magi guyero yogi pirgi ken gi, cwinygi yom mere ayoma i timgi me kipyeda. <verse eid="ISA 66:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 66:4" />An bene abimiyo botgi pwod ma myero omakgi, abiyero can mamiyo lworo makogi marac tutwal; pien ikare mayam alwongogi, ngat ma ogamo doga obedo peke, ikare ma aloko kwedgi, ngat mo pe ma owinyo loka; ento gutimo gin manen marac inyima, ci guyero gigi gin ma pe yomo cwinya.”<verse eid="ISA 66:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 66:5" />Wuwiny lok pa Rwot, wun jo ma komwu myel iloke, “Utmegiwu ma gidagwu, ma guryemowu wucito woko cen pi nyinga, dong guwaco ni, ‘Kong Rwot onyut deyone botwu wek kong wanen yomcwinywu.’ Ento gin aye gigi ma gibiweko lewic makogi keken gi. <verse eid="ISA 66:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 66:6" />Kong wuwiny woo madit matye i taun madit! Dwon mo ma a ki i Ot pa Lubanga! Meno dwon Rwot, matye kaculu kwor ikom lukwore.<verse eid="ISA 66:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 66:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">66:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 12:5">Niy 12:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Tauna madit rom ki dako ma nywal cutcut ma peya mwoc ogoyo. En onywalo latin laco ma peya arem ocake ikome. <verse eid="ISA 66:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 66:8" />Tye ngat mo tika mayam kong oneno nyo owinyo kit gin macalo meno? Rok mono kitwero nywalone inino acel keken? Cion pe bibedo ki arem matek pi kare ma lac ma pud peya en onywalo roke cut. <verse eid="ISA 66:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 66:9" />Itamo ni an amiyo kare me nywalo jona romo ci pe aweko kinywalogi? An aye ma amiyo dano nywal, itamo ni an dok atwero cego ot nyodo pa Cion woko wek pe onong lutino?” Man an Rwot ma owaco.<verse eid="ISA 66:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 66:10" />Cwinywu obed yom kacel ki Jerucalem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:10">cwinywu bene obed yom pire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:10">wun jo ducu ma wumare;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:10">wubed ki yomcwiny madwong kacel kwede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:10">wun jo ducu mayam kumu pire;<verse eid="ISA 66:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 66:11" />wek wudot cak ki itunune okwe cwinywu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:11">calo latin ma doto tunu pa mine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:11">wek bene wumwony cake ki yomcwiny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:11">pien cak dwong tutwal i kore.<verse eid="ISA 66:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 66:12" />Pien Rwot owaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:12">“Nen, abinyayo kuc bedo dit bote calo kulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:12">ki lonyo pa lurok calo kulu ma opong ma mol ma pe two;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:12">wubidoto cak ki itunune, en bitingowu woko i lakngete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:12">dok bene wubibedo ka tuku i eme.<verse eid="ISA 66:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 66:13" />Abikweyo cwinywu, calo latin ma mine kweyo cwinye; cwinywu bikwe i Jerucalem. <verse eid="ISA 66:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 66:14" />Wubineno, ci cwinywu cako bedo yom, komwu bibedo yot calo lum ma pud lot alota; meno bimiyo wungeyo ni, Rwot konyo jo ma tiyo pire ento akemone tye ikom lukwore.”<verse eid="ISA 66:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 66:15" />Pien nen, Rwot bibino ki mac, kun gadigadine ducu bedo madwir calo yamo lapiru, me coro akemone ikomgi ki kiniga malyet adada, kun jukugi ki leb mac. <verse eid="ISA 66:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 66:16" />Pien Rwot bingolokop ikom dano ki mac, dok bene en bineko jo mapol woko ki pala lucwan; jo ma en Rwot bineko bibedo pol mada.<verse eid="ISA 66:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 66:17" />Rwot waco ni, “Jo ma gilonye keken gi me bedo leng pi woro jogi, ma gicito i poti me woro jogi, kun giwoto i tyeng, ma gicamo ringo opego ki gin mogo me kwer ki oyo adeng, gin ducu gibitum woko lawangacel.<verse eid="ISA 66:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 66:18" />Pien angeyo ticgi ki tamgi, abibino me coko rok ducu ma loko leb mapatpat kacel; gin gibibino ci gineno deyona, <verse eid="ISA 66:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 66:19" />abiketo lanyut ikin gi. Abikwanyo jo mubwot ki ikin gi kenyo, abicwalogi bot lurok, bot jo Tarcic, Put ki Lud, ma gin jo ma gitelo atum, bot jo Tubal ki Javan, ki i lobo matye i dog nam kamabor, ma pud peya guwinyo kit ma nyinga oywek kwede, kadi neno deyona ikin rok. <verse eid="ISA 66:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 66:20" />Gibikelo utmegigi ki i rok ducu macalo gityer me atyera bot Rwot, kun gikelogi ki aguragura, gadigadi, kitara, kana ki kinagagu wa iwi got mera maleng matye i Jerucalem, kit macalo jo Icrael kelo kwede gityergi me moko kwon i atabo maleng i Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="ISA 66:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 66:21" />Abikwanyo jo mukene ikin gi bene me bedo ajwaki ki Lulevi.<verse eid="ISA 66:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 66:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">66:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:17">Ica 65:17</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:13">2 Pet 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:1">Niy 21:1</ref></char>
    </note> Kit macalo polo manyen ki lobo manyen ma abitiyo, birii inyima, kitmeno likwayowu kadiwa nyingwu bene birii inyima. <verse eid="ISA 66:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 66:23" />Cake i Karama me Por Dwe o kwede i Karama me Por Dwe, cake Cabit o kwede i Cabit mukene jo ducu gibibino inyima ka wora.<verse eid="ISA 66:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 66:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">66:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 9:48">Mar 9:48</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Gibikato woko ci gicito kaneno kom dano ma oto mayam onongo gujemo woko ikoma, pien kwidi ma camo komgini pe to, mac ma iye bene pe kiromo nekone, gin gudoko gin ma i dano ducu okwero.”<verse eid="ISA 66:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 66" />
</usx>